\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ydillicon super Decretum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Decretum abbreviatum). \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tytulus istius libri est Ydillicon super Decretum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et est Ydillicon idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod plana scriptura et prosa precedit quemlibet versum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sciendum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 quod modus agendi libri Decretorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ditiguitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in tres partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quarum prima ministris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 secunda negociis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tercia deputatur ecclesiasticis sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nec coram se turpes ludes fieri paciantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  De con. di. v non opertet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quintaque confirmat populum ieiunia sanctit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 officiat clerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  monachos docet atque libellum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Concludendo docet processum pneumatis almi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De processu spiritus sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dictum est supra de vita monachorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur videre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ultimo de processo spiritus sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 enim loquetur a semetipso sed quicumque audierit loquetur etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Schulte, Bd. 2, S. 491, Anm. 6; Stintzing, Geschichte, 1867 (1959), S. 43; Stickler, Decretistica, 1956, S. 604; zu den Versen vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 14571}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 762}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 408\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 5,1, S. 93; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Kassel, UB \endash  LMB, Fol. Ms. iurid. 17}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (mit wei\-terer Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung). \endash  60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

