\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Declarationes, regulae ordinatoris et tabulae in Disticha Catonis. (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Declarationes et regule ordinatoris libelli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 R)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 ubricarum due premittuntur divine relique morales}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  binas sortiuntur protillans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prima est de moribus in te ipso \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tabula ad prescripta versus libelli cadentes subdiversis rubricis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sub prima rubrica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Illum immittare deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 proximus ille deo est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Esto sorti animo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit tabula totaque ordinacionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Cathonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Rubrikatorregeln und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rubrikenverzeichnis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  f\u252 \'fcr Disticha Catonis, aber wohl nicht f\u252 \'fcr die unmittelbar voraus\-gehende Auswahl (s. 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). \endash  154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

