\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Oglerius de Locedio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Planctus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de compassione beatae Mariae virginis (\u8218 \'82Quis dabit\lquote ). (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quis dabit capiti meo aquam et oculis meis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ymbrem lacrimarum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Jer 9,1), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut possim flere die ac nocte donec servo suo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  dominus Jesus appareat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ibi remansit in domo sua et eam Johannes retinuit et sicut propriam matrem omni corde amavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sepulto ergo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 domino signatum est monumentum et traditum est custodibus vel custodierunt illud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Interim Maria in domo Johannis residebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et mortem sicut presens dies demonstrat cunctis a parte laus deo patri simul filioque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Planctus beati Bernhardi de compassione beate virginis super mortem filii eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Schlu\u223 \'df gegen\u252 \'fcber dem Druck stark erweitert; Druck: C. W. Marx, The Quis dabit of Oglerius de Tridino, Monk and Abbot of Locedio, in: Journal of Medieval Latin, 4 (1994), S. 118 \endash  129, bes. S. 122 \endash  129; zu Verfasser, Drucken und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebenda, S. 118 \endash  122; ders., The Edge of Orthodoxy: The Virgin Mary, St. Bernard and the \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quis dabit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in: Renate Bauer/ Ulrike Krischke (Hrsg.), Fact and Fiction. From the Middle Ages to the Modern Times. Essays Presented to Hans Sauer on the Ocassion of his 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Birthday, Part 3, Frankfurt am Main u. a. 2011 (M\u252 \'fcnchener Universit\u228 \'e4tsschriften, Bd. 37), S. 127 \endash  139; Cardelle de Hartmann, Dialoge, 2007, S. 712 \endash  713, Nr. A7. \endash  205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

