\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Publius Vergilius Maro}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bucolica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum excerpta ex commentario Servii. Text beginnt: (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Meliboeus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Titire tu patule recubans sub tegmine fagi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 silvestrem musam tenui meditarus avena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ite domum sature venit Hesperus ite capelle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Heyne, Virgilius Opera, Bd. 1 (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1830) (Reprint Hildesheim 1968), S. 54 \endash  249; R. A. B. Mynors (Hrsg.), P. Vergili Maronis Opera, Oxford \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1969 (Scriptorum Classicorum Bibliotheca Oxoniensis), S. 1 \endash  28; Silvia Ottaviano/ Gian Biagio Contes (Hrsg.), Publius Vergilius Maro Bucolica et Georgica, Berlin/ Boston 2013, (Bibliotheca scriptorum Graecorum et Romanorum Teubneriana, Bd. 2011), S. 37 \endash  85. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Introducitur quidam pastor iacens sub arbore secutus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar endet: \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ite domum sature\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Verecunde se capellarum dicit esse custodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pro Hespernum finem accipe quasi dicat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 O vos egloge sature id est perfecte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 finem buccolicorum facite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Marginaler Kommentar und interlineare Glossen; Schlu\u223 \'df abweichend; der Kommentar des Servius in der Regel als Exzerpte; Druck: Thilo/ Hagen, Servii Grammatici in Vergilii, 1881 \endash  1887 (1961), Bd. 3,1, S. 4 \endash  127. }

