\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Adamus Magister}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summula de Summa Raymundi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum commentario, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summula de summa Reymundi prodiit istam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (C)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 riminia sunt plura carnis secreta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 legentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Investigator caveat ne simplicitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 simplicium frangat et corda fidelia ledat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si non transisset hominum scelus istud in usum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scribere crudele nimis hoc foret et onerosum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc paucos homines quamvis corrumpat absit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut sit commune, nimis est, cum sit speciale et finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Schlu\u223 \'df fehlt; die Reihenfolge der letzen Verse im Vergleich zum Druck abweichend; Druck (mit abweichendem Kommentar): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 00213 \endash  00217}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 1 Sp.91a \endash  1 Sp.92a; vgl. Stintzing, Geschichte, 1867, S. 502 \endash  503; Schulte, Bd. 2, S. 427 \endash  428; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, Scriptores, Nr. 3}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Bloomfield, Nr. 969; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 2668 und 5852}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, Nr. 2668 und 5852; Michaud-Quantin, Sommes, 1962, S. 41; Valls Taberner, Summula, 1938, S. 69 \endash  83; zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 9117 und 18795}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; VL(2), Bd. 1 (1978), Sp. 47 \endash  50 (Franz-Joseph Worstbrock); C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 1 (2000), S. 20 (Simona Polidori); Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2664}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 4, S. 256 \endash  259, Nr. 166; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 27}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2673}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2686}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA ULB Kat. 5,2, i. Vb. und Fragment {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 3157 (5)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Der Anfang fehlt aufgrund von Beschneiden des Kopfsteges; Glosse beginnt: <...> \u9553 \'a6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de ignobilibus licet per certitudinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Presens autem opusculum modicum quatuor notabile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Titulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Summula Reymundi metrice collecta a quodam Jacobita predicatore nomine Adam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dicitur summula diminutive ad doctrinam summe parvulis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dicitur Reymundi, nam Reymundus hanc noticiam tradidit principaliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste liber prima divisione dividitur in partem prohimealem et executivam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota ille species luxurie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quas auctor non vult revelare, dicuntur ignominabiles et peccata muta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Illa particula non solum sunt horribilia sed peyora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sunt quasi demonica peccata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut vult Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sunt enim lepre quasi insanabiles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  rabies et prompta mors hominum absorbens et vivos ad tartara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Im Anschlu\u223 \'df Nachtrag De festis mit Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In summis festis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  que quatuor esse memento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 corpora non alique defunctorum turmulentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 omnibus officium de sanctis dum canis ipsa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cantetur tamen prefatio quotidiana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si cadet in lucem divini requies animarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Credo die divini tenet omnis circulus anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Illa quatuor festa sunt dies nativitatis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dies resurrectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dies ascensionis et dies penthecostes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota gloria in excelsis cantatur omnibus Dominicis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In adventu autem cum cantatur rorate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tunc etiam non cantatur ite missa etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Vermerk, Kopfsteg, beschnitten: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et mitte eas stare per duas dies et post a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 iterum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  <...>\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 stare per duas dies et post et iterum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <...> \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad tercium diebus a efficiuntur ita recentes sicut cadunt de arboribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vielleicht aus einem Rezept; sonst leer; 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Buchstabe \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 k\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , sonst leer; 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

