\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistola}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de modo studendi. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistola gloriosissimi doctoris beati Thome de Aquino missa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : [Q]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 uidam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fratri interroganti eum inter ceteram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qualiter sit intendendi studio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quia quesisti a me qualiter te studere oporteat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 id attingere poteris quod affectas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hanc quippe salutarem epistolam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cenobitalem tecum habueris cenobitalem in cellula exhor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [ta]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tor ut cum ea iugiter fabuleris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sicque de virtute possis in virtute usque in eternum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Mandonnet, S. Thomae Aquinatis \u8230 \'85 Opuscula omnia, 1927, Bd. 4, Nr. 44, S. 535; Verardo, Opuscula theologica, 1954, S. 451; vgl. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 4, Nr. 14fh.); Dondaine/ Shooner, Codices Thomae de Aquino, Bd. 1, S. 98, Nr. 261A; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 33,9 (2012), S. 139 \endash  146; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 546}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 4, S. 152; und in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 79}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA ULB Kat. 5,2.}

