\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pontius Pilatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistola}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ad Claudium regem Romae. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pontius Pylatus Claudio cesari salutem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nuper accedit quod ipse probavi Judeos per invidiam se suoque posteros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et extimet credendum mendaciis Judeorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Constantin von Tischendorf, Evangelia Apocrypha ..., Leipzig \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1876, S. 413 \endash  416; Dobsch\u252 \'fctz, Christusbilder, 1899 (s. 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 184** \endash  187**; vgl. ebenda, S. 157** \endash  162**. }

