\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Jacobus de Vitriaco}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Historia Orientalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Buch 1, Kapitel 94 \endash  95 (der Ausgabe von 2008, s.u.). (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cathalogus Regum Jerusalem Latinorum de preliis eorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Kapitel 95: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Primus quidem Latinorum, qui regni Jerusalemitani dominum obtinuit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fuit vir deo amabilis dux Godefridus de Builon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quibusdam comiti faventibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 aliis autem regi adherentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Kapitel 94: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De flagellis dei et angustiis populi et amissione terre sancte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quis enumerare sufficiat mira magna opera domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ob hanc causam magne erant discordie et dissentiones inter regni nostri barones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et hic auctor huius operis forsan morte preventus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  que postea successerunt sive facta fuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in partibus illis non descripsit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Jean Donnadieu (Hrsg.), Jacques de Vitry. Histoire orientale. Historia orientalis, Turnhout 2008 (Sous la r\u232 \'e8gle de saint Augustin, Bd. 12), S. 424 \endash  438 und 419 \endash  424; vgl. Kr\u252 \'fcger, Darmst\u228 \'e4dter Handschrift, 1956 (s. Lit.), bes. S. 202 \endash  203; EMC (2010), Bd. 2, S. 901. }

