\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Jacobus de Voragine}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Legenda aurea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt (De Machumeto). (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De Machumeto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Clericus quidam valde famosus cum in}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Romana curis honorem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quem cupiebat assequi non potuisset indignatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in die iudicii Machumeto interveniente, ut asserunt, salvus erit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Unmittelbar anschlie\u223 \'dfend Rasur, nicht mehr lesbar. \endash  Exzerpt aus dem Kapitel De sancto Pelagio Papa; Druck: Graesse, Legenda Aurea, 1890/ 1965, S. 827 \endash  831; Maggioni, Legenda Aurea, 1998, S. 1261, (77) \endash  1266 (143); Fortsetzung s. 113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

