\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Tudeschis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Flores Utriusque Juris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik durch Beschneiden verloren. Text beginnt: ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 A)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 rma et leges mutuo ad invicem indigent consilio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 utile non debet per inutile viciari de regulis juris in vi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et est finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt Flores Utriusque Juris finite anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  xxxiiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Feria Quinta post Festum Natalis Domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  que erat tricesima dies mensis Decembris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (30. Dezember 1434)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 12881}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Schulte, Bd. 2, S. 312 \endash  313, bes. S. 313, Nr. 7; Stintzing, Geschichte, 1867, S. 123 \endash  126; Stanislas Bormans, Les Flores utriusque juris de Hocsem, in: Compte rendu des S\u233 \'e9ances de la Commission Royale D\rquote Histoire, 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  s\u233 \'e9rie, 13 (1886), S. 207 \endash  224. }

