\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Henricus de Frimaria}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  <senior>, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus de decem praeceptis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum tabula rerum. (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 A)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 udi Israel precepta domini}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et ea in corde tuo quasi in libro scribe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In istis verbis propositis spiritus sanctus tria circa divina precepta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tangit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (P)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 rimum preceptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Appropriate respicit personarum patris quantum ad voluntarium obsequium \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 q\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  omnis operacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ecimum preceptum est: Non concupisces uxorem proximi tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ubi prohibetur omnis concupiscencia carnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc est vinum, quod letificat deum et homines ut scribitur Judicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod vinum nobis meritis gloriose virginis prestare dignetur eius filius benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui vivit et regnat deus in secula seculorum amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur tabula preceptorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tabula preceptorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: (U)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 t autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In hoc tractatum contenta legenti prompcius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 commutetur in vinum divine consolacionis et dulcedinem mentalis devocionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt tabule supra tractatum decem preceptorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Edite ad laudem dei pro fidelium et simplicium instruccione a fratre Henrico de Vr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 maria sacre theologie professore Ordinis Heremitarum sancti Augustini. Scripte nec non finite anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  xxxviii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ipso Die Invencionis sancte Crucis hora Vesperarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per me Henricum pro tempore plebanum in Broel etc. Laus tibi sit Christe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quoniam liber explicit iste etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 12199 \endash  12212}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 10Sp.630a; vgl. Clemens Stroick, Heinrich von Friemar. Leben, Werke, philosophisch-theologische Stellung in der Scholastik, Freiburg 1954, S. 37 \endash  45; Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, S. 230, Nr. 345am.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB, Nr. 3172}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und Supplement; Madre, Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, 1965, S. 330 \endash  331; Zumkeller, Manuskripte, 1966, S. 144 \endash  152, Nr. 325; Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 526; Mohan, Initia, 1975 \endash  1978, (1975), S. 36*; Hohmann, Initienregister, 1976, S. 403; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, Nr. 526; VL(2), Bd. 3 (1981), Sp. 730 \endash  737, bes. Sp. 733 (Robert G. Warnock); van Dijk, Prolegomena, 2003, S. 597. }

