\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  De arte grammatica latina. (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Grammatica est scientia literaria. Eius partes sunt quattuor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 littera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sillaba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dictio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Artificium quadruplex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ortographia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ethimologia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dyasinthetica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 prosodia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ortographia precipit de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 recta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 literarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pronunciacione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Litera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 Liter\u281 \'ea seu elementa in alphabeto latino sunt 23\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Media multiplicandarum dictionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad inveniendum facile multa substantiva habeatur hic modus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et varietatem habendam puta casus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  numeros et figuras, tempora personas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  species\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  gradus et huiusmodi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De elocutione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Paucis nunc summatim de elocutione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod ad solutam attinet oracionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Demonstratio est cum res gesta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 late\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et apte verbis exprimitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut quasi geri videatur et oculis obici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs26 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De quantitatibus syllabarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De quantitatibus syllabarum scripturus primum cum Alexandro et aliis etiam maioris auctoritatis viris prefabor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Regule generales sunt sexdecim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prima est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quanta fuerit syllaba primitivi tanta est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Septima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Preterita disyllabam primam producunt ut emi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 -\u9553 \'a6. \endash  Text bricht unvermittelt ab; vielleicht {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vorlesungsmitschrift}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?); das Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich wie Vincentius Gr\u252 \'fcner, Grammatica latina; vgl. Bursill-Hall, Census, 1981, S. 316. \endash  33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

