\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Leonardo Bruni}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vita del Petrarca}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vita del Petrarcha per lo prefato Leonardo Aretino composta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Francescho Petrarcha huomo di grande ingegno}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  & non di minor virtu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 e la corona talvolta per lieve giudicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cosi ad chi non merita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 come ad chi merita dare si puote\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Solerti, Le vite, [1904], (s. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 287 \endash  293; Baron, Leonardo Bruni Aretino, 1928/ 1969, S. 63 \endash  69; Viti, Opere letterarie, 1996 (s. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 553 \endash  560; vgl. Baron, Leonardo Bruni Aretino, 1928/ 1969, S. 175; Sottili, I codici, 1978, S. VIII, 439, Fu\u223 \'dfnote 1; Hankins, Repertorium Brunianum, 1997, S. 30, Nr. 344; Marcelli, Novella, 2003 (s. Lit.), S. 51; Berti, Cicerone, 2010 (s. Lit.), S. 59. }

