\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Marcus Tullius Cicero}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pro Marcello}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (ital.), Translatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Leonardo Bruni}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Preambulo fatto a una oratione di M. Tullio Cicerone a Cato c\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sare per la restitutione di Marco Marcello\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dopo le bactaglie civili}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 essendo rimaso vincitore della battaglia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Caio c\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oratione di M. T. Cicerone per Leonardo Aretino vulgarizata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 A lungho silentio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 padri conscripti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 il quale io a questi tempi ho usato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per questo che tu hai fatto oggi a meriti che tu havevi facto in anzi verso di me e stato aggiunto grandissimo acrescimento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Luigi Maria Rezzi (Hrsg.), Le tre orazioni di Marco Tullio Cicerone dette dinanzi a cesare per M. Marcello, Q. Ligario e il re Dejotaro volgarizzate da Brunetto Latini ..., Mailand 1832, S. 138 \endash  158; Berti, Cicerone, 2010 (s. Lit.), S. 169 \endash  183; vgl. ebenda, S. 5, 13 \endash  15, 25, 49 \endash  50, 59 \endash  60, 120 \endash  122, 126, 145, 147 \endash  149, 154 \endash  161, 163, 166, Sigle D; demnach geh\u246 \'f6rt die Handschrift der Familie \u223 \'df an und bildet selbst die Vorlage f\u252 \'fcr vier bis f\u252 \'fcnf weitere Handschriften; vgl. ferner Baron, Leonardo Bruni Aretino, 1928/ 1969, S. 186; Hankins, Repertorium Brunianum, 1997, S. 30, Nr. 344; Marcelli, Novella, 2003 (s. Lit.), S. 51.}

