\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Giovanni Boccaccio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Il Decamerone}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Quarta Giornata, Novella Prima (Tancredi e Gismonda). (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Favola di messere Giovanni Bochaccio recitata dalla Fiametta nella iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  giornata del suo libro Decameron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Argumento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tancredi prenze di Salerno uccide l\rquote amante della figliuola}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tancredi prenze di Salerno fu signore assai humano et di benigno ingegno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Salernitani honore volmente amendue in una medesima sepoltura gli fece sepellire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Natalino Sapegno (Hrsg.), Giovanni Boccaccio Decameron, Turin \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1956, Mailand \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1989 (I Classici italiani TEA), S. 384 \endash  396; Vittore Branca (Hrsg.), Giovanni Boccaccio. Decameron. Sesta edizione riveduta e corretta, aggiornata nelle bibliografie al 1991, Turin \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1980/ \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 13\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1997 (Nuova Universale Einaudi, Bd. 169), S. 471 \endash  486; vgl. ders., Tradizione, 1958 /1991 (s. 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), Bd. 2 (1991), S. 17, 62, 75 \endash  76; Dallapiazza, Boccaccio-Handschriften, 1988 (s. Lit.), S. 30; Marcelli, Novella, 2003 (s. Lit.), S. 51; Cursi, Il \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Decameron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 2007 (s. Lit.), Tafel 90 (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 14, 120 \endash  121, 132, 154, 176 \endash  177; Berti, Cicerone, 2010 (s. Lit.), S. 59. \endash  28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

