\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vita}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  et Statura BMV. (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur vita et statura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 beate Marie virginis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Si dicit dei genitrix Ebraycas literas ad huc pater eius Ioachim}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Post ascensionem domini fuit a domo sancti Johannis Ewangeliste xxiiii annis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui simul comparatus sunt lxxii anni etc. et est finis huius materie etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

