\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Versus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de diversis. 1. (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) De cura et timore mortis. Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item alii versus de cura et timore mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nunc homo, non homo etas nunc ortus, mortuus es cras}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nunc homo cras scories nunc homo cras humus es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mundum despicias et eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vaga gaudia cina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 huius ut inspicias finem lege carmina dura.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Vgl. Roth, Mittellat. Hss., 1891, S. 259; der letzte Vers: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Nr. II/2, 15631}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 2. (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Quid inde-Verse. (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) a. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si dominor terre super omnia regna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quid inde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; b. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si cesar fuere caput orbis papa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; c. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si mihi divicie, si gemma metalla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; d. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ars mihi si toto Salomonis nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; e. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pulchrior Abselomus me forma decora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; f. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si mihi maiores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vires \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sampsone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; g. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si mihi non nullus similis virtute\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; h. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si locuplex fuerit dapibus mea mensa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; i. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Fercula diversa si sint mihi lania\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; j. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si crapula fuerit mihi cottidiana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; k. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum bacho pugnem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod pur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  honore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) l. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si metuant monasteria maris terrena\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; m. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si mihi sponsa decens formosa pudica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : n. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si rota fortune me tollit ad astra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; o. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si mihi sub sole sunt cuncta creata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; p. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si doceam socias de qualibet arte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; q. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si annis mille felix regnabo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; r. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tam cito preterient hec omnia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  17 Verse; ein Teil (a, b, g, h, i, j, m, o, r) bei Henricus de Langenstein, Epistola de contemptu mundi ad Johannem de Eberstein; Textabgleich mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M. ch. f. 53}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 15819 \endash  9, 15, 16, 20; 17711 (a); 17769 (h); 17898 (m); 17959 (n)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 3. (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vita brevis non pena levis sed arma Jehenne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Omne querit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod est et erit memorare perhenne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Post finem vite dat rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tonare venite.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \u196 \'c4hnlich {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 14316a}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Res male quesite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 claudent circa anta vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mentes prospicite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod non est mihi redite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ergo res fugite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 regnum celeste sicite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

