\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Carmen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de gallo et presbytero. (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Multi sunt prespiteri, qui ignorant quare supra domum domini gallus solet stare}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tenati memorie quasi nux muscata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 plus reddit aromata bene mesticata \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!). \endash  Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 AH, Bd. 33, S. 190 \endash  193}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Hans Rheinfelder, Materialien zu dem mittelalterlichen Gedicht \u8218 \'82Multi sunt presbyteri\lquote , in: Zeitschrift f\u252 \'fcr romanische Philologie 67 (1951), S. 124 \endash  130; S. 125 \endash  126; u.\u246 \'f6. vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, Nr. 19725}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 11388}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Federproben; 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

