\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gregorius IX. Papa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bulla}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8218 \'82Tenorem quarundam litterarum\lquote  (inseriert: Urbanus V. Papa, Bulla \u8218 \'82Ne in vinea\lquote ). (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Copia bulle domini Urbani Pape V. super reformacione quarundam consuetudinum in diversis monasteriis ac capitulis hactenus observatum in recepcione novitiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod nichil ab eis sit petendum ve lexigendum nisi quantum presens bulla adimittit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!). (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gregorius episcopus servus servorum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad futuram rei memoriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tenorem quarundam literarum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  felicis recordacionis Urbani Pape quinti predecessoris nostri registro ipsius repertum presentibus annotari fecimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui est talis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Urbanus episcopus servus servorum dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad perpetuam rei memoriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ne in vinea domini nostri licet insufficientibus meritis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Datum Rome apud sanctum Petrum pridie Nonas Aprilis pontificatus nostri anno septimo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (4. April 1369). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ceterum ut earum literarum tenor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et eidem stetur firmiter in omnibus sicud eisdem originalibus literis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si forent exhibite vel ostense\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nulli ergo etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut supra nostre constitucionis infugere vel etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Datum Avinione xii Kalendis Martii pontificatus nostri anno secundo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (18. Februar 1372). \endash  Druck: Thomas Ripoll (Hrsg.), Bullarium ordinis FF. Praedicatorum, Bd. 7, Rom 1739, S. 64 \endash  65; (der inserierten Urkunde Urbans V.): Corpus Iuris Canonici, 1959, Bd. 2, Sp. 1287 \endash  1288; Text der inserierten Urkunde auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 323}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 4, S. 26; und in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 815}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

