\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Von der Armut eines geistlichen Menschen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De alre starkste rede ynt ga\u1265 ?n alle sunden synt dese}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De eirste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 is artmode\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dat du in allen d\u1265 ?ngen artmode lides neit alleyn van dingen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  de du begers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De ander rait is versmacheit des menschen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De dirde rait is scharpe m\u1265 ?sterschaff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De virde rait is eyn vervreymd\u252 \'fcnge van wereklicher geselschaff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dey v. rait is stedich gebet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Die seiste rait is degeliche castige off \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (t)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ribulatien\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dat vii punt is dat stede over dencken des doitz und des loyntz unser wercken\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dyt was in deme hertzen der edelre moit Marien alle armoede van deme ich beschreven hayn, darumme steynt sy ledich alre begerden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

