\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  De creatione coeli et terrae. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit genealogia celi et terre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Medaillon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In principio creavit deus celum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Lyra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Id est corpora celestia omnia in suis formis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Beda et Strabus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sicut dicunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Creavit deus celum scilicet empireum statim angelis sanctis impletum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Terra autem erat inanis et vacua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quia illa materia non erat in formas speciales distincta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic Lira\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 accipitur pro voluntate sicut voluntas artificis est super materiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik in Medaillon: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sabbatum requiecionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Septimo die requievit deus ab omni opere quid patravat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!)<. \endash  Kleine {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sch\u246 \'f6pfungsgeschichte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , kompiliert aus kurzen Zitaten der Bibel und der Kirchenv\u228 \'e4ter (Beda Venerabilis, Strabo, Nicolaus de Lyra etc.). }

