\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Vocabula Grecismi Eberhardi, lat.-dt. (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pater cura ut abbas, genitricione ut genitricio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 etate ut sexta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 honore ut papa,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 creatione ut deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sanguis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Blut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cruor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Blutswei\u223 \'df\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 puppillus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 muterlos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 orphanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vaterlo\u223 \'df\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sed magis proprie orphanus dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui caret patre et matre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 crescere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 wachsen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pascere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 furen et pascere id est depascere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 abetzen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finita sunt vocabula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Grecismi in die Laurentii milesimo quadringentesimo septuag\plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 inta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (10. August 1475) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sub venerabili magistro Petro Witman etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Lateinisch-deutsches {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vokabular}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zu Eberhardus Bethuniensis, Graecismus cum Glossa, Kapitel 9 bis 19 (s.o. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ); die Datierung am Schlu\u223 \'df korrigiert, nicht eindeutig lesbar (s.o. Geschichte). \endash  129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

