\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Disticha Catonis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum Glossa. Text beginnt: (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum animadverterem quam plurimos homines errare graviter}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in via morum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Miraris verbis nudis me scribere versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc brevitas fecit sensus coniugere binos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f2\i\lang1032\fs26 \u932 \'d4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse beginnt marginal, Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Titulus libri est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit apocrisus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de preceptis apocrisus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ignore auctoritatis quia eius autor ignoratur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste liber prima sui divisione dividitur in partem prohemialem et partem executivam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pars executiva incipit ibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Itaque deo supplica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Animadverterem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc animadvertis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod percipitur ibi mente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse endet interlinear zu \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 miraris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pro mito habens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8218 \'82 \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 coniugere binos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scilicet versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text mit zahlreichen marginalen und interlinearen Glossen; enthalten sind (in der Reihenfolge der Handschrift): epistula, breves sententiae 1 \endash  15, 20, 28 \endash  30, 31, 16, 17, 21, 18, 22, 23, 19, 24, 40, 25 \endash  27, 38, 31, 39, 41, 33, 43, 42, 34, 45, 35 \endash  37, 47, 52, 48, 54, 51, 46, 50, 53, 55, 49; Liber 1, 1 \endash  12, 13, 14, 15 \endash  31, 32 \endash  40; praefatio ad librum 2, 1 \endash  7, 8, 10, 9; liber 2, 1 \endash  7, 8 \endash  14, 16, 15, 17 \endash  21, 22 \endash  31; praefatio ad librum 3, 1 \endash  2; liber 3, 1; praefatio ad librum 3, 3 \endash  4; liber 3, 2 \endash  8, 9 \endash  13, 15, 14, 17, 16, 18 \endash  21, 22 \endash  24; praefatio ad librum 4; liber 4, 1 \endash  25, 26 \endash  36, 36a,2, 37 \endash  49; Druck (Text): Boas/ Botschuyver, Disticha Catonis, 1952, S. 4 \endash  259; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 3551}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Zumkeller, Manuskripte, 1966, Nr. 435; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2481}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Auswahl); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2640}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  . \endash  155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Federproben, darunter lateinisches Sprichwort: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Qui bene vivit numquam deabolus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  eum accipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

