\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Garlandia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber de compositionibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 A)m si proponas puto scindit de dat in infert}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Extrahit ad ac aufert dic exemo figure\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nota quandocumque ista litera philosophi sequitur nec in compositione tunc nec semper mutatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec dico, significat, confirmo copula sacro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text endet unvermittelt; auf dem ersten Blatt mit z.T. sehr ausf\u252 \'fchrlichen Glossen; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 885}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Bursill-Hall, Johannes de Garlandia, 1976, S. 172 \endash  173, Nr. 18; VL(2), Bd. 4 (1983), Sp. 612 \endash  623 (Franz-Josef Worstbrock); Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2225}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

