\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Albertus Magnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  super librum primum Physicorum Aristotelis, Fragment. (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 C)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 irca primum librum Phisicorum sit prima questio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Utrum tantum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 duo vel tria sunt nature principia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ideo prima semper \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  numeratur numero principorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (A)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 d questionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quasi queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum nature prima principia in oppositione principia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 aliud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui quidem habitus est quodammodo cum forma \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u9553 \'a6 \endash  Text bricht aufgrund von Blattverlusten ab; enthalten sind zwei Quaestionen zu Liber 1, Tractatus 3, Capitulum IX; vgl. C.A.L.M.A., Bd. I,2 (2002), S. 121 \endash  132 (Lidia Lanza), bes. S. 131, Nr. 90; Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, S. 25 \endash  32, bes. S. 32, Nr. 41; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Strasbourg, BNU, Ms 55}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (olim Frenswegen, Klosterbibliothek). }

