\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Carmen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  grammaticale de aequivocis et synonimis cum clossis. (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) De aequivocis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Admittit}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 recipit}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 peccat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 calcaribus urget}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Est acies belli ferri dices et ocelli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) De Synonimis.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Gratulor exulto letor vel gaudeo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  plaudo orator iocundo, mitteo cum taceo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  mitesco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  silesco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prodigus est animi vicio retinenda profundens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Exul abit sine spe pariter reditusque reique\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26   ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quisque relegatus sua cum remeabit abibit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (statt: remearit habebit). \endash  Kompilation, u.a. mit Zitaten aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Garlandia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Eberhardus Bethuniensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Alexander de Villa Dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Alexander Neckam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text mit zahlreichen marginalen und interlinearen Glossen, Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen, Nachtr\u228 \'e4gen, zus\u228 \'e4tzlichen Versen und Zitaten von mehreren, wenig sp\u228 \'e4teren H\u228 \'e4nden; endet mit Exzerpten aus: 1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Marbodus Redonensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , De ornamentis verborum, \u8218 \'82De diffinitione\lquote , (vier Verse); Druck: PL, Bd. 171, \u167 \'a7 18, Sp. 1691; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 14784}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 2. aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Alexander Neckam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Sacerdos ad altare, vier Verse aus Kapitel 8 (De eruditione scholarium); Druck: Christopher J. McDonough (Hrsg.), Alexandri Neckam Sacerdos ad altare, Turnhout 2010 (CC CM, Bd. 227), S. 182, Zeile 182 \endash  184. }

