\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Commentarius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Antidotarium {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nicolai Salernitani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Humanum corpus duobus regi theor}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 [et]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 ica scilicet et practica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Omnium recte philosophantium asserit diligentia et theor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [et]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ica enim sine practica pariter prodest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 practica sine theor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [et]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ica non tamen prodest licet obest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Johannes Nicholaus Salernitanus medicus communi omnium practicanzium utilitati invigilans ad istius compendiosi operis componi meliora et utiliora materis antidotarii compilando hic breve opus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aurea alexandrina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finitio prologo agit auctor de antidotibus et primo de aurea alexandrina, que maxime \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 opiata in passionibus capitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Zinziber conditum electuarium est calidus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ubi potest inveniri zinziber recens et viride\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Donec dirigat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  se stringi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scilicet donec remolliatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  jeweils auf den Fu\u223 \'dfstegen kurze, nachgetragene Rezeptnotizen; 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  auf dem Fu\u223 \'dfsteg mehrere Wort-Schemata dazu, welche Medikamente f\u252 \'fcr einzelne, ausgew\u228 \'e4hlte Organe n\u252 \'fctzlich sind. }

