\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Walther, Kenntni\u223 \'df, 1867, S. 134, Nr. 22\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Walther, Beitr\u228 \'e4ge, 1871, S.98, Nr. 21\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Hanno Wijsman, History in Transition: Enguerrand de Monstrelet\rquote s \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Chronique\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  in Manuscript and Print (c. 1450 \endash  c. 1600), in: Malcolm Walsby/ Graeme Kemp (Hrsg.), The Book Triumphant. Print in Transition in The Sixteenth and Seventeenth Centuries, Leiden/ Boston 2011 (Library of the Written Word, Bd. 15; The Handpress World, Bd. 9), S. 199 \endash  252, bes. S. 210 und 248.}

