\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 zwischen 17 und 18 beidseitig beschrifteter {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5260[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Papierzettel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , vielleicht als Lesezeichen eingelegt, 3 x 8,5; Bastarda, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 15. Jh. 1. H\u228 \'e4lfte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Theologische Verse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cis es}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 , cur queris, }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 gravis es}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 , non inde mireris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 fers dominum celi,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs22 cui servio vite fideli\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 tu quis,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs22 cur queris,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 gravis es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8218 \'82 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 non inde mireris, \plain \f1\i\ul\lang1033\fs22 fers dominum celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 tibi servio mente fideli. Versus Christoforis}

