 \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Cod. 5162}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; unmittelbar anschlie\u223 \'dfend vier Marienverse. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Haut in honore pie candelam porto Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 spiritus est ignis tribuendus non nisi dignumque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?).}

