\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Versus et {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 sententia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 1. De quindecim signis ante diem iudicii. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nota quindecimum sunt signa, que erunt ante diem iudicii}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sanctus Hieroninus dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 se legisse in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quodam libro post versus seqientes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Crescit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 decrescit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 canit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ardet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sangwynius ros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...\plain \f1\strike\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 astra cadunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fit mors exuscio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quique resurgunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  F\u252 \'fcnf {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Verse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  mit interlinearen Glossen; 2. De horis diei. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In media nocte spoliasti tartara Christe}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Completum canimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia tunc fuit ipse sepultus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Sieben Verse; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 K\u246 \'f6ln, HistASt, W 122}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Salamanca, BU, Ms 1974}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 3. De aetate Mariae. \endash  Vier Verse; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 20534}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 4. De trium regum. \endash  Vier Verse; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 19382}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer; 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Textanfang:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Si quis in peccato mortali exiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; sonst leer. }

