\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Verse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 R\u228 \'e4tsel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sprichw\u246 \'f6rter}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Notizen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Lateinisch und Mittelniederl\u228 \'e4ndisch. (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Notizen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De duobus modis scientiae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De natura lustrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Verse, u.a.: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deus aes nulla colunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sed siis synck\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 solunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  nolunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ergo sunt notum quatter troy solvere totum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Gemeint ist wohl: \u8222 \'84Deux ace non possunt et size-cinque solvere nolunt; et igitur notum quatre trey solvere totum.\ldblquote  Vgl. Henry G. Bohn, Handbook of Proverbs ..., London 1860, S. 19; anschlie\u223 \'dfend: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 18891}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, II/4, Nr. 27461}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; au\u223 \'dferdem Rezeptanfang (wohl korrupt); (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) u.a. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, II/8, Nr. 37717h1; II/3, 19420a}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Syt wylcom got weet, dat ghi brengt is v bereet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dat ghi siet mogedi begeren\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dat ghi brengt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 moeget ghi verteren\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 Gnade weerde doen z\u367 \'f9et \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 geleyde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In specte seget men duck waer... Die die gratie leset, sal voer drinken \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Die zieke end die gesende en helben niet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 een stonde. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

