\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  De duodecim signis Zodiaci, Ital. (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Del corso della Luna pro li xii segni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ciascuno< chel corso della Luna vorra sapere}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sappi prima come il Sole va pro li xii segni dimorando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Della natura et complexione di xii segni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aries significha il capo et la faccia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Delle xii case del cielo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hora e da vedere delle xii case del cielo sopra le quali corrono septe stelle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alcuni di terra come e Thauro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Virgho et Capricornio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et questo basti essere detto di segni xii celesti et loro qualita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Initium sehr \u228 \'e4hnlich wie ein dem {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hermes Trismegistus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zugeschriebener lateinischer {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Traktat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; es k\u246 \'f6nnte sich um eine \u220 \'dcbersetzung handeln; vgl. Carmody, Arabic Sciences, S. 66, Nr. 33; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre, 1963, Sp. 1205}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Erfurt, UFB, Dep. Erf. CA. 8\u176 \'b0 80}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 London, BL, Ms Sloane 702}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 M\u252 \'fcnchen, UB, 2\u176 \'b0 Cod. Ms. 738}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vorsatz vorne \endash  2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

