\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  De septem planetis, Ital. (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De septe pianeti et loro natura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sono septe l\rquote  pianeti celesti}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 ,}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  cioe Saturno}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Giove}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Marte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Venere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mercurio et Luna \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Della significatione di dodici segni celesti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aries e detto da Abraam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  che offerse el montone a dio pel\rquote  figliuolo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Piscis e detto per Giona propheta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  che fette nel ventre del pesce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Della significatione di septe pianeti del cielo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sole significa spirito cioe l\rquote anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Della distantia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  che si dice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  e tral celo et la terra sicondo i phylosophi et theologi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dalla terra che e infinia pro insino alla luna sone miglia xv\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  vi\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  xxv \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et se non dai fede all auctore misura se puoi ledette distancie et troverai el proprio vero della cosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mati consiglio sia meglio credere che andare a te rcharlo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \endash  Bis auf eine kurze Passage zu den Sternkreiszeichen (s.o.) behandeln alle Abschnitte die sieben Planeten, ihren Lauf, ihre Natur, ihre Eigenschaften etc. }

