\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Prognostica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de temporum conditionibus, Ital. (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota sicondo Alberto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quando di verno cioe del mese di Dicembre o di Gennaio sono tuoni assai}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota sicondo Beda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Conciosia cosa che io abbi titulato la temperantia della luna \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nel mese d\rquote Aprile se il cielo tonera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 La ter\u231 \'e7a nocte di Maggio se tonera sara pestilentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nel ventre della madre loro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. PL, Bd. 90, Sp. 611.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) De temporum conditionibus secundum Esdram prophetam, Ital. (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota i tempi d\rquote Esdra propheta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Se Calende di Gennaio verra in Domenica sara el verno caldo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Lunedi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Se nelle siconda feria cioe in Lunedi sara verno comunale \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sabato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Se in Sabato sara el verno ventosa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 molti animali moriano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Italienische \u220 \'dcbersetzung der bekannten Wetterprognostik; vgl. Gerhard Eis (Hrsg.), Wahrsagetexte des Sp\u228 \'e4tmittelalters, Berlin 1956 (Texte des sp\u228 \'e4ten Mittelalters, Heft 1), S. 24 \endash  25 und 66 \endash  68; eine lateinische Fassung auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1410}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Proverbia de temporum conditionibus, Lat.-Ital. (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota certe regole sicondo gli antichi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Clara dies Pauli larghas fruges indicat anni}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Che in Volgare dice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Che quando el di della conversione di san Paolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 moria duomini et d\rquote altri animali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Werner, Sprichw\u246 \'f6rter, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1966, S. 28, Nr. 46; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 226, 12}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 2827}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; das gleiche Sprichwort (lat.) auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2699}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ante dies octo Michaelis galla dat ista ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Che dice che di octo in an\u231 \'e7i san Michele tu pigli la galla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sara carescia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si pluit in festo Iacinthi et Martiniani imber erit nimius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 che vuole dire che se il di della festa di sancto Procintho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (verbessert zu: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 al processo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et san Martiniano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et sara gran verno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  \u196 \'c4hnlich {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 17853}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vincenti festo si sol radiat memor esto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cioe se li di di san Vincentio che e ad xxii di Gennaio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et muta ad suo modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, II/5, Nr. 33420}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 20346}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

