\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatuli}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de Divisione mundi, de cometae et de indictione, Ital. 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Della divisione del mondo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In tre parti e divisa tutta la machina del mondo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota de ventri sicondo si contiene nella infrascripta ruota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 El vento e aria commossa et agitata et pro diverse parti del cielo diversi nomi piglia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 e piu veloce del vento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota della comethe che e figurata in questo modo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...<. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 La comethe e una stella la quale chome una coma \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Endegas e numero dimidici anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota della inditione et da chi hebbe l\rquote orrigine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Caio Julio Cesare imperadore divise il mondo tutto et fenne piu parti indictione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 poi ci rifaremo dacapo et dire prima indictione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis. Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

