\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Interpretationes Somniorum Danielis Prophetae, Ital. (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Interpetrationi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  di sogni di Daniele propheta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  la quale fece in Babillonia nedi di Nabuchdonosor re di Babillonia, quando dimandava a principi delle citta et da tutto el populo el quale gli manifestava cio che egli avea veduto nel sogno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Allora Daniele questo scripse et allora l\rquote odie alleggiere dicente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Io son Daniele uno de figlioioli di Gerusalem, i quali presi di Gierusalem citta sancta, dove queste cose sono state facte, siamo stati menati qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Le quali cose non clame medesimo apparai, ma dal signore mio i dio lo havitte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Della visione nocturna sicondo la Luna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Luna prima cio che in essa vederai in gaudio si convertira}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota l\rquote altra significatione di sogni sicondo Daniele et e per alphabetho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Advedere uccelli contra se combattere ira significa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ci\u231 \'e7anie seminare \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Discordie grandissime significa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis Sompnialis Danielis prophete\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Beginnt mit 30 Mondorakeln f\u252 \'fcr die einzelnen Tage des Monats; anschlie\u223 \'dfend 180 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Traumdeutungen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; mit keiner der bislang bekannten italienischen Versionen identisch; zu den italienischen Fassungen vgl. Cappozzo, Dizionario, 2018; ders., The Transmission of the Somniale Danielis. From Latin to Vernacular Italian (Laurenziano Martelli 12 and Riccardiano 859), in: Translat Library 2,1 (2020), S. 1 \endash  34; Druck (lat. Fassung): Martin, Somniale Danielis, 1981; H\u233 \'e9lin, La clef des songes, 1977; zum Typus vgl. \u214 \'d6nnerfors, Traumb\u252 \'fccher, 1977, S. 32 \endash  57; Speckenbach, Traumb\u252 \'fccher, Bd. 2 (2013), S. 9 \endash  28; zur Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung vgl. http://www.mirabileweb.it/title/somniale-danielis-title/172196; Text (lat. Fassung, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig) auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2699}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

