\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bene Lucensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Computus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Lunaris, Ital. (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Computo del maestro Buono del corso del Sole et della Luna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Computo e scientia di certificare el tempo sicondo i progressi cioe corsi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  del Sole e della Luna \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In questi versi sono xix dictioni serventi a xix anni del cielo lunare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et questo al presente del Computo pro ragione de ro\u231 \'e7\u231 \'e7i sotto compendio di parole come di sopra basti hauere detto et di chiarato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Magistri Boni alias Bene Computus explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Laus deo omnispotenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Druck (der lateinischen Fassung): Gino Arrighi (Hrsg.), Bono da Lucca Computus Lunaris (1254), Lucca 1991 (Accademia Lucchese di scienze, lettere ed arti, Studi e Testi, Bd. 29), S. 4 \endash  26; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, S. 242}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Pierre-Maurice Duhem, Le syst\u232 \'e8me du monde. Histoire des doctrines cosmologiques de Platon \u224 \'e0 Copernic, 10 B\u228 \'e4nde, Paris 1913 \endash  1959, \plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 B\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 d. 4 (1954), S. 46 \endash  48; A. Mancini, Appunti su Maestro Bono, in: Bollettino storico lucchese Lucca 8 (1936), S. 31 \endash  42, bes. S. 37 \endash  42; Lynn Thorndike, Computus, in: Speculum. A Journal of Medieval Studies, 19 (1954), S. 223 \endash  238, bes. S. 232 \endash  233; C.A.L.M.A, Bd. 2,4 (2007), S. 490 \endash  491 (L. Lockett), bes. S. 491, Nr. 2; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Florenz, BN, Conv. Soppr. B. II. 370}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; zur lateinischen Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung vgl. https://www.mirabileweb.it/title/computus-lunaris-title/23228. }

