\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Jacobus de Voragine}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Legenda aurea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , De sancto Pelagio Papa, Exzerpte (De Machumeto). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Notanda sunt sequentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si quis velit sive quomodo qualiter vivant et quam legem habeant et quem adorant Zariacem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Advertendum est primo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 quod Zarracem seu Ysmahelite seu Agarem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod id est insequentes Machumetum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui in sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 prima eva\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 etate dum mercemonia excerceret et apud Egyptum et Palestinum cum camelis pergeret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et tamen post plures annos reveno sibi dato interiit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Auszug aus der Legenda Aurea (Kapitel 181) des Jacobus de Voragine \u252 \'fcber den Propheten Mohammed; Druck: Graesse, Legenda Aurea, 1890/ 1965, S. 828 \endash  834; Maggioni, Legenda Aurea, 1998, Bd. 2, S. 1262 \endash  1266\~; zu dem Exzerpt vgl. auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 231}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

