\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Valerius Maximus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Facta et dicta memorabilia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt aus Buch 4, Kapitel 7. (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Item refert Valerius Maximus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 quod Damon et Phitias}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  discipuli Pitagore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  tam fidelem inter se iunxerunt amiciciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et admiratus Tyrannus amborum animum supplicium fidei remisit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 eosque insuper ut ipsum in societatem amicitie tercium reciperent postulavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Exzerpt aus Kapitel 7, Ext. 1 \endash  2, De amicitia (Exempel von Damon und Pintias); Druck: Karl Kempf (Hrsg.), Valeri Maximi Factorum et Dictorum Memorabilium Libri Novem, Berlin 1854, S. 368 \endash  369; John Briscoe, Valeri Maximi Facta et Dicta Memorabilia, 2 B\u228 \'e4nde, Stuttgart/ Leipzig 1998 (Bibliotheca Scriptorum Graecorum et Romanorum Teubneriana), Bd. 1, S. 282 \endash  285. }

