\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Zitate}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zum Thema \u8218 \'82Amicitia\lquote . (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequuntur auctoritates\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Unde amicicia sic ait quidam philosophus nomine Ysocrates}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Neminem amicum consilies tibi priusquam percuncteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quo pacto se gesserit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In amiciciam et fidem stultum ne receperis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quoniam insipiencium facilius sustinetur odium quam collegium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Kurze Zitate zum Thema Freundschaft, u.a. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Theofrastus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Catho und Aristoteles zugeschrieben. }

