\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Secretum secretorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Translatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippi Tripolitani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), Exemplum aus Teil 3, Kapitel 14. (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Non esse confidendum in homine alterius secte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sapiens quidam docuit filium suum dicens: Non confidas homini alterius legis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ritus aut secte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Exemplo duorum virorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui occurrerunt sibi invicem in itinere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quorum unus erat magus Orientalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  alter Iudeus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rex autem civitatis illius audiens opera magi illius et advocans eum fecit ipsum secretarium et consiliarium suum propter pia opera et bonitatem legis sue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Steele, Secretum secretorum, 1920, S. 144 \endash  146; vgl. Schmitt/ Knox, Pseudo-Aristoteles Latinus, 1985, S. 54 \endash  75; Zamuner, La tradizione romanza, 2005, S. 31 \endash  116, zur Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung bes. S. 111 \endash  116; zum \u220 \'dcbersetzer {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippus Tripolitanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guido de Valencia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  vgl. Forster, Geheimnis, 2006, S. 120 \endash  129 (mit weiterer Lit.); Text vollst\u228 \'e4ndig auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2699}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .}

