\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Albertus Magnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In Aristotelis Libros De Generatione et Corruptione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber de generacione et corrupcione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De generatione et corruptione in communi simpliciter dictis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De prohemio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quo reclara\-tur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sit intentio libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum due sint consideraciones de mobili simplici}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber secundus de generatione et corruptione elementorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus i\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De principio materiali et formali elementorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Que libri sit intencio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In superiori libro egimus de mixtione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus iii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De causa transmutacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum i\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Que intencio tractatus que et quot principia transmutacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quia vero quidam sunt generabilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum xiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Que reiterantur eadem non et que non et quare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Principium autem rursus intencionis nostre querendum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 utrum omnia secundum unum modum et similiter reiterantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hec autem de generatione elementorum sufficiant dicta et cetera ad naturam elementorum pertinentia in tertio et quarto de celo et mundo dicta sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit commentum fratris Alberti super librum de generatione et corruptione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Druck: Paulus Hossfeld (Hrsg.), Alberti Magni Ordinis Fratrum Praedicatorum. De Natura Loci ad fidem autographi. De Causis Pro\-prietatum Elementorum ad fidem autographi. De Generatione et Corruptione, M\u252 \'fcnster 1980 (Sancti Doctoris ecclesiae Alberti Magni ... Opera Omnia, Bd. 5,2), S. 109 \endash  213; vgl. ebenda, S. XVII, Nr. III.5 (Sigle D); Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Bd. 1, S. 66, Nr. 6ae.); Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, S. 73, Nr. 14ae.); Lohr, Commentaries, 1967 \endash  1974 (1967), S. 338 \endash  345, bes. S. 342, Nr. 15; Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd. 1 (2013), S. 25 \endash  35, bes. S. 28 \endash  29, Nr. 15; Fauser, Werke, 1982 (s. Lit.), S. 52 \endash  57, bes. S. 54, Nr. 7; Hamesse/ Szyler, Repertorium, 2007 \endash  2010, Bd. 1 (2007), Nr. 9537; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 1,1 (1994), S. 34 \endash  47, bes. S. 39; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 1 (2000), S. 121 \endash  132 (Lidia Lanza), bes. S. 124 \endash  125, Nr. 27. \endash  24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer; 25 \endash  26 (s.o. Lagenstrukturformel). }

