\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Albertus Magnus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In Aristotelis libros Meteororum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Liber Metherorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De Causis in pressionum omnium materiali et efficien\-te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De divisione habitorum et habendorum in tota scientia naturali et de nomine libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In scientia naturali corpus mobile subiectum est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber quartus Metheororum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui est de impressionibus primarum qualitatum per quas con\-stituit mutatantorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus i\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De operationibus activarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qualitatum et que libri intencio et de hoc quodque qualitatum primarum due sunt active\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et due sunt passive\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hos in principio huius doctrine diximus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quarti Libri Metheororum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De subiectis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que substant dictis passionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum que tractatus intencio et quod omyomera sunt omnia et humido et sicco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Est autem nostra intencio in hoc tractatu sequenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum viii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quod secundum formas specificas consideranda sunt naturalia in sequentibus libris et non secundum materi\-ales formas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quales in isto libro sunt determinate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Igitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [in] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 omnibus omiomeris sicut ex prehabitis patet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia autem ista in genere sunt scilicet mineralia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  vegetabilia et alia ideo sequens scientia in tria dividetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit commentum fratris Alberti super Metheororum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Druck: Paulus Hossfeld (Hrsg.), Alberti Magni Ordinis Fratrum Praedicatorum Meteora, M\u252 \'fcnster 2003 (Sancti doctoris ecclesiae Alberti Mag\-ni ... Opera Omnia, Bd. 6,1), S. 1 \endash  302; vgl. ebenda, S. VI, Nr. 11, Sigle D; Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Bd. 1, S. 67, Nr. 6af.); Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, S. 73, Nr. 14af.); Lohr, Commen\-taries, 1967 \endash  1974 (1967), S. 338 \endash  345, bes. S. 342, Nr. 16; Lohr/ Colomba, Com\-mentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd. 1 (2013), S. 25 \endash  35, bes. S. 29, Nr. 17; Fauser, Werke, 1982 (s. Lit.), S. 58 \endash  66, bes. S. 59, Nr. 7; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 1,1 (1994), S. 34 \endash  47, bes. S. 39; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 1 (2000), S. 121 \endash  132 (Lidia Lanza), bes. S. 122, Nr. 8. }

