\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rogerus de Parma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Chirurgia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prima particula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Cyrrugia Rogerii figurati a domino magistro Arretino discipulo composito et ab eius doctore laudato etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Post mundi frabicam }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  eiusque decorem de terrestri substantia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  deus hominem forma est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quibus modis vulneretur capud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Text bricht ab:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  De tumore capitis sine vulnere cutis cum manifesta cranei lesione et cura eisudem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt <Pacientis namque> \u9553 \'a6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dolor in capite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 oculorum incensio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 rubor in facie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 alienatio lingue nigredo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text bricht ab: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ceterum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si orificium eius est strictum aliqua tenta de cera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <simili imponatur ...> (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: <ut non reciperetur> \u9553 \'a6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 egritudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cognoscatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 utrum testiculus sit putridus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc opus in lucem et ordinem redactum est ab Arietino Guidone longe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 professionis ministro rogatu clarissimorum sociorum et egregii doctoris sui concessu ad desideratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Regnante Wilielino etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Schreiberverse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rodolfinus ego cunctis mea munera lego\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scripsi laudavi que cernitis et miniavi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sum pictor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scriptor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cantorque notator amenus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quem dominum fecit pulchrarum regia venus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scriptorem libri salvet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui cuncta creavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text bricht aufgrund von Blattverlusten zweimal ab; Druck: Salvatore De Renzi (Hrsg.), Collectio Salernitana ossia Documenti inediti, e trattati di medicina appartenenti alla scuola medica Salernitana, Neapel 1853, Bd. 2, S. 426 \endash  496; Karl Sudhoff, Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte der Chirurgie im Mittelalter. Graphische und textliche Untersuchungen in mittelalterlichen Handschriften, 2. Teil, Leipzig 1918 (Studien zur Geschichte der Medizin, Heft 11 und 12), S. 156 \endash  236; vgl. Sudhoff, Beitr\u228 \'e4ge, 1981 (s.o.), S. 148 \endash  155; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 1064 und 856}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Tony Hunt, Anglo-Norman Medicine, 2 B\u228 \'e4nde, Cambridge 1994 und 1997, Bd. 1: Roger Frugard's Chirurgia (1994), S. 5 \endash  8; VL(2), Bd. 8 (2010), Sp.140 \endash  153 (Gundolf Keil). }

