\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs26\chcbpat17 A\u7717 ?mad Ibn-Ibr\u257 \'e2h\u299 \'eem Ibn-al-\u486 ?azz\u257 \'e2r}}\plain \f2\fs26 , Z\u257 \'e2d al-mus\u257 \'e2fir i. e. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Viaticum peregri\-nantis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (translatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Constantini Africani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik (13. Jh.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber Viatici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik (15. Jh.): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Viaticum medicinarum Constantini Affricani monachi Montis Cassinensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text Prohemium: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quodam }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  quidem< ut ait Tullius in Rethoricis: Omne expetendum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit proemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De allopicia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capillus ex fumo grosso et calido nascitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text bricht im Kapitel De pressura et asperitate capillorum ab: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capilli quo ex fumo colere ru\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 <scinduntur ...> (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu im Kapitel De cephalea: >Choleram rubam medicabimur si plusquam sanguis> \u9553 \'a6\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dominetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cassiasi. scilicet iniubis prunis viola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 manna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 miroba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Citrinis et similibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text bricht im Kapitel De emoroidibus ab: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et maiorem morbus quam antea fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  adducit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed oportet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <accipere sarcocolam et colofoniam et pulverem facere ...> (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu mit dem Kapitel De apostemate in epate: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De apostemate epatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Apostemata in epate nascentia duobus modis sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De fissura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Aliquando sanguis nutriens corpus cum colera grossa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  concule marine incense multum valent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse beginnt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota allopicia dicitur quidem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 contra ragadias et distinctum per aliter est succo aquis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text bricht aufgrund von Blattverlusten zweimal ab (s.o.); mit kurzen marginalen Glossen, oft in Form figuraler Schriftfl\u228 \'e4chen; Text mit Kommentar auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 319}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , zu Drucken, Autor, \u220 \'dcbersetzer, Sekund\u228 \'e4rliteratur s. dort.}

