plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 querendus est de partibus constructionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et primo de modis omnium participium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et ideo principaliter nostram intendendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in ea dicemus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Glosa ad istam constructionem duo pre intelligenda sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Zu den Schreiberversen am Anfang vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Colophons, Nr. 23326}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

