\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Notizen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Sprichw\u246 \'f6rter, Verse etc., z.T. mit interlinearen Wortglossen, u.a.: (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 1. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alleluya\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Secundum Augustinum ex quatuor componitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alle id est salvuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 le id est me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 lu id est fac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ya id est domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Secundum Hieronimum ex tribus componitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alle id est canta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 lu id est laudem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ya id est ad dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Secundum Ambrosium ex tribus componitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alle id est pater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 lu id est filius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ya id est spiritus sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Kirchert/ Klein, Vokabulare, 1995, S. 917, Vers 11 \endash  14; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Innsbruck, ULBT, Cod. 668}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vatikan, BAV, Cod. reg. lat. 1627}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 2. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sex sunt cause eternaliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 homo amatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pulcritudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 divicie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fortitudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sapientia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nobilitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 virtus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Illi dicuntur a symone symoniales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui vendunt vel emunt censuras ecclesiales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 3. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec sunt ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que gravant peccata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Baptismus, confirmatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 penitentia, extrema iunctio. Absolvo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 firmo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cibo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dolet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ungitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sacer ordo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 coniugium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ordino, jungo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 4. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aggravat ordo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 locus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 peccata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tempus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 etas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 condicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 numerus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 copia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 causa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est modus in culpa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 status altus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 lucta pusilla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  \u196 \'c4hnlich {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/1 Nr. 719}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 5. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 A caps dicitur chamus, capsat sunt, atque caminus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 6. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Caumo, catos cetus circa sociando datur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 7. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cambio campso notat, campsi, campsumque supra, donat campso frequens campsorum et mihi vetat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 8. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Misceo dat mixtum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mixtus miscillatusque huic mixtatur venit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 latus, -a et \endash um\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 9. Anfangsverse aus dem Facetus \u8218 \'82Cum nihil utilius\lquote : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum nihil utilius humana credo saluti, quam morum novisse modos et viribus uti, quod minus exequitur morosum docma Cathonis, supplebo pro posse meo monitu rationis, assint ergo rudes sitientes pocula morum, hic fontem poterunt haurire leporis ordorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 3692}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Stohlmann, Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge, 1973, S. 288 \endash  304, bes. S. 291; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2327}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; und in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2780}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; zu Drucken und Sekund\u228 \'e4rliteratur siehe dort; 10. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Stans mola surda nola sterilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vola ac scola sola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Werner, Sprichw\u246 \'f6rter, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1966, S. 116, Nr. 179; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/5, Nr. 30288}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 11. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unda lavans lateres, bos litus arans, sine re est res\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/9, Nr. 44084d}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 12. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Non sunt securi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui dant sua colla securi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Kirchert/ Klein, Vokabulare, 1995, S. 1325, 20; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/3, Nr. 18542}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 13. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Forma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  genus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sapientia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  res et honores. Morte ruunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  subita sola manent merita. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/2, Nr. 9750}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Vers auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 81}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 14. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Bis duo sunt, que \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  corde meo sub pectore misi. Mors mea mors Christi baratri vox, lux Paradisi. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/1, Nr. 2040}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 15. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Qui studium sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  studii paciendo laborem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad summum vehitur cicius quam miles honorem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Vgl. Kirchert/ Klein, Vokabulare, 1995, S. 1421, 139; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/4, Nr. 24800}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 16. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Lancea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 crux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 clavi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 spine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mors quam toleravi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ostendunt qua vi miserorum crimina lavi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Lehmann, Skandinavische Reisefr\u252 \'fcchte, 1936, S. 70 \endash  71; \u228 \'e4hnlich {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/2, Nr. 13434a}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 17. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 miraris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 morior nec tu moriaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, Nr. 25208}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 3922}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 18. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mors tua pena mihi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mors mea vita tibi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  19. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Disce puer dum tempus habes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tua puerili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ne te non didicisse fleas etate senili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Werner, Sprichw\u246 \'f6rter, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1966, S. 41, Nr. 108; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/1, Nr. 5873;}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  20. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mors est certa latet omnibus hora latet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

