\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tabulae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  motus planetarum etc., unter anderem: (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula continua totius motus Solis (1340 \endash  1384); (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae veri motus Solis anno domini b. 1336 usque ad anno tercio post b. (1336 \endash  1339); (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae veri motus Lunae anno domini 1340 \endash  1380 (Tabula 1343 zweimal vorhanden); (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae veri motus Capitis (1340 \endash  1380); (214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae veri motus Saturni (1340 \endash  1394); (216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae veri motus Iovis (1340 \endash  1380); (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae veri motus Marcis (1340 \endash  1380); (222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae veri motus Veneris (1340 \endash  1380); (226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae veri motus Mercurii (1340 \endash  1380); (231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae de coniunctionibus et oppostionibus (?) (1344 \endash  1380); auf den Blattr\u228 \'e4ndern von einer sp\u228 \'e4teren Hand (15. Jh. Anfang) astrologische Vermerke, Notizen zu historischen Ereignissen und Wettererscheinungen, meist mit Bezug zu L\u252 \'fcttich; au\u223 \'dferdem unmittelbar im Anschlu\u223 \'df an die Tabulae von der gleichen Nachtragshand: 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Wetterregeln und weitere astrologische Notizen zu L\u252 \'fcttich (dat. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 1360, 14. Juni}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), u.a.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sero rubens celum cras indicat esse serenum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et si mane rubet venturos indicat imbres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sol pergens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 aquis pluviam docet esse furturam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Charles Swainson, A Handbook of Weather Folk-lore. Being a Collection of Proverbial Sayings in Various Languages Relating to the Weather, With Explanatory and Illustrative Notes, Edinbourgh/ London 1873, S. 179; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/4, Nr. 28113b}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dum minus oliqua precedit nova cornua Lune\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et si sint recta circa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 speres tempora clara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pallida Luna pluit rubicunda flat alba serenat.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Bd. II/9, Nr. 39365v; Bd. II/3, Nr. 20577}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Astrologisches Kreisschema f\u252 \'fcr das Jahr 1340; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabulae, u.a. Altitudo Solis in meridiae (233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Januar \endash  Juni; 233\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Juli \endash  Dezember; 234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Januar \endash  Juni). \endash  Bl\u228 \'e4tter von kleinerem Format, kopfstehend eingeheftet, wohl Reste gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferer Bl.; auf den unteren Blattr\u228 \'e4ndern ferner: 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Danck de Saxonia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Almanach (1336 \endash  1380). (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum animadverterem quam plurimos magistros et scolares}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in studio Parisiensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ego Johannes de Danckowe dictus de Saxonia quodam feci opus Almanach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aspecticus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 planetarum quorumlibet inveniens habetis veris locis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si per 6. est oppositus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 129}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Zinner, Verzeichnis, 1925, Nr. 2086ff.; zu dem Autor Thorndike, History, 1923 \endash  1958, Bd. 3 (1934), S. 253 \endash  267; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 11/5 (2003), s. 161 \endash  163, bes. S. 162 unter\~: Johannes Saxo; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cambridge, Gonville & Caius College, Ms 174}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (8); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Erfurt, UFB, Dep. Erf. CA. 2\u176 \'b0 387}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{