\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  242\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pierre des Pr\u233 \'e9s}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 / {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gaucelmus Albanensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  episcopus, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Taxatio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Scripturarum Poenitentiariae 1338. (240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Miseratione divina Petrus Penestrinus et Gaucelmus Albanensis episcopi ad perpetuam rei memoriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Radix omnium malorum cupiditas, que desideratis rebus obtentis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  non extinguitur sed augetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In primis statuimus et etiam ordinamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod pro litera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que conceditur supra vitio symonie comisse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quorum omnium testimonium presentes litera fieri fecimus et sigillorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (245\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nostrorum munimine roborari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Datum Avinione sub anno domini M\u176 \'b0 CCC\u176 \'b0 xxxviii die octava mensis Aprilis pontificatus predam domini Benedicti Pape sexti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 anno quarto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (8. April 1388). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item pro littera quod absolutus per penitenciarios non satisfaciens in eandem sentenciam reincidat \endash  vi Turon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item pro litera absolucionis et dispensacionis capellanorum et clericorum alicuius archiepiscopatus non ultra \endash  xii Turon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Die letzten zw\u246 \'f6lf Taxen dem Datumsvermerk nachgestellt; Druck: Denifle, Taxrolle, 1888 (s. 235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 220 \endash  236; Sekund\u228 \'e4rliteratur s.o. 235\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; zu den Kardin\u228 \'e4len {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pierre des Pr\u233 \'e9s}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (\u8224 \'861361) und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gaucelmus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Gauscelin de Jean, \u8224 \'861348) vgl. Mathieu M\u233 \'e9ras, Le Cardinal Pierre des Pr\u233 \'e9s, in: Bulletin de la Soci\u233 \'e9t\u233 \'e9 arch\u233 \'e9ologique de Tarn-et-Garonne 88 (1962), S. 27 \endash  45; Konrad Eubel (Hrsg.), Hierarchia Catholica medii aevi sive summorum pontificum, S.R.E. cardinalium ecclesiarum antistitum series, B. 1: Ab anno 1198 usque ad annum 1431 perducta, Editio Altera M\u252 \'fcnchen 1913, S. 15, Nr. XXI, 3 und XXI, 12, S. 35 und S. 44. }

