\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Richard Lorch, Appendix 1 to Item VI \u8222 \'84The astronomy of \plain \f2\fs22 J\u257 \'e2bir ibn Aflah\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \rdblquote : The Manuscripts of Jabir ben Aflah\rquote s Treatises. Jabir and Western Trigonometry, in: ders., Arabic Mathematical Sciences: Instruments, Texts, Transmission, Aldershot 1995 (Variorum Collected Studies Series, CS 517), S. 1 \endash  2, bes. S. 2\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Henry Zepeda, The First Latin Treatise on Ptolemy\rquote s Astronomy. The Almagesti minor (c. 1200), Turnhout 2018 (Ptolemaeus Arabus et Latinus \endash  Texts, Bd. 1), S. 60\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~David Juste, \u8218 \'82MS Darmstadt, Hessische Landes- und Hochschulbibliothek, 1987\rquote , in: Ptolemaeus Arabus et Latinus... Internet-Projekt der Bayerischen Akademie der Wissenschaften, Manuscripts ... online unter: http://ptolemaeus.badw.de/ms/381. (update: 07.05.2019).}

