\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs26\chcbpat17 \u486 ?\u257 \'e2bir Ibn-Afla\u7717 ?}}\plain \f2\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Commentarius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ptolomaei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  librum, cui Almagest inscribitur (Almagestum parvum) (Translatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardi Cremonensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Propositum principale est ratio de Sole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et postea de Luna et eorum motibus est quibus magna accedet diversitates per signorum asteriones et ideo primo de signorum asterioribus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 secundo vero modo ubi loquitur de circulis in celo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Rubrik Bundsteg: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tripliciter dicitur mathematica data sub terminis finitis certis numeris numerata, certis mensuris mensurata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Theorem 1: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Data circuli diametra latera decagoni}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Theorem 9: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Verum locum Lune in semicirculo signorum ex mediis motibus positis in omni tempore presto est congnoscere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar beginnt: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 I\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Omnium recte philosophancium verisimilibus coniecturis redibilibus argumentis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in tempore consideracionis tardior vel celerior diversitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit liber tercius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. ... (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur liber quartus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Terram ad hinc distantiam sensibilem qualitatem habere ideoque ad speram Lune vitem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 has menses ita ut nec plus nec minus 269 et hoc est quod intendebamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tempus reducens motum latitudinis inquerere\rquote \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad huius rei noticiam eligenda est eclipsis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Describam evidentem gracia ad hic centrum Lune \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 debet a medio motu longitudinis et quodquod pervenerit numeracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ibi est verus locus Lune in circulo signorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Zu Text und Kommentar vgl. Carmody, Arabic Sciences, 1956, S. 163 \endash  165, Nr. 33, bes. S. 164 \endash  165, Nr. 33.2.a; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 363, Sp. 1006}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f2\fs26 Richard Lorch, The Astronomy of J\u257 \'e2bir ibn Aflah, in: Centaurus 19 (1975), S. 85 \endash  107\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Reprint in: ders., Arabic Mathematical Sciences: Instruments, Texts, Transmission, Aldershot 1995 (Variorum Collected Studies Series, CS517), Nr. VI, bes. S. 90 \endash  92; ders., Some Remarks on the Almagestum Parvum, in: S. S. Demidov/ Menso Folkerts u.a. (Hrsg.), Amphora, Festschrift for Hans Wussing on the Occasion of His 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Birthday, Basel 1992, S. 407 \endash  437 (Reprint in: ders., Arabic Mathametical Sciences (s.o.), Nr. V); ders., Appendix 1/2, 1995 (s. Lit.); C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 4 (2014), S. 142 \endash  144 (E. Chiti); zu Gerardus Cremonensis vgl. C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 4,3 (2013), S. 250 \endash  260 (C. Colomba), bes. S. 250, Nr. 3; David Juste, Work C.1.3 \u8218 \'82Anonymous, Almagesti minor\rquote , in: Internet-Projekt der Bayerischen Akademie der Wissenschaften, Ptolemaeus Arabus et Latinus ... Works, online-Ressource unter: http://ptolemaeus.badw.de/work/5 (update 28.09.2019); Druck: Zepeda, Latin Treatise, 2018 (s. Lit.), S. 134 \endash  366; dazwischen:}

