\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Magister Anthonius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Additiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ad Amalgestum parvum. (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequuntur quedam addiciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quas ego magister Anthonius hic inserari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aditio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tabula equacionis dierum cum noctibus suis sic componitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quere arcum a sole pertransicum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 additis ad diem medioriem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ut ex eo fiat differens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  si fuerit posita e quo fiat e converso etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Additio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad inveniendum medium motum Lune in una die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  numerum dierum equalium lunacionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 20051 est numerus mensium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in quibus coniunctiones ad statum similem reducuntur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Modus faciendi equacionis tabulam Lune\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Via vero operacionis hec est ad tempus ad quantitas volumis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De tribus superioribus planetis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tabula trium superiorum veri motus componitur sicud equaciones Lune \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in auge differentis in tabulis est nota et cum instrumentis materialibus invenitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt additiones mee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Reklamant (?): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur artificium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  vero \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et est de textu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Zu den Additiones vgl. Zepeda, Latin Treatise, 2018 (s. Lit.), S. 60, jedoch mit abweichenden Folioangaben und Textbestand. \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

