\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs26\chcbpat17 \u486 ?\u257 \'e2bir Ibn-Afla\u7717 ?}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber super Almagesti sive Elementa astronomica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Translatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardi Cremonensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Verba Geber filii Affla Yspalensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sciencia species habet quarum melior post scienciam fidei est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 Buch 1, Kapitel 1: (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus primus huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De propositionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et incipiamus exponere intentiones nominum usitatorum in eo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dico ergo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod polus circuli signatus supra superficiem sphere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum eriguntur super duos diametros 2orum circulorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85\rquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui sint 2. arcus h b et t c et seperantur ex duobus circulis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et cum conversione huius demonstracionis completa est demonstracio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 C \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u9553 \'a6 <um super sphaera sese duo circuli sesant \u8230 \'85>. \endash  Text endet unvermittelt; die Handschrift enth\u228 \'e4lt lediglich Buch 1, Kapitel 1 \endash  8; vgl. Carmody, Arabic Sciences, 1956, S. 163 \endash  165, Nr. 33, bes. S. 163, Nr. 33.1.a; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 1403}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Richard Lorch, Astronomy, 1975 (s. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 85 \endash  107, bes. S. 90 \endash  92; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 4 (2014), S. 142 \endash  144 (E. Chiti); zu Gerardus Cremonensis C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 4,3 (2013), S. 250 \endash  260 (C. Colomba), bes. S. 256, Nr. 54; David Juste, Work C.1.2. \u8218 \'82Geber, Liber super Almagesti\rquote , in: Internet-Projekt der Bayerischen Akademie der Wissenschaften, Ptolemaeus Arabus et Latinus. Works, online unter: http://ptolemaeus.badw.de/work/70 (update 29.01.2018); Druck: VD16 J8. \endash  42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

