\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Streax, Katalog, 1589\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Bouxhon, Summa, 1667, Nr. L. 3\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Paquot, Catalogue, 1788, S. 148, Nr. 455\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Roth, Literatur, 1891, S. 24\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Volk, H\u252 \'fcpsch, 1925, S. 208\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 \~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Zinner, Verzeichnis, 1925, Nr. 271, 636, 640, 4601, 6618, 6853, 6868, 7100, 7993, 10973, 10976, 10920, 10990, 10992, 10996, 11018, 11916; S. 393\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Kristeller, Iter, Bd. 3 (1983), S. 514\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Mortiaux-DeNo\u235 \'ebl, Fonds, 1991, S. 185 \endash  186, Nr. L.3\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Mortiaux-DeNo\u235 \'ebl/Guillaume, Fonds, 1997, S. 368, Nr. 104\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~\plain \f2\fs22 Richard Jospeh Lemay (Hrsg.), Ab\u363 \'fb-Ma\u703 ?\u353 \'f0ar Al-Bal\u7723 ?\u299 \'ee, Liber introductorii maioris ad scientiam judiciorum astrorum, Neapel 1995 (Liber introductorii maioris ad scientiam judiciorum astrorum = Kit\u257 \'e2b al-mud\u7723 ?al al-kab\u299 \'eer il\u257 \'e2 \u703 ?ilm a\u7717 ?k\u257 \'e2m an-nu\u487 ?\u363 \'fbm/ Ab\u363 \'fb Ma\u703 ?\u353 \'f0ar al-Bal\u7723 ?\u299 \'ee (Albumasar), Bd. 7 = T. 3, Pt. 1)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , S. 2, 3 \endash  8, Sigle D und Bd. 8, T. 3, 2 (Edition)\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Falmagne/ Otis, Surviving Manuscripts, 2009, S. 200, Nr. 2554\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Fritz Saaby Pedersen (Hrsg.), The Toledan Tables: A Review of the Manuscripts and the Textual Versions With an Edition, 4 B\u228 \'e4nde, Kopenhagen 2002 (Det Kongelige Danske Videnskabernes Selskab: Historisk-filosofiske skrifter, Bd. 24,1 \endash  4), Part 1, S. 33, 38, S. 104 \endash  105 u.\u246 \'f6. Sigle Da1 \endash  Da4, Part 2, S. 350, Sigle Da; Part 3, S. 755, 784, 1205, 1211, 1212, 1223, 1226 u.\u246 \'f6.\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Laurence Moulinier-Brogi, Guillaume l'Anglais: le frondeur de l'uroscopie m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale (XIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  si\u232 \'e8cle): \u233 \'e9dition comment\u233 \'e9e et traduction du De urina non visa, Genf 2011 (\u201 \'c9cole Pratique des Hautes \u201 \'c9tudes, Sciences Historiques et Philologiques V / Hautes \u201 \'c9tudes m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vales et modernes, Bd. 101), S. 133, 198 Sigle Da\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Thomson, On the Astrolabe, 2019 (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 2012), Teil I, Addendum 2, S. 75\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Klein-Ilbeck, dat. Hss.\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Folkerts, Jordanus, online unter: https://jordanus.badw.de/jordanus/ms/1274}

