\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Papiervorsatz vorne s.o. Einband. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ab\u363 u-Ma\u703 ?\u353 \'9aar \u486 Ga\u703 ?far Ibn-Mu\u7717 ?ammad}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Albumasar), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Introductorium in Astrologia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Translatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hermanni Dalmatae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik (von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Introductorium Albumazar Albalachi in astrologia viii libri partiales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prologus Hermanni Dalmatae: ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 A)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 pud Latinos artium principiis, quedam ars extrinseca prescribi solet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primum itaque nobis qua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  causa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qua ratione hominem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Totum igitur a gradu Solis per ordinem deductum ad xx.\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Leonis gradum pervenit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Do da de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Zinner, Verzeichnis, 1925, Nr. 271; Thorndike, History, 1923 \endash  1958, Bd. 1 (1923), S. 649 \endash  650; Carmody, Arabic Sciences, 1956, S. 88 \endash  90, Nr. 13.1.b; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 116 und 1119}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Saaby Pedersen, Toledan Tables, 2002 (s. Lit.), S. 105; zum \u220 \'dcbersetzer {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hermannus Dalmata}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Hermannus de Carinthia) auch: Charles Homer Haskins (Hrsg,), Studies in the History of Medieval Science, Cambridge/Mass. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1924 (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1927), S. 45 \endash  47; Richard Joseph Lemay, \plain \f2\fs26 Ab\u363 \'fb Ma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u703 ?s\plain \f2\fs26 har and Latin Aristotelianism in the Twelfth-Cen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 tury: The Recovery of Aristotle's Natural Philosophy Through Arabic Astrology, Beirut 1962; zugleich Diss. New York 1958 (American University of Beirut, Publication of the Faculty of Arts and Sciences, Oriental Ser., Bd. 38), S. 9 \endash  132, 379 \endash  400, bes. S. 384 Nr. 1; Charles S. F. Burnett, Arabic Into Latin in the Twelfth Century Spain: The Works of Hermann of Carinthia, in: Mittellateinisches Jahrbuch 13 (1978), S. 100 \endash  134, bes. S. 126 \endash  127; C.A.L.M.A, Bd. 5 (2017), unter: Hermannus de Carinthia: S. 578 \endash  582 (E. Chiti), bes. S. 580 \endash  581, Nr. 11; Druck: Richa\plain \f2\fs26 rd Joseph Lemay (Hrsg.), Ab\u363 \'fb-Ma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u703 ?\u353 \'9aar Al-Bal\u7723 ?\plain \f2\fs26 \u299 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Liber introductorii maioris ad scientiam judiciorum astrorum\plain \f2\fs26 , Neapel 1995 (Liber introductorii maioris ad scientiam judiciorum astrorum = Kit\u257 \'e2b al-mud\u7723 ?al al-kab\u299 \'eer il\u257 \'e2 \u703 ?ilm a\u7717 ?k\u257 \'e2m an-nu\u487 ?\u363 \'fbm/ Ab\u363 \'fb Ma\u703 ?\u353 \'f0ar al-Bal\u7723 ?\u299 \'ee (Albumasar)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Bd. 8 = T. 3, Pt. 2), S. 2 \endash  169; online Ausgabe bei Dag Nicolaus Hasse u. a. (Hrsg.), Arabic and Latin Corpus, Universit\u228 \'e4t W\u252 \'fcrzburg; unter: https://www.arabic-latin-corpus.philosophie.uni-wuerzburg.de/text/Albu_Intro_Her_lat.xhtml#2_4. }

