\endash  129; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 453}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Pearl Kibre, Hippocrates Latinus: Repertorium of Hippocratic Writings in the Latin Middle Ages [III], 286, in: Traditio 33 (1977), S. 253 \endash  295, bes. S. 282 \endash  292; dies., Hippocrates Latinus: Repertorium of Hippocratic Writings in the Latin Middle Ages, Revised Edition, New York 1985, S. 94 \endash  107; dies., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Astronomia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  or \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Astrologia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Ypocratis, in: Erna Hilfstein (Hrsg.), Science and History. Studies in Honor of Edward Rosen, Breslau 1978 (Studia Copernicana, Bd. 16), S. 133 \endash  156; (Reprint in Pearl Kibre, Studies in Medieval Science: Alchemy, Astrology, Mathematics and Medicine, London 1984, Nr. XIV, S. 133 \endash  156); Danielle Jacquart, Hippocrate Astrologue au Moyen \u194 \'c2ge, in: Revue de philosophie ancienne 19,2 (2001), S. 77 \endash  86; Saaby Pedersen, Toledan Tables, 2002 (s. Lit.), S. 105; zu Wilhelm von Moerbeke ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guillelmus de Moerbeka}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 5 (2017), S. 100 \endash  110 (R. Forrai), bes. S. 107 \endash  108, Nr. 11; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 9982}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , fol. 46a \endash  49a.}

