\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De saltu Lunae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De saltu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pone ergo lunationes, que sunt in >xviiii< annis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 Hinc crescit saltus Lun\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quia in quolibet mense accenditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  antequam computetur iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26  momentis et una untia et quadragesima septima parte unti\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ab accensione in accensionem xxviiii dies xii horas solemus numerare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quando transilita secunda tertiam esse dicamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De hac pagina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend zweizeilige Buchstabentabelle. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et in omni anno per totum martirologium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod bona scripsit duas tantum literas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 ut script\u281 \'ea sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 observa per xviiii annos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

