\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Sacrobosco}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Compotus Ecclesiasticus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  seu De Anni Ratione. (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Compotus est sciencia considerans tempora}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ex Solis et Lune motibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dicitur et evum idem quod mora \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 unde docus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 O qui perpetua mundum racione gubernas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tu stabilire velis opus hic per temporis evum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Compotus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui scipsit sit benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Text mit abschlie\u223 \'dfendem Boetius-Zitat; Druck (Textabgleich mit): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 VD16: ZV 8727}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, S. 235 \endash  236, Nr. 267b.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 243}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; VL(2), Bd. 4 (1983), Sp. 731 \endash  736 (Francis B. Br\u233 \'e9vart/ Menso Folkerts), bes. Sp. 735; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 11,5 (2003), S. 157 \endash  160, bes. S. 159; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2827}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2661}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Unmittelbar im Anschlu\u223 \'df von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand nachgetragene Tabelle mit 19 mit r\u246 \'f6mischen Ziffern gez\u228 \'e4hlten Tagen r\u246 \'f6mischer Datierung in April und Mai. \endash  70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

