\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Secreta Secretorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Translatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippi Tripolitani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Secretum Secretorum Philosophorum editus ab Aristotele ad honorem Alexandri regis discipuli sui, translatus de Arabico in Latinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Domino suo excellentissimo et in cultu Christiane religiosis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  strenuissimo Guidono de Valencia civitatis Tripolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deus omnipotens custodiat regem nostrum ad gloriam credencium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ille vero est optime memorie bene compositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et cum tibi dant diversa signa et adversa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 declina semper ad meliorem et probabiliorem partem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 O Alexander perfecti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod tibi promisit tractare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et solvi plena solutione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Esto ergo semper triumphator virtuosus et deus gloriosus te regat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dirigat et custodiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cuius bonitatem percipit omnis creatura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Druck: Steele, Secretum secretorum, 1920, S. 25 \endash  172; Bizzarri, Secreto, 2010, S. 168 \endash  170 (Teiledition von Buch 2, Kapitel 4 \endash  14, Epistola Aristotilis ad Alexandrum); vgl. Steele, Secretum secretorum, 1920, S. XVIII \endash  XXIII; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 465 und 410}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Schmitt/ Knox, Pseudo-Aristoteles Latinus, 1985, S. 54 \endash  75; Zamuner, La tradizione romanza, 2005, S. 31 \endash  116, zur Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung bes. S. 111 \endash  116; zum \u220 \'dcbersetzer {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippus Tripolitanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guido de Valencia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  vgl. Forster, Geheimnis, 2006, S. 120 \endash  129 (mit weiterer Lit.); Text in Ausz\u252 \'fcgen auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 753}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 821}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; sowie in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 669}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 5,1, S. 70.}

