\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Experimenta seu Ludi Salomonis. (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt experimenta sive ludi Salomonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut fertur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 regine transmissit Constantine verissime comprobata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pro faciendo aquam ardentem de qua si tu irrores}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...; (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (P)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ro faciendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod vinum ardeat in una olla ad magna flammam et mirabilem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pro faciendo unam candelam inflammari in radio solis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...; (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pro faciendo ignem volantem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pro faciendo unam candelam ardere vel accendere intus aquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pro faciendo magnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ignem et magnam flammam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pro faciendo magnum timorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pro faciendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de quod in fonte frigido\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod sit semper calidus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pro faciendo unam candelam,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que non extinguatur per flatum hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  que faciat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; (139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Nachtrag (?): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad faciendum recipe co. accipe pellem ovinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 accipe flores de per. et urinam et alon \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et coque \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 firmiter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipe zart \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  alon \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?). \endash  Sammlung alchemistischer {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rezepte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \u228 \'e4hnlich auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Innsbruck, ULBT, Cod. 422}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

