\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Breviloquium de virtutibus et signis astrorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum vestra paternitas reverenda pro quodam compendio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ad astrorum scientiam in divinatione te \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 construendo me precatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dignebatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hinc est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod ego G. vester humilis huius precibus ut decet annuens seriosissimus vestre me submittens correctioni plenari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Hoc presens breviloquium vobis humiliter represento ... Sapientes astrorum se semper in naturalibus fundantes \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Stellarum verarum alie dicuntur erratice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  alie fixe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Erratice sunt planete \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiat nostrum opus ab aliis stellas fixas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (S)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 unt alii gradus dicti azlinena id est gradus debilitacionis coporis perpetue \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fuit in aliis gradibus et sic omnis bene posuerunt suis operibus et sic est in futuro variari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 351}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Zinner, Verzeichnis, 1925, Nr. 9948.}

