\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  De aqua fortis. (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aqua fortis operationis mirabiliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Recipe vitrioli Romani uncia 12}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 salpetre uncia 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quid plus dicam de supradicto lapide electo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si de ipso ponens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Fu\u223 \'dfsteg: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ita quod aqua sit calida re habebis 60\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 uncia lapidis supradicti suprascriptas virtutes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cuius compositio talis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe. Non habetur in hoc exemplari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sed alibi oportet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ut queratur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Alchemistische {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rezepte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zur Herstellung von Salpeters\u228 \'e4ure; der Schlu\u223 \'df des Textes auf 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  unten eingetragen. }

