\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De destillatione aquae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Oportet te scire pondus curcurbite et quantum materia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in ea contenta pondatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et in tanto pondere summe de aqua cruda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ista generis est prima fiola prime distillacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Considera iam pondus istius lapidis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nunc oportet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod iste vii fiole in novem partes dividam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et hoc diversio sicut sunt dividere qualibet fiolam in novem partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  .... (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota circa materiam nunc scriptam alibi sic invenitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quando autem post nigritudinem reducta fuerit albedo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et mundata fuerit nigredo et inducta fuerit albedo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Inbibe terram aliis sex partibus aque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Et hec sufficit de ista materia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

