\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hortulanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Clavis sapientiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Ortulanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Laus, honor, virtus, gloria sit tibi domine deus omnipotens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cum dilectio filio tuo nomino nostro Jesu Christo et spirirtu sancto paraclito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 O trinitas sancta tibi gracias ago \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ego autem dictus Ortholanus Jacobina pelle indutus philosophorum novissimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 indignus vocari discipulus philosophi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dicit igitur Hermes philosophus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Verum sine mendacio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Itaque fugiat a te omnes obscuritas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Completum est ergo quod dictum est de operatione lapidis trium naturis et quatuor coloris existencium in una re videlicet in Mercurio solo id est aqua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et quod sit lapis vegitabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod loquitur quia ex succis trium herbaris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 debet converti scienciam auris et argentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Completa igitur sunt dicta humilis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 patris philosophorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In nomine domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod est benedictum in secula seculorum amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic est finis operis prescripti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ortulani philosophi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Schlu\u223 \'df der vorliegenden Redaktion im Vergleich zum Druck (s.u.) abweichend; vgl. Pearl Kibre, Alchemical Writings Ascribed to Albertus Magnus, in: Speculum 17, H. 4, (1942), S. 499 \endash  518, bes. S. 505, Nr. 4; Thorndike, History, 1923 \endash  1958, Bd. 3 (1934), S. 176 \endash  190; 686 \endash  688, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 813}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Druck (Textabgleich mit): Alchemiae Gebri arabis philosophi solertissimi, libri, cum reliquis, ut versa pagella indicabit, Bern 1545 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 VD16: J 4}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 295 \endash  302. }

