\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arnoldus de Villa Nova}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rosarius Philosophorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Iste namque liber), Fragment. (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog: (I)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ncipit Rosarius magistri Arnoldi de Nova Villa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui quidem est Thezaurus Thesaurorum omnium philosophorum ac omnium secretorum maximum secretum de naturalis philosophie compositione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item namque liber nominatur Rosarius ex eo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui ex libris philosophorum breviter abbreviatus est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In primo capitulo hortamur ad legendum libros philosophorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  de modo generacionis metallorum in sua natura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quoniam argentum vivum est materia omnium metallorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quibus numquam aliquis philosophus tradidit meliora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit liber primus Rosarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Liber 2: (M)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 anifestum est ergo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [per] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 operacionem medicine esse operacionem nature \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text bricht ab: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Modo dicam quomodo depuratur Mercurius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ingenium ergo ipsius terre substantie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod argentum vivum sublimetur postea \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u9553 \'a6 <solve eum et redeat \u8230 \'85>. \endash  Text bricht aufgrund von Blattverlust in Buch 2, Kapitel 3 ab; vgl. Thorndike, History, 1923 \endash  1958, Bd. 3 (1934), S. 654 \endash  676, bes. S. 669 \endash  671 u.\u246 \'f6.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 847}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Initium liber 2); Giuliana Camilli, Il Rosarius Philosophorum attribuito ad Arnaldo da Villanova nella tradizione alchemica del trecento, in: Josep Perarnau (Hrsg.), Actes de la I Trobada Internacional d\rquote Estudis sobre Arnau de Vilanova, 2 B\u228 \'e4nde, Barcelona 1995, Bd. 1, S. 175 \endash  208; Paniagua, Corpus cientifico, 1995, bes. S. 22, Nr. III.19; Pereira, L\rquote alchimia, 1995 (s. 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), bes. S. 146; Calvet, Le corpus alchimiques, 2005 (s. 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), bes. S. 454; Calvet, \u338 \'8cuvres alchimiques, 2011, S. 125 \endash  166; Druck (Textabgleich mit): Mangetus, Bibliotheca, 1702, Bd. 1, S. 663 \endash  667; Calvet, Les \u338 \'8cuvres alchimiques, 2011, S. 268 \endash  302; weitere Lit. s.o. 76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1988}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

