\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sahl ibn Bi\u353 \'9ar}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De annulis seu sigilis septem planetarum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit opus Zaelis philosophi de annulis planetarum septem et eorum virtutibus. Et primo de Saturno tanquam de superiori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Saturnus superior omnibus planetis est et fortior}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . Habet autem de signis aquarium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur opus Lune et angelorum et spiritum eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Luna habet de signis Cancrum de mensibus Julium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sexta est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod ponit concordiam inter discordes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Forma annuli seu carte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  de qua prout supra sit mentio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Tractatus Zaelis philosophi de annulis seu sigillis septem planetarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

