\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber septem planetarum ex scientia Abel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Translatio ex Arabico (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hermetis Trismegisti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Translatio ex Graeco {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Adelardi Batheniensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber de imaginibus planetarum septem ex scientia Abel Justi filii Ade prima patris scientiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Septem sunt circuli planetarum, quorum primus et superior Saturnus attribuitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber Solis. In ordine< septem planetarum librorum Solis liber secundum locum obtinet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sicut in libro Lune iam diximus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur liber Martis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui quintus in ordine librorum prestigiorum planetarum 7 habetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste liber quintus est et appellatur liber Martis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber Jovis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui sextus in ordine habetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85<. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic liber est Jovis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quem tractat Hermes Triplex \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber Saturni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui septimus prestigiorum in ordine librorum 7 planetarum habetur etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic est liber Saturni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quem tractat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hermes triplex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui eum post diluvium in lapidibus marmoreis celatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  que diximus reiterando ea ordine prefato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Perfectus est liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quem invenit Hermes Triplex post diluvium in marmoribus sculptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quem Abel Justus Ade filius optimus philosophus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in eis celaverat timens destructionem librorum propter diluvium futurum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod previderat Grates igitur omnipotenti deo optimo omnium creatorum referantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis libri Saturni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Die beiden ersten Abschnitte (B\u252 \'fccher) weitgehend identisch mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vatikan, BAV, Cod. Pal. lat. 1879}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Schlu\u223 \'df jedoch jeweils abweichend; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 1432}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Thorndike, Images, 1947, S. 217 \endash  273, bes. S. 241, Nr. 8; Carmody, Arabic Sciences, 1956, S. 59, Nr. 10; Gilly, Collezione, 1999, S. 238; Lucentini/ Perrone Compagni, codici di Ermete, 2001 (s. Lit.), Nr. 28, S. 66 \endash  68; Perrone Compagni, Studiosus, 2001 (s. Lit.), bes. S. 43 \endash  51; Sebasti\u224 \'e0 Giralt Soler, The Manuscript of a Medieval Necromancer: Magic in Occitan and Latin in Ms Vaticano, BAV, Barb. Lat. 3589, in: Revue d\rquote histoire des Textes 9 (2014), S. 221 \endash  272, bes. S. 241 \endash  242; Sebasti\u224 \'e0 Giralt Soler (Hrsg.), The \u8218 \'82Liber Lune\rquote  and the \u8218 \'82Liber Solis\rquote  Attributed to Hermes in the MS Vatican, B.A.V., Barb. Lat. 3589, in: Jean-Patrice-Boudet/ Isaebelle Draelants (Hrsg.), Textes et savoirs scientifiques et magiques m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vaux entre Orient et Occident, Paris 2017 (CRMH. Cahiers de recherches m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vales et humanistes. A Journal of Medieval and Humanistic Studies 33 (2017), S. 103 \endash  126, bes. S. 106 u.\u246 \'f6.; zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Adelardus Batheniensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : vgl. C.A.L.M.A. Bd. 1 (2000), S. 37 \endash  40 (Lidia Lanza); Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Florenz, BN, II.III.214}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 L\u252 \'fcbeck, Stadtbibliothek, Ms. math. 4\u176 \'b0 9}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; zur \u220 \'dcbersetzung des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Robertus Castrensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  s.u. 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

