\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Antonius de Monte Ulmi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Experimentum ad expellendos hostes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Experimentum verum verumque inventum ad expellendos hostes ipsoque omnino propellendos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Experimentum verum et naturale ac ineffabile ad expellendos hostes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  de regione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 civitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 castro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 domo et de omni loco \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ponam ergo primum practicam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  per quam tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quo ego Parisius eram magister Thomas de Pigano de Bononia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  tunc medicus regis Francie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  expulit societates Anglicorum de omni regno corone Francie prout mihi tunc dicebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Secundo ponam practicam per quam magister Bartholomeus de Sanguinente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  medicus fidelis ducis Leopaldi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  multa in Alemania operatus est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tertio ponam practicam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quam ego ipse Palpani \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Practica igitur magistri Thome fuit ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quia divisio per imaginationem toto territorio corone regis Francie \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Practica secunda magistri Bartholomei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dividebat civitatem vel castrum vel villam vel domum et colligebat terram \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Practica autem mea est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Propria ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod observatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quando Mars est in signo Geminorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et si potest sepeliri iuxta medietatem loci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  a quo debet expelli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  melius est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic explicit opus notabile atque dignum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Zuschreibung an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Antonius de Monte Ulmi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  durch Nicolas Weill-Parot/ Julien V\u233 \'e9ron\u232 \'e8se (Hrsg.), Antonio da Montolmo\rquote s De occultis et manifestis or Liber Intelligentiarum: An Annotated Critical Edition with English Translation and Introduction, in: Claire Fanger (Hrsg.), Invoking Angels. Theurgic Ideas and Practices from the Thirteenth to the Sixteenth Century, University Park / Pennsylvania 2012, S. 219 \endash  293, S. 223 \endash  224 basiert auf der Mit\u252 \'fcberlieferung von weiteren Texten des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Antonius de Monte Ulmi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , insbesondere des Liber Intelligentiarum, innerhalb der Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung (s.u.); bei den im Text genannten Personen handelt es sich um den Arzt und Astrologen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tommaso da Bologna}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Thomas de Pizan, Tommaso da Pizzano), Vater der Christine de Pisan, (\u8224 \'861387 Paris); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bartholomaeus (Bartolomeo) de Sangibene}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Thorndike, History, Bd. 3 (1934), S. 604 \endash  609; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 1,4 (2001), Sp. 390 \endash  391, bes. S. 391, Nr. 3; Nicolas Weill-Parot, Les images astrologiques au Moyen \u194 \'c2ge \u224 \'e0 la Renaissance. Sp\u233 \'e9culation intellectuelle et pratiques magiques (XII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  et XV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  si\u232 \'e8cle), Paris 2002 (Sciences, techniques et civilisation du Moyen \u194 \'c2ge \u224 \'e0 L\rquote aube des lumi\u232 \'e8res, Bd. 6), S. 899 \endash  900; Jean-Patrice Boudet, Magie, 2013 (s. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 247 \endash  293, bes. S. 265; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Paris, BN, Ms. lat. 7337}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vatikan, BAV, Cod. Vat. lat. 4085}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

