\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber septem planetarum ex scientia Abel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Translatio ex Arabico (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hermetis Trismegisti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Translatio ex Graeco {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Roberti Castrensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit opus Abel Iusti ab Hermete traditum meliori modo et correctiori forma quamque primum in presenti libro annotatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dixit Hermes Triplex: Quod sapientes, qui invenerunt sapientiam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ante diluvium previderunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod diluvium erat futurum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut in principio huius libri significavimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nunc incipiamus de imaginibus xx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ii\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et quomodo fieri debeant per rectum ordinem enarrabimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primum quidem prestigium fieri debet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui diximus scribi debet de quolibet mundissimo rubeo tincto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit liber Lune cum altissimi creatoris laude\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur liber Solis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui in ordine est liber prestigiorum secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste liber est sedundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui est liber Solis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quem tractat Hermes Triplex et est de lapidibus marmoreis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Perfecte sunt ante huius libri sex imagines cum omnibus illis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui necessaria sunt ad laudem dei altissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur liber Saturni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui septimus prestigiorum in ordine habetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste liber est Saturni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quem tractat Hermes Triplex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui eum post diluvium in lapidibus marmoreis invenit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que diximus reiterentur ordine prefato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quem edidit Abel Iustus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quem in lapidibus marmoreis ante diluvium celaverat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quibus Hermes Triplex post diluvium in Ebron ipsum invenit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et eorum precepta probavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et posteris illa tradidit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sicut in libro Lune iam diximus. Translatus de Arabico in Latinum per Robertum Castrensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f4\i\lang1032\fs26 \u932 \'d4\u917 \'c5\u935 \'d7\u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Laut Explizit \u220 \'dcbersetzung des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Robertus Castrensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; zur \u220 \'dcbersetzung des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Adelardus Batheniensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  s.o. 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Gilly, collezione, 1999, S. 238; Lucentini/ Perrone Compagni, codici di Ermete, 2001 (s. Lit.), Nr. 28, S. 66 \endash  68; Perrone Compagni, Studiosus, 2001 (s. Lit.), S. 40 \endash  43; Burnett, Arabic Hermes, 2003 (s. Lit.), S. 370, Anm. 6; Giralt Soler, Necromancer, 2014 (s. 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 221 \endash  272, S. 241 \endash  242; Giralt Soler, The \u8218 \'82Liber Lune\rquote , 2017 (s.o. 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ); die \u220 \'dcbersetzung des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Adelardus Bathiensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  auf 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , s.o.}

