\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sahl ibn Bi\u353 \'9ar}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De imaginibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber Zaelis philosophi de imaginibus ad laudem summi creatoris nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ego Zael per longum tempus investigavi multa in huiusmodi facultate}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et mathematica eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prima facie Arietis ascendente Luna in Scorpione existente hora Martis formabis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et fiunt sigilla capitis et caude draconis dicantur nomina Lune cum coniuratione convecte \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt nomina angelorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 signorum et planetarum cum karacteribus suis et sunt ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sequuntur et primo nomina Saturni scilicet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sachir\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Onaach \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85< (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et quicquid tuus animus postulat sine falsitatis errore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit liber Zaelis philosophi de imaginibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Vgl. Giralt Soler, Necromancer, 2014 (s. 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 221 \endash  272, S. 256 Anm. 70.}

