\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Magisch-mantische {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rezepte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und Zauberformeln. (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 1. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Experimentum pro invisibilitate habenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dixit Plines in suo libro, qui Clavis Sapientie vocatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod si scripseris in corio vulpis figuram Solis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et hec sunt figure,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que debent fieri in corio vulpis videlicet figura Solis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 figura Mercurii et figura Lune\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sunt iste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u8230 \'85 2. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Res probabilis probata ac secreta de septimanibus 7 dierum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Res probabilis probata secreta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod scilicet cuilibet dierum septimane sunt positi et accommodati a deo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Saturni quicquid est nigri coloris et suffumigia eius sunt assa fetida\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 oppium et sulphur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic finitur opus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 3. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alemanna Exemplum invisibilitatis de unguento nigromantico secundum Albertum Magnum et mulierem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hoc unguentum magicum compositum per Albertum Magnum et probatum per quondam episcopum Pharaelem de partibus Alemanie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui tale unguentum dedit cuidam militi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et Albertus cum eo multa spatia terre ambulavit et multa peregit etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 4. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alio quoque modo in hoc opere proceditur secundum mulierem Alemanam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que etiam multa in hoc opere egit et scripsit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Colligantur autem herbe infrascripte videlicet prima solsequium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 bethonica \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod Luna esset in aliis signis, sicut dixit mulier Alemana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 5. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad habendum annulum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quo habeas spiritum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui dicat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tibi veritatem de omnibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  a te quesitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipe mirrham\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 thus et aloe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  grana paradisi omnium ana et pone in thuribulo ereo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 invocare nomen illius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Et hic videtur mihi esse modus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur circulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u8230 \'85 6. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Experimentum ad ligandum linguas detrahentium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rane et busones participant cum eis Venus et Luna \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nec tibi detrahere poterunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 7. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Inter mirabilia nature et operationes nature notanda sunt hec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sequuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Igitur silentio serva et prudenter age\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nucis metelle anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 commeste somnium inducunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 intellige ergo et esto sapiens quia margarita proytienda \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 inter porcos non est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Satis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Satis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

