\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 +v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] \endash  197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 +r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistola}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de exorcismo per nomina angelorum. (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 +v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Frater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Andreas mihi carissime salutem plurimam etc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quamquam alias a fraternitate tua petita fuerunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  a me habere literas artis memori\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 \u281 \'ea Salomonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quas ego te docebo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut ad alta et maiora quaque petisti a me habere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 devenire valeas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quia non solum ad memoriam angelicam iste valeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed etiam cum isto modo apertis insertis nominibus horarum angelorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 +r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et postea a secundo,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quo est secundum nomen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed prius opportet te esse mundatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota alio modo nomina prima videlicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hasegeon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sesagip \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tergisnoyl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sandanruch \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 \endash  Text beginnt und endet mit mantischen Symbolen. }

