\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 +r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] \endash  (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 +v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Experimentum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  per Archangelum. (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 +r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Experimentum cum puero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Experimentum per archangelum cum puero virgine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cum mundicia fieri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipe cratum vitri novum et immaculatum et imple eum aqua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85(198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) [111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 +v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deinde dicas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ite vos sancti estis et sicut \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sancti estis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ita vos licentio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Revertimini ad me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quotiens vos vocavero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

