\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Christophorus de Honestis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de corporibus. (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tracta\-tus de corporibus a magistro Christoforo de Honestis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quoniam dispositiones humani corporis sunt tres iuxta sententiam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  9 in tegni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scilicet sanitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 egritudo et neutralitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qualibet magnam habet latitudinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Corpus sanum simpliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  est corpus temperatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Corpus neutrum nunc decidencie tercii significati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  est quodlibet dispositionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut dictum est de neutro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per naturam corporis et non aliorum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sic finitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Tractatus de corporibus a magistro Christoforo de Honestis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Bislang einziger Textzeuge des Traktats; zum Autor vgl. C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 2 (2008), S. 602 \endash  603 (Anna Pullia), bes. S. 602, Nr. 4 (mit dieser Handschrift); 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  den Text erl\u228 \'e4uterndes stufenf\u246 \'f6rmiges Wortschema zum Thema \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Latitudo sanitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tota latitudo vite humane includens omnem dispositionem corporis humani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  durat de a basi usque ad communi quia usque ad f\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 a. Sanitas simpliciter semper irreparibilis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in specie humana consistens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... f. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tota latitudo egritudinis nunc quam scilicet magnis et minus variatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vite versus non esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Timo Joutsivuo,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Scholastic Tradition and Humanist Innovation: the Concept of Neutrum in Renaissance Medicine, Helsinki 1999 (Suomalaisen Tiedeakatemian toimituksia: Sarja humaniora (Series humaniora), Bd. 303), S. 111 \endash  112; Tiziana Pesenti, The Teaching of the \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tegni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Italian Univer\-sities in the Second Half of the Fourteenth Century, in: Dynamis. Acta Hisp. Med. Sci. Hist. Illus. 20 (2000), S. 159 \endash  208. }

