\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Kurze medizinische {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Notizen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  1. De saporibus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nota, quod auctor 2\u176 \'b0 Canon., capi\-tulo 3\u176 \'b0 dicit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod octo sunt sapores scilicet dulcis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 amarus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 acutus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 salsus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ponticus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 stipticus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 accetosus et vuctuosus et isti sunt vere sapores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sed adhuc est alter sapor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui dicitur insipidus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et sicut aggregatio amaritudinis et insipiditatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in endivia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 2. De medicinis. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item auctor capitulo 1\u176 \'b0 dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod quidem sunt medicine ita fortis commixtionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pauca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que renovetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sunt abluatur in aqua sepe etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

