\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arnoldus de Villanova}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Tabula super canonum \u8218 \'82Vita brevis\lquote , Exzerpt. (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus practicus de modo medicandi per magistrum Arnoldum de Nova Villa compositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 rdinato regimine egroti in hospicio ipsius S.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  dum recedit ad domum suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et si ab amicis interrogetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quid senciat de statu infirmi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26   ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ordinato regimine ac parato et dieta reversione presentibus de statu patientis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad quid fuit male qualitatis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic finitur deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit tractatus practicus de modo medicandi per magistrum Arnoldum de Novavilla compositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Bei dem {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Traktat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  handelt es sich um das Kapitel: \u8222 \'84Quomodo se debet habere medicus circa amicos patientis\ldblquote  aus den Tabula super canonum \u8218 \'82Vita brevis\lquote ; Druck (Textabgleich mit): Arnoldus de Villa Nova, Opera ... nuper recognita et emendata, additis etiam 4 tractatibus, qui in antehac impressis deerant: et additionibus marginalibus, Venedig 1527, fol. 318\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  320\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 211gl.); zu dem katalanischen Arzt und Theologen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arnoldus de Villa Nova}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (\u8224 \'861311) vgl. C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 1,2 (2003), S. 442 \endash  459, bes. S. 456, Nr. 82 (Marco Toste/ F.S./ Jos\u233 \'e9 Carlos Santos Paz); weitere Lit. s.u. 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

