\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Secretum secretorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Translatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippi Tripolitani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), Exzerpt: Epistola Aristotilis ad Alexandrum. (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik (Nachtrag): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De epistola Aristotilis ad Alexandrum abbreviatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?). Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum sit homo corpus corruptibile eique accidat corrupcio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ex oppinione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 omnia hec desiccant corpus et debilitant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quatuor autem partes per tempora distinguntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut a medio Marcy usque ad medium Julii veris habeatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 a medio \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 No\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Decembris usque ad medium Martii hiemps teneatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Reget\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc missum terminat amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Exzerpte aus Buch 2, Kapitel 4 \endash  14; Druck: Steele, Secretum secretorum, 1920, S. 68 \endash  83; Bizzarri, Secreto, 2010, S. 168 \endash  170; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 342 und Sp. 969}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Schmitt/ Knox, Pseudo-Aristoteles Latinus, 1985, S. 54 \endash  75; Zamuner, La tradizione romanza, 2005, S. 31 \endash  116, zur Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung bes. S. 111 \endash  116; zum \u220 \'dcbersetzer {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippus Tripolitanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guido de Valencia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  vgl. Forster, Geheimnis, 2006, S. 120 \endash  129 (mit weiterer Lit.); Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 669}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 5,1, S. 70. }

