\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  De cibis. (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De pane. Diversitates panis ex artificio suo duo modi sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aut ex forma aut ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 artificio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cepulle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Grossus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cibus ex causis duabus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Granum fractum et simula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si cum lacte consequenter sanguine laudabile generatit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!?)... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amidum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Frigidum est in siccum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  durum ad digerendum digestum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Zizania nascuntur inter tercium siccisque corruptisque temporibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ordeum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Frigidum est et siccum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Risi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Plurimes propter ventris constipacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (F)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 abe in natura sua frigide sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In siccitate diverse sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fabe nocinnores sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Der Anfang fehlt aufgrund von Blattverlust (s.o. Lagen); wohl aus unterschiedlichen Quellen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 exzerpiert}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

