\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Carmen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de miraculo contigit in Polonia in archiepiscopatu Gnesnensem anno domini 1222. Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Anno domini 1222 gloriosum hoc miraculum contigit in Polonia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in archiepiscopatu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod Gnisa dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Stella Maria maris illustrans secula signis, mentibus est voco}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  iugi veneranda benignis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 curritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 asspicitur facies illesa rubescit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 virgultum de corde per os prodissse parescit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic regina suos amas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ornat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 premia donat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quos et Christus genitricis amore coronat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

