\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Carmen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de barbarismis et soloecismis. (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt Figure etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hec sunt, que vicia sunt in sermone cavenda}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Est barbarismus verbi pro ductio vel corrupcio vilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est barbarismus cum dico domina dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est soloecismus verborum copula prava\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est soloecismus vir mea sponsa meus. Acirologia data dictio rebus inepta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Antiteton contraria diversis decoramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Anthiteton fiet verbis contraria iungans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pro libitu casuum transmittat ypallage sensum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Verba sub ornando convertit in altera tropos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cuius sunt pauce species de pluribus iste usurpat pulchre translata mathafora \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  verba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 trado rati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ventos dicas ei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ypallage fiet etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text basiert wohl auf {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Eberhardus Bethuniensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Graecismus, Kapitel II; im Vergleich zur Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung deutlich umfangreicher; Initium vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 5612}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vatikan, BAV, Cod. Borgh. 81}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

