\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Carmen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de duobus sociis. Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De duobus sociis religiosis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Mente columbinos monachos devocio binos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 iunxerat in Christo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 circo migrat ab isto unus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ab hoc plorans alter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dolet et genuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 orans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quam loca sex horis pene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tolerare prioris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 O dolet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  o quod vocat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  stupet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  admiratur et optat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Laus est finire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  pudor est incepta reperire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

