\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Orationes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  sanctae {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Brigidae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Jesu eterna dulcedo te amantium iubilius excedens omne gaudium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 O Jesu vitis vera et fecunda memento supereffluentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vt post huius vite terminum te merear laudare cum omnibus sanctis tuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pater noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ave Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Aufgrund von altem Blattverlust (s.o.) der Anfang des Textes von anderer, wenig sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand eingetragen; die ersten drei Zeilen von (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) deswegen doppelt vorhanden (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ); Druck: Horae Eboracenses. The Prymer of Hours of the Blessed Virgin Mary, According to the Use of the Illustrious Church of York With Other Devotions as They Were Used by the Lay-Folk in the Northern Province in the XV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  And XVI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Centuries, London 1920 (The Publications of the Surtees Society, Bd. 132), S. 80; vgl. Andr\u233 \'e9 Wilmart, Le grand po\u232 \'e8me de Bonaventurien sur les sept paroles du Christ en croix, in: Revue B\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 1935, S. 235 \endash  278, bes. S. 274 \endash  278\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits, Bd. 2, S. 98; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1094}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 3, S. 100.}

