inst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Mainz, Stb, Hs I 335}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 ebenda, Hs I 337}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Henricus de Werla}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , De conceptione beatae Virginis, Exzerpt. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Salve ave sancta parens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 omni prorsus labe carens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per quam caput venenosi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  serpentis conteritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Exzerpt aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De conceptione beatae virginis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Abschnitt 76, Vers 114 \endash  122 des Henricus de Werla, Druck: Sophronius Clasen (Hrsg.), Henrici de Werla, O.F.M. Opera omnia, Bd. 1: Tractatus de immaculata conceptione beatae Mariae virginis, New York/ Louvain/ Paderborn 1955 (Franciscan Institute Publications, Nr. 10), S. 22. }

