\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Orationes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de sancto {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Antonio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Deus, qui concedis obtentu beati Anthonii confessoris tui morbidum ignem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  extingwi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ora pro nobis beati Anthoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ut digni efficiamur promissione Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Horae Eboracenses, 1920 (s.o. 146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 133; vgl. Leroquais, Les livres d'heures. Manuscrits, Bd. 2, S. 87; Coppieters 't Wallant, Corpus Orationum, 1992 \endash  2014 (s.o. 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), Bd. 2,1 (1993), Nr. 1486; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Omnipotens sempiterne deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui beatum Anthonium abbatem famulum tuum inter mundi huius turbines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ... Ora pro nobis beati Anthoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut digni efficiamur promissionem Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Omnipotens sempiterne deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 Text bricht ab. \endash  166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

