\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Lectiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , frz. \endash  lat. (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Epitre de saint Jehan l\rquote apostre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quoniam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 omne quod natum est ex deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vincit mundum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Toute chose, qui est de dieu}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1. Io 5, 4 \endash  10) ... (265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Evangile secumdum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum natus esset Jesus in Betheleem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Comment Jesus fust nez en Betheleem cite de Iude ou temps du roi Herode vezci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6(Lc 2,1ff.) (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que les roy vindrent d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Orient en Jerusalem et disoient\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (Mt 2,2 \endash  2, 12) ... (308\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Evangile secundum Johannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In illo tempore abiit Jesus transmare Galileeque et Tyberiadis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...<. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Jesus s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 en ala outre la mer de Galilee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quar cesci vraiement et prophete\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui est avenir ou monde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Io 6, 1 \endash  14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  \u220 \'dcbersetzungen der Messlesungen ins Franz\u246 \'f6sische; in der Regel mit Angabe des lateinischen Initiums; jedoch ohne erkennbare Ordnung; \u252 \'fcberwiegend Lesungen zur Fasten- und Passionszeit; 263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 /264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  die ersten Verse Lc 1, 26 \endash  28 zweimal abgeschrieben; 265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 / 266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Text endet unvermittelt; der erste Vers von Mt fehlt ohne Blattverlust; enthalten sind in der Reihenfolge der Handschrift: (248\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  249\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dominica in Albis (1. Io 5, 4 \endash  10; Io 20, 19 \endash  31); (250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Festum ss. Petri et Pauli (Act 12, 1 \endash  11; Mt 14, 3 \endash  12); (252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In Desponsatione BMV (Mt 1, 20 \endash  2, 18); (253\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  255\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sabbato post secundam Dominicam in Quadragesima (Gn 27, 6 \endash  39; Lc 15, 11 \endash  32); (256\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria quinta post Dominicam secundam in Quadragesima (Lc 16, 19 \endash  31); (257\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria secunda infra octavam Paschae (Mc 16, 1 \endash  16,7; Lc 24, 13 \endash  35); (260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria tertia infra octavam Paschae (Act 13, 16 \endash  33); (261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  262\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria secunda post tertiam Dominicam in Quadragesima (2. Reg 5, 1 \endash  15); (263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Secunda Dominica post Epiphaniam (Io 2, 1 \endash  12); (263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In Conceptione BMV (Lc 1, 26 \endash  38); die ersten Verse zweimal vorhanden (s.o.); (264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In Nativitate Domini (Lc 2, 1 \endash  14); (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In Epiphaniam (Mt 2,2 \endash  2, 12); Textanfang fehlt; (266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tertia Dominica post Epiphaniam (Rm 12, 16 \endash  21); (267\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prima Dominica in Quadragesima (Mt 4, 1 \endash  11); (268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dominica quarta post Epiphaniam (Mt 8, 23 \endash  27); (268\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria quarta in Quadragesima (Io 9, 1 \endash  41; Io 11, 1 \endash  45); (273\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria quarta infra Octavam Paschae (Gn 22, 1 \endash  19); (274\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Secunda Dominica in Quadragesima (Mt 17, 1 \endash  9); (275\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  276\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria quinta post secundam Dominicam in Quadragesima (Gn 37, 6 \endash  23); (277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Festum s. Josephi (Mt 1, 18 \endash  23, 25); (277\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria quinta post secundam Dominicam in Quadragesima (Mt 21, 33 \endash  46); (278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria tertia post Dominicam quartam in Quadragesima (Io 7, 14 \endash  31); (279\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sabbatum quatuor temporum Pentecostes (Dn 3, 49 \endash  52); (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) s.u.; (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Sabbatum in Albis (Mt 28, 16 \endash  20); (282\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria Sexta post tertiam Dominicam in Quadragesima (Dn 13, 1 \endash  62); (285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  286\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria tertia post Dominicam de passione (Dn 14, 28 \endash  42); (286\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria quinta post tertiam Dominicam in Quadragesima (Nm 20, 2 \endash  13); (287\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria sexta post tertiam Dominicam in Quadragesima (Io 4, 5 \endash  42); (290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  291\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria tertia post primam Dominicam in Quadragesima (Is 55, 6 \endash  12; Mt 21, 10 \endash  17); (290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) s.o.; (291\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria quarta quatuor temporum Quadragesimae (Ex 24, 12 \endash  18); (292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Festum in Conversione s. Pauli (Act 9, 1 \endash  22; 19, 27 \endash  29); (295\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  297\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria quarta infra octavam Paschae (Act 10, 34 \endash  42; Io 21, 1 \endash  14); (297\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  298\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dominica infra octavam Paschae (Lc 2, 42 \endash  52); (298\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  300\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Coena domini (1. Cor 11, 20 \endash  34; Io 13, 1 \endash  15); (300\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Festum de Inventione Crucis (Io 3,1 \endash  15); (301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) In Octava ss. Petri et Pauli (Ecl 44, 10 \endash  15, 21 \endash  23; Mt 14, 22 \endash  33); (303\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Feria quarta in quatuor temporum Quadragesimae (1 Rg 19, 3 \endash  8; Mt 12, 38 \endash  50); (305\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tertia Missa Nativitatis domini (Hbr 1,1 \endash  12; Io 1,1 \endash  15); (307\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Quarta Dominica in Quadragesima (Gal 4, 22 \endash  30; Io 6, 1 \endash  14). Dazwischen: 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Pri\u232 \'e8re \u224 \'e0 dieux. (280\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Orroiso de dieu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dyeu qui dou saint ton pere ies envoie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et le monde \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 alaisier\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  alachier et racheter les cheistis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (281\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et tous mes amis et mes bienfaucteurs aideres et deffendres de touz max \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et de tous\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pechies et de tous empechement de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 m\rquote ame et de mon corps\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ament\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Sinclair, French Devotional Texts, 1982 (s.o. 228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), Nr. 4222 \endash  4223.}

