\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  De adverbium, de nomine et de pronomine ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Carmen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum glossa), unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Binas personas huic parti velle negavit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quare Donatus personam ponere cavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Omnem tractato nunc de pronomine tracto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arte fruens tali pronomine officialis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sit distincta nomen cunctis phariseat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sit distinguibile pro quo pronomen ydeat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Diffinere potes si precedentia notes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Glosse beginnt: (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Est adverbium adverbe tantum ideo non potest}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  supponere per se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Postquam auctor determinavit de modis consideratis a Donato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hic removet aliqua dubia circa modis nominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primum dubium est quia aliquis posset dubitare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Postquam auctor determinavit de nomine secundum suos modis causa essentiales quam accidentales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 determinat de pronomine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Glosse endet: (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Secundo sic arguitur a parte rei non est aliqua substantiva\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ab uno modo essendi reperto in rei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tertio sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6\endash  Anfang und Schluss fehlen offenbar; 16 Verse umfassender Text, jeweils alternierend mit der Glosse angeordnet; letzere erinnert in Inhalt und Formulierungen stark an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Versor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Super octo partes orationis Donati. \endash  28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

