\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Commentarius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Donati Artem Minorem. (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kopfsteg Schreiberspruch: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 O Maria Virgo sis mecum et conserva me in opere bono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Text: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pars orationis ut ea Donatus utitur< secundum Vincentium sic diffinitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pars oracionis est vox literata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 simplex oracionis integrativa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Schreiberspruch >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 O virgo gracia plena super omnia dulcis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Est igitur nomen secundum Donatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pars oracionis cum casu corpus aut rem proprie communiterve significans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ista dicto questio ad singulas particulas sic declaratur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad designandum actionem vel passionem sine designacione pronomine sine suppositione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et hic de pronomina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur de adverbio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur de adverbio ubi nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod Donatus adverbium a verbo separare noluit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur de accidentibus interiectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ubi advertendum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod Donatus assignavit significacionem interiectioni accidere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sicud accidentale etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  est de significacione interiectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec de interiectione et ceteris partibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 oracionis sufficiant etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Schreiberspruch: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pax vivis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 requiem eternam defunctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Zu dem Schreiberspruch am Schlu\u223 \'df vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Colophons Nr. 22265}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. Dazwischen:
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Notabilia de Verbo. (48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nota extra istam literam aliqua parva et bona notabilia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota aliqua sic illam materiam declarant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia ista verba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 impersonalia interest et refert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Priscianus de impersonabilibus sic inquit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Impersonabile verbum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vercundiam habeo tedet me id est tedum est mihi quamvis dixerint pudeo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tedeo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Erg\u228 \'e4nzende Notizen zu pers\u246 \'f6nlichen und unpers\u246 \'f6nlichen Verbformen. }

