\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Commentarius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Donati Artem Minorem (De octo partibus orationis). (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dominus que pars?< Nomen. Quare? Quia significat substanciam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cum qualitate propria vel communi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quomodo accipitur logica cum informative\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quis est sensus id est nomen significat substanciam in formatam qualitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quare nomen non significat substanciam cum quantitate sicut cum qualitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nomini quot\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 accidunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Qualitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  comparatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quot secundum Priscianum quinque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Species\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 genus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 figura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 numerus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 casus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic est adverbium si dispositionem subjecte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic est propositio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si significavit vinculum ominum participionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic est coniunctio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ego que pars\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pronomen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  A quia loco proprii nominis ponitur et certam significavit personam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (H)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 eu que pars est interiectio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quia interiacet ceteris partibus orationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Donatus ponit interiectionem in ultimo loco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 unde dicitur significatio a nomine signum et a nomen facio is exe etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text stimmt \endash  trotz gleichlautendem Initium \endash  nicht \u252 \'fcberein mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2769}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; die Initien bei Bursill-Hall,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Census, 1981, S. 312 zu kurz um eine Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung eindeutig zu identifizieren; 66a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Schaltzettel mit Notizen zur Ars minor des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aelius Donatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  66a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 77a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

