\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de orthographia metrica. (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sillaba non plura retinet quam sex elementa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sillaba coniunctas vocales non nisi binas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Text endet (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vim terit s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 q\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 g\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 v vocali subeunte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hoc patet in quamvis quam quia lignaque suavis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse beginnt marginal: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Regula Prisciani: Ullam sillaba habet plures litteras}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quam sex uterque in hac dictione streps\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse endet marginal: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Regula quando v sequitur g\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 q vel s et alia vocalis sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 non habemus aliquam diptongon incipientem ab u. etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit tractatus in ortogravia metrice compositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. }

