\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Alexander de Villa Dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Doctrinale}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum glossa, Pars 1. (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Scribere clericulis paro Doctrinale Novellis, pluraque doctorum sociabo scripta meorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... Text endet (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 verborumque data sit declinatio quarta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse beginnt: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Est arbor quedam ramorum duodena ramorum quisque quaterno nidos tenet}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in se nidorum quisque septem volucres tenet in se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et volucrum quisque retinet nomen speciale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Priusquam proceditur ad textum videndum est de aliquibus generalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si bene vis scire librum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 prius ista require utilitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  titulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  intencio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  parsque sophie quatuor et causas rem totam perficientes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et quia magis errare contigit circa subiectum ideo primo videndum est de subiecto huius primi titulis doctrinalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum in principio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cuiuslibet libri septem sunt inquirenda scilicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quis sit auctor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que auctoris intencio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que causa suscepti operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que materia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que utilitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quis titulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Titulus huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est Doctrinale magistri Allexandri de Villa Dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scribere clericulis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui intitulatur Doctrinale etc. dividitur in duas partes scilicet in partem prohemialem et in partem executivam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prohemium in duas partes dividitur quia primo proponit intentum in generali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse endet: >\u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hanc inceptivam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota verbum inchoativum est verbum quod desunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ex isto patet quod staturio staturis similiter prurio pruris non est meditative forme quia non corripit n ante r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (????) \endash  Text mit interlinearen und marginalen (Wort-)glossen; Druck: Reichling, Doctrinale, 1893, S. 1 \endash  70; CXLVIII; vgl. Bursill-Hall, Census, 1981, Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 11, 5, S. 132 \endash  134, bes. S. 132 \endash  133; C.A.L.M.A. Bd. 1,2 (2000), S. 177 \endash  178 (Simona Polidori), bes. S. 177, Nr. 6; zu den Versen am Beginn der Glosse vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 5596}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 17635a}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Druck: Werner, Sprichw\u246 \'f6rter, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1966, S. 46, Nr. 27; die Verse selbst\u228 \'e4ndig (i.e. ohne das Doctrinale) auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 86}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2225}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Text in Ausz\u252 \'fcgen auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 77}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2225}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  bis auf eine Zeile der Glosse (beschnitten) leer, 93a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 100a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 101b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 131a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 154a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 155a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

