\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  393\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Commentarius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in partem tertiam et quartam Doctrinalis {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Alexandri de Villa Dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Pars 3: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Circa inicium huius tractatus sicut et< aliorum librorum causam quadruplex inquiramus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 materialem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 formalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 efficientem et finalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Causa materialis sive subiectum huius tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est sillaba longo vel brevi tempore mensurata. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Causa formalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  est duplex \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pandere proposui pervesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 determinavit auctor superius de illis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui magis faciunt ad esse sui operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in hoc tractatu prosequitur de illis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui faciunt ad bene esse sui operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (361\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Pars 4: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa inicium huius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 capituli sunt aliqua prenotanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  subiectum accentus est sillaba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (362\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accentus varias decet hinc distinguere normas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Completo tractatu de correpcione et productione sillabarum auctor exequitur de accentu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (393\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Doctrinale dei virtute iuvante peregi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic auctor finito opere suo tangit causam medialem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 auctor reddit grates summe trinitati et per communis toti curie celesti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nos itaque forma consilii humiliter subsequentes quamvis inans humana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 deum magnificare nequat super hac quarumcumque notularum compillacione referimus laudes et gracias ipsi deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui est benedictus in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Laus Jesu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Marie filio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich wie {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bursill-Hall, Census, 1981, Nr. 267.12.5}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Stuttgart, WLB, Cod. poet. et phil. 4\u176 \'b0 53}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 238\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), Text im Folgenden jedoch abweichend.}

