\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 394\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  395\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  grammaticalis metricus. (394\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Pondere condigno nunc versiculos vel signo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 estimo quo pondere norme sunt et referande\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (395\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  collecti flores non omnes sed meliores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quos in virgultis variis reperis bene cultis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui dant dulciores discentibus hos et odores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (394\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Marginalglosse beginnt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod oratio tribus modis dividitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Marginalglosse endet (395\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quemcumque casum respondet positivus ... ablativum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sine prepositione significat superlativus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  pluralis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 numeri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vel collectivum significat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 \endash  63 Verse mit marginalen und interlinearen (Wort-)Glossen; Schlu\u223 \'df der Glosse in Teilen nicht mehr lesbar; vgl. Kristeller, Iter, Bd. 6 (1992), S. 504.}

