\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Carolus Virulus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Formulae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  epistolarum. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kopfsteg Besitzvermerk (s. Geschichte). (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tabula huius operis seu libri epistolarum scilicet edite per doctissimum virum nec non famosissimum oratorem dominum Karolum Menniken summa cum diligencia ac laboribus maximis ad utilitatem ac instructionem iuvenum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Text (Kapitelverzeichnis): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Intimatur amico implecio sue peticionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quo ad collectionem epistolarum etc. folio primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Responsio dans rationem cur multe diverse dictiones in hoc libello varia modo inpresse sint\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Folio ultimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finiunt rubrice feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Formulae epistolarum. (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Epistolarum formule in omni genere scribendi iuxta maiorum nostrorum doctrinani et veram epistolandi artem per dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Karolum<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mennicem study Lavoniensis magistrum utique multarum scienciarum virum doctissimum ex epistolis familiaribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Marci Tulli Ciceronis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quem merito eloquencie patrem appellant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et Enee Silvii poete laureati extracte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unicuique exemplorum gracia per neccessarie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et quas maxime utiles feliciter incipiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Intimatur amico implecio sue peticionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quo ad acollectionem epistolarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Salutes plurimas quas effundere possit hic calamus aufferre papirus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Responsio dans rationem cur multe diverse dicciones in hoc libello varia modo impresse sint\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Salutes universas uno glomere connexas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vale \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 forte\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sorte felici et omine fausto etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Schlu\u223 \'dfschrift. (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Salve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si te forsan amice dilecte novisse iuvabit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quos huius voluminis impressorie artis perductor fuerit atque magister\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipito huic artifici nomen esse magistro Petri Cesaris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , ... (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 inchoavit anni septuagesimi octavi Septembris primus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (1. September 1478), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 perfecit que dies ultimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quem artis memorate magistrum si tibi hoc predicto Septembri mense cure fuisset querre facile poteras Parisius inpressioni vacantem in vico sancti Jacobis invenire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 id eciam adiecerim quo tam quid poteris quam quid potuisses agnoscas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Vale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Abschrift eines Druckes; vgl. die Schlu\u223 \'dfformel 107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; demnach kommen als Vorlage in Frage {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW M2051910}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : bei Petrus Caesaris, 1478 in Paris gedruckt; und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW M20520}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : unter Verwendung der identischen Schlu\u223 \'dfschrift bei Guillaume Belsarin, 1478 in Lyon erschienen; zu Petrus Caesaris, seinen Drucken und der Verwendung identischer Schlu\u223 \'dfschriften vgl. Jeanne Veyrin-Forrer, Le deuxi\u232 \'e8me atelier typographique de Paris: Cesaris et Stol, in: Gutenberg-Jahrbuch 1976, S. 117 \endash  129, bes. S. 119 \endash  120, 128 Nr. 25; Alfred W. Pollard, An Essay on Colophons With Specimens And Translations, Chicago 1905, S. 163 \endash  165; au\u223 \'dferdem Polak, Letter Treatises, 1993 \endash  2015, Bd. 3 (2015), S. 370. \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

