\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sententia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  supra primum Librum de generatione et corruptione Aristotelis. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \u8218 \'82(D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 e generatione quidem et corruptione et notitia generatorum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\rquote  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Iste est tertius liber naturalis, in quo post Librum de celo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quo determinatum est de motu ad ubi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in hoc determinatur de motu ad formam et dividitur in duos libros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \u8218 \'82(U)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 niversaliter itaque etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\rquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Istud est secundum capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quo pertractat opiniones antiquorum de aliis motibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text bricht ab (Liber 1, 317a31): \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Segregata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic ostendit qualiter congregacio et segregatio sciunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad generacionem et corrup\-tionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et tamen ibi nunc autem recapitulat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et patet in littera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu (Liber 1, 321a1): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 suscipiendum dat motum augmentationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt (Liber 1, 327b9): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et ideo dicitur quasi forma sicud es colorat stagnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Manifestum igitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic recapitulat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text bricht aufgrund von Blattverlusten mehr\-fach ab und beginnt neu; Textbestand und Fehlstellen auf den Blattr\u228 \'e4ndern von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  vermerkt, z.B. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sentencia supra de generacione et corrupcione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sed non est completa et non tenet nisi v. folia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic desunt quasi duo folia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ibi suscipiendum dat motum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic deest de sentencia primi libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sed posset scribi in isto folio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 36* \endash  37*. \endash  2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

