\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sententia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  supra secundum Librum de generatione et corruptione Aristotelis. (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik (Nachtrag): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sentencia supra secundum Librum de generacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \u8218 \'82(D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 e mixtione quidem et tactu et facere et pati dictum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Iste est secundus Liber de generatione. Postquam determinatum est in primo de generacione et corruptione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et aliis motibus consequentibus istos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in hoc secundo determinatur in speciali de gene\-ratione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et corruptione ipsorum elementorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \u8218 \'82(D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 e elementis autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic Aristotelis determinat generatione ex elementis et est tertius tractatus et est unum capitulum continiens 3 partes principales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (Liber 2, 335b17): \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hii autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ponit aliam opinionem de motu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et per motum sursum erant prima \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  causa efficiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text endet unvermittelt; vgl. hierzu den Vermerk von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  tractatus est incompletus et deest 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 tus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 37*. \endash  9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

