\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  supra secundum Librum de generatione Aristotelis. (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Questio prima Libri secundi de generacione et corruptione erit ista: Utrum omnia elementa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sint ad invicem immediate transmutabilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arguitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si sic sequi\-retur, quod idem moveretur simul motibus communis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (Utrum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si essent infinita elementa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum in quolibet essent infinite contrarietates sive qualitates\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 haberet infinitas qualitatis et quantitatis et quodlibet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  non haberet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et sicut quamvis possent poni propostiones logi\-cales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quasi si essent extra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 \endash  Text bricht auf 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ab und beginnt 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  neu; Raum f\u252 \'fcr fehlende Textstelle ausgespart; Schlu\u223 \'df fehlt; Initien der Quae\-stionen bei Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 37* \endash  38*; (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Vermerk von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Questiones supra secundum Librum de generacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sed non sunt nisi quatuor folia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer; 25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Besitzvermerk (s.o. Geschichte), sonst leer; 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  drei Eintr\u228 \'e4ge eines Inhaltsverzeichnis zu Nicolaus Oresmius, Quaestiones super de generatione (s.u.), sonst leer. }

