\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Oresmius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Libros de generatione Aristotelis, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 C)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 onsequenter secundo queritur, utrum generatio sit alteratio et arguitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia idem est subiectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (C)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 onsequenter 19 queritur utrum indivisibile possit alterari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sunt de genere qualitatum spiritu\-alium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De tertio principali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu: (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (C)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 irca Librum secundum de generatione queritur primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum tantum sint 4 qualitates prime scilicet caliditas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 frigiditas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  humiditas et siccitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et arguitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (C)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 onsequenter 12 queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 utrum possit esse aliquod mixtum \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 alteratum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (am Rand verbessert zu:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 equa\-liter ex clementis et ex qualitatibus et videtur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unver\-mittelt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tunc est inequalitatis in alia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sicut prius declaratum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 \endash  Buch 1 beginnt mit Kapitel 2 und endet in Kapitel 20; Buch 2 endet in Kapitel 13; Druck: Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 10 \endash  173 und S. 181 \endash  281; zum Textbestand vgl. ebenda, S. 38*; Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd. 1,2 (2010), S. 34, Nr. 4; zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Oresmius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  vgl. Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 13,6 (2005), S. 168 \endash  191, bes. S. 178 \endash  179; (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Vermerk {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Questiones Libri de generacione et corrumpcione puto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod fuit a Nicholao de Oresme Normanno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sed deest primo questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sequitur secundo questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

