\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Oresmius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in primum et secundum Librum metheororum Aristotelis. (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 P)rimo queritur circa primum Librum metheororum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 utrum impres\-siones metheorologice fiant secundum naturam inordinationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ideo non est verisimile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nec debemus hoc continue formidare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Explizit und Incipit: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt questiones primi metheororum compilate ante venerabilem magistrum Nicholaum de Oresme Normannum deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt questiones secundi eiusdem ab eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: (P)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 rima questio secundi metheororum erit ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 videlicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : (Utrum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 locus natu\-ralis elementi aque sit ubi nunc est mare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arguitur quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (S)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ecundo queritur utrum mare fluat et refluat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de spera ignis nescimus. \u9553 \'a6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Consequenter 33 queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum habitatio terre permutetur propter permutationem in qualitatibus secundis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Consequenter 14 queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum iris debeat apparere secundum circulum pelliferam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arguitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tota nubis apparet unum continuum quamvis sit diversa pro guttas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 \endash  Zuschreibung der Quaestionen an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Oresmius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  durch Schreiberexplizit auf 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. auch den entsprechenden Titelvermerk von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Questiones \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 primi\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  metheororum compilate ante magistrum Nicholaum de Oresme Normannum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sed de questionibus secundi libri non sunt nisi quatuordecim questiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd. I, 2 (2010), S. 34, Nr. 5; die Handschrift enth\u228 \'e4lt eine in Reihenfolge und Textbestand von der restlichen \u220 \'dcberlieferung stark abweichende Fassung; vgl. hierzu Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 38* \endash  40*; Panzica, Nouvelle r\u233 \'e9daction, 2015 (s. Lit.); dies., Nicole Oresme, 2017 (s. Lit.); dies., De la lune, i. Vb. (s. Lit.)\~; Edition und Analyse jetzt Panzica, Questiones, 2019 (s. Lit.), Sigle D; zu Oresme au\u223 \'dferdem Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 13,6 (2005), S. 168 \endash  191, bes. S. 179 \endash  180; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1024\fs26\chcbpat17 Krakau, Bibliotheca Jagiello\u324 \'f1ska, Cod. 753}}\plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 , 51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 M\u252 \'fcnchen, BSB, Clm 4375}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

