\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Oresmius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sententia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in quatuor Libros metheororum, unvoll\-st\u228 \'e4ndig. (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: (D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 e primis quidem igitur causis nature et de omni motu in naturaliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Iste dicitur Liber metheororum et quare sic vocatur}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 ,}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 patuit in prima questione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Ordo istius liber ad alios precedentes et sequentes patet in prohemio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quantum ad divisionem primo determinatur de illis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sunt superius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic recapitulat et patet in littera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Explizit und Incipit: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit sentent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [i]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 primi methe\-ororum reportata ante magistrum Nicholaum Oresme nationis Normannorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit sententia secundi eiusdem reportata ab eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 e mari autem et que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 natura ipsius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic assignatur secundus liber unde in primo determinatur de impressionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sunt ex exalatione calida\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et quomodo sunt igitur parvules\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De agitacione aeris et motu terre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste est tercius tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quo determinatur de motu terre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tertius Liber. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic incipit tertius liber secundum expositiores et patet continuacio ad precedencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aristoteles volebat determinare de hiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sunt in nube \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ex exalatione calida\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ipsa est ita debilis etiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 obstina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod non potest videri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 Nach\-trag (wohl von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quod autem neque circulum possibile est fieri yridis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic deficit de tercio libro quasi unum folium vel duo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu: (Q)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 uoniam quidem cause determinate quatuor sunt etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste est quartus Liber metheororum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui continuatur sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prius Aristotelis determinavit de passionibus metheororum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oportet autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic Aristoteles assignavit ratione illius quodmodo dictum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ad secundam partem patet ex dicta quia solum aqua calida id est frigido minori patet quia talia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Zuweisung an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Oresmius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  aufgrund des Explizits (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , s.o.); einziger, erhaltener Textzeuge; Text endet 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  un\-vermittelt; zum Textbestand vgl. Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 40*; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 13,6 (2005), S. 168 \endash  191; die Fehlstellen sowie der Anfang der einzelnen B\u252 \'fccher jeweils durch entsprechende Vermerke von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  hervorgehoben (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). \endash  113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

