\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Vezalia (Parisius)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Libri de anima Aristotelis. (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Q)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 uertiur primo circa Librum de anima, utrum de anima sit sciencia demonstrativa}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et arguitur quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Consequenter 37\u176 \'b0 queritur utrum sensus particulares cognoscunt suas operationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quam non videlicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Explizit: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt questiones supra primum et secundum de anima in numero 37 reportate ante magistrum Johannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa tercium Librum de anima primo queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 utrum fuerit Aristoteles sive commentator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  intellectum est formam abstractam et inmixtam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Consequenter 26 queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 utrum vivens in aliquo tempore sit in statu ita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et sic sit dictum ad questionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Schreibervermerk:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Expliciunt questiones supra Librum de anima reportate ante magistrum Johannem de Vezalia in vico straminum Parisius per manus Johannis Margan de Yma anno domini m\u176 \'b0ccc\u176 \'b0 46\u176 \'b0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (1346)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Die Autorenzuweisung beruht auf den beiden Schreibervermerken 176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (s.o.) sowie einem entsprechenden Eintrag von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd. I,1 (2013), S. 353, Nr. 8; Quaestionenbestand bei Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 41* \endash  43*; zu dem Autor {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Vezalia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  s.o. 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Dazwischen: 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) zwei zus\u228 \'e4tzliche {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestionen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  wohl zu Aristoteles, De sensu et sensato: (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Queritur utrum lumen sit qualitas distinca exiens realiter in medio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et hoc non est inconveniens \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et sic patet quomodo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 2. (Utrum) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sint aliqua virtus interior\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que simul remittetur ab omnibus sensibilibus diversorum sensuum particularium exteriorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 licet color sit proprii obvius visus quod participiatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ab aliquo sensu interiori et a sensu communi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et sic patet questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 \endash  178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

