\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Ockham}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Librum porphyrii de praedicabilibus Aristotelis, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 H)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 umanum omne operans, quod in suis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 partibus\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  operibus et actionibus potest errare aliquo indigat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum sit necessarium Grisarori etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste liber est primus secundum ordinem doctrine inter libros logice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cuius noticia non est unus per numerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed est collectio multarum noticiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Proprium quadrifariam dividunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic auctor agit de proprio solum dividens suas significationes in membra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vel geometram est proprium homini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quia solus homo est huius-\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <modi, et tamen non omnis homo ...> \endash  Text bricht zu Beginn des Kapitel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De proprio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ab; zur Autorzuschreibung vgl. Lohr, Com\-mentaries, 1967 \endash  1974, 2 (1968), S. 149 \endash  245, bes. S. 204 \endash  205; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 11909}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Ernest A. Moody, u.a. (Hrsg.), Guillelmi de Ockham opera philosophica et theologica ad fidem codicum manuscriptorum edita cura Instituti Franciscani Universitatis S. Bonoventurae (Opera philosophica, Bd. 2), St. Bonaventure (New York) 1978, S. 3 \endash  80; (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Vermerk {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippe d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9es}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sentencia seu Lectura supra Porfirium sive supra Veterem Artem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 puto quod sit a Johanne de Vezalia si non sunt nisi quinque folia cum dimidio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; schreibt den Text erneut {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Vezalia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zu; ihm folgen Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd. I,1 (2013), S. 351 \endash  352, Nr. 2; vgl. Ernest A. Moody, The Logic of William of Ockham, London 1935, S. 66 \endash  117; Pattin, Repertorium commentariorum, 1978, S. 34 \endash  35, Nr. 499, I; Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 43*; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 6,3 (1998), S. 199 \endash  128, bes. S. 126; C.A.L.M.A, Bd. 5 (2017), S. 125 \endash  134 (C. Columba). \endash  198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

