\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Ockham}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Expositio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Librum Perihermenias Aristotelis, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Postquam Aristoteles in Libro Predicamentorum de incomplexis doctrinam tradidit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in isto libro de propositionibus complexis intendit dare noticiam suppositionis aliquibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 communibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Catonis aut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [Catoni]\lquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic excludit casus nominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sciendum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 obliqus potest supponere respectu verbi si ei addatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [ad] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 predicatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nam bene dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <hominis est asinus ... >. \endash  Text bricht unvermittelt im Kapitel De nomine ab; vgl. den entsprechenden Vermerk {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Supra Librum Periermeniarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed non sunt nisi tria folia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 11909}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Moody, u.a. (Hrsg.), Guillelmi de Ockham Opera, 1978 (s.o. 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 345 \endash  382; Initien der Quaestionen bei Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 43*; Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd. I,1 (2013), S. 351 \endash  352, Nr. 2 schreiben diesen und den vorausgehenden Text {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Vezalia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zu;weitere Lit. s.o. 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

