\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Vezalia (Parisius)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Sententia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Libri analyticorum posteriorum Aristotelis, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 mnis doctrina et omnis disciplina fit ex preexistenti cognitione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iste liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui vocatur posteriorum analeticorum Aristotelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic continuatur ad precendentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Superius philosophus scilicet in Libro priorum determinavit de sillogismo simpliciter id est de sillogismo non contracto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Manifestum est autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic Aristoteles declarat suam propositionem per inductionem de quod hic apparet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de questionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 doctrina et omnis disciplina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Text bricht ab: (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \u8218 \'82(S)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 i autem interrogatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\rquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic incipit capitulum \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 undecimum \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 huius libri et continuatur sic prius vel in sequencio capitulo ostendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod deceptio est ex propriis principiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 linee equedistances concurrant et eodem modo potest argui in aliis scienciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et que secundum ignorantiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \rquote . Reklamant: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Potest secundum questionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 \endash  Text bricht 218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Buch 1 ab (I, 12, 77b 18 \endash  19); vgl. hierzu (211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Vermerk {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 Questiones\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Sentencia Libri posteriorum a Johanne de Vezalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ut puto et non est nisi unus quaternus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Caroti, De generatione et corruptione, 1996, S. 44*; vgl. Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd. I,1 (2013), S. 352, Nr. 5. }

