\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Vezalia (Parisius)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Libri elencorum Aristotelis. (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Q)uestio prima Libri elencorum erit ista: Utrum ad dyalecticum pertineat}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ad \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  artem de sillogismo sophistico \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Consequenter queritur vicesimosecundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 utrum non causa, ut causa sit locus sophisticus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que videtur esse causa et tunc non est causa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alia soluta est et sic patet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt questiones primi Libri Elenchorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (Q)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 uestio prima secundi elenchorum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Utrum ars respondendi ad sophistica sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 utilis ad gloriam et ad philosophiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (C)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 onsequenter queritur tredecimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Utrum ista propositio sit vera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 album erat non album\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per motum est dare ultimum instans sui esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad aliam omnis propositio de futuro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 soluta est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt questiones Libri elencorum scripte coram reverendo magistro Johanne de Vezalia per manum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Henrici Johannis de Daurediche dyocesis Leodiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Der erste Teil des Textes enth\u228 \'e4lt 22, der zweite 13 Quaestionen; Initien bei Caroti, De genera\-tione et corruptione, 1996, S. 44* \endash  45*; Autorzuschreibung aufgrund des Schreiber\-explizits und des Vermerks {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (beschnitten) (219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Questiones Libri Elencorum scripte coram magistro Johannes de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <Vezalia (?)>; vgl. Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd.I,1 (2013), S. 352, Nr. 6. \endash  232\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

