\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 i\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  xvi\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cato}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Disticha Catonis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Antiquus et Novus Cato commixti). (i\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum animi adverterem quamque plurimos homines graviter errare in via morum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (i\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primum capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si deus est animus nobis, ut carmina dicunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Lingwa paterna sonat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod ei sapiencia donat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (v\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et tibi carus eris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 semper dum dives haberis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit primum capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit secundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...<. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Telluris si forte velis cognoscere cultus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (viii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit secundum capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tercium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...<. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hoc quicumque velis carmen cognoscere lector\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  .... (xi\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit tercium capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tercium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!) ...<. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Securam quicumque cupis deducere vitam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (xvi\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Miraris verbis me nudis scribere versus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mens paupertina coniungxit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  carmina bina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit commixtura utriusque Kathonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Text vereinzelt mit interlinearen, in der Regel lateinischen Wortglossen; Druck: Boas/ Botschuyver, Disticha Catonis, 1952, S. 4 \endash  259; \plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 Zato\u269 \'e8il, Cato a Facetus, 1952\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , S. 229 \endash  237; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 1048}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, Nr. 1048; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 3551, 17703, 10340}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; VL(2), Bd. 1 (1978), Sp. 1192 \endash  1196 (Peter Kesting); VL(2), Bd. 6 (1986), Sp. 1236 \endash  1240 (Franz Josef Worstbrock); Henkel, \u220 \'dcbersetzungen, 1988, S. 228 \endash  231 und 274 \endash  276; Orb\u225 \'e1n, Novus Phisiologus, 1989 (s. Lit.), S. 8; Kohush\u246 \'f6lter, Gregorius, 2012 (s. Lit.), S. 52; Rubel, S\u252 \'fcnder, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2009 /\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2019 (s. Lit.), S. 39; i\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Kopfsteg wohl Schreiberspruch, beschnitten, nicht mehr lesbar. }

