\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 lviiii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  lxxx\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Anonymus Neveleti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum glossis ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Fabulae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Aesopi moralisate). (lviiii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ysopus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ut iuvat et prosit, conatur pagina presens: Dulcius arrident seria picta iocis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (lxxx\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Fine fruor versu gemino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod cogitat omnis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Fabula declarat datque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod intus habet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Esopus deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Schreibervers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si quis scribebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  nomen si dare nolebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis adest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  vere scriptor volt pretium habere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 O scriptor cessa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quia manus est tibi fessa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Esopus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Text mit zahlreichen interlinearen und marginalen Glossen in Lateinisch und Deutsch; Druck: Foerster, Lyoner Yzopet, 1882, S. 96 \endash  137; Hervieux, Fabulistes, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1893 \endash  1899/ 1965, Bd. 2, S. 316 \endash  351; Draheim, Aesopus, 1893, S. 8 \endash  36; Wright, \lquote Walter of England\rquote , 1997, S. 19 \endash  163; N\u246 \'f6cker, Proverbium, 2015, S. 548 \endash  746; Busdraghi, L\rquote Esopus, 2005 (s. Lit.), S. 44 \endash  194; vgl. ebenda, S. 207; Hervieux, Fabulistes, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1893 \endash  1899/ 1965, Bd. 1, S. 472 \endash  666; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 19812}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, S. 138, Nr. 105a.); Dicke/ Grubm\u252 \'fcller, Fabeln, 1987, S. LXVI \endash  LXVIII; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 1818}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nr. 6218}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, Nr. 1818 und Nr. 6218; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 3 (2011), Sp. 640 \endash  642 (A. Bisanti), bes. S. 641 \endash  642, Nr. 1; N\u246 \'f6cker, Proverbium, 2015, S. 63 \endash  65; Grubm\u252 \'fcller, Meister Esopus, 1977, S. 61 und 82; Orb\u225 \'e1n, Novus Phisiologus, 1989 (s. Lit.), S. 9; Kohush\u246 \'f6lter, Gregorius, 2012 (s. Lit.), S. 54; Rubel, S\u252 \'fcnder, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2009 /\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2019 (s. Lit.), S. 40; zu den Schreiberversen am Schlu\u223 \'df vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Colophons, Nr. 21301 \endash  21303}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 22685 \endash  22686}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Thorndike, Final Jingles, 1956, S. 321 \endash  328, bes. S. 326; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2327}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 261\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 3148}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

