. 787 \endash  834, bes. S. 803 \endash  812; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 2521}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 0693}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, Nr. 0693; Henkel, \u220 \'dcbersetzungen, 1988, S. 235 \endash  236; VL(2), Bd. 2 (1980), Sp. 5 \endash  8 (Rainer Rudolf), Bd. 11 (2004), Sp. 335 \endash  336; Orb\u225 \'e1n, Novus Phisiologus, 1989 (s. Lit.), S. 10; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 2 (2008), S. 343 Nr. 5 (Leslie Lockett); Kohush\u246 \'f6lter, Gregorius, 2012 (s. Lit.), S. 56; Rubel, S\u252 \'fcnder, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2009 /\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2019 (s. Lit.), S. 40; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 23}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2327}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 236\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 3223}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , s. DA LuHB Kat. 4, S. 281; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 819}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (nur Ausz\u252 \'fcge), s. DA ULB Kat. 5,2.}

