\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Prognostica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum glossa. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Omnipotens opifex operis dator huius et auctor}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut stet opus fer opem calamum rege sis mihi fautor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ponatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod egritudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 incipiat hodie alicui homini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tunc considera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si principium egritudinis sit bonum principium egritudinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ponamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod mulier aliqua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 concipiat aut poniat ab principium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ponatur quod alicui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 homini incipiat aliqua egritudo acuta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Luna habet aspectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 \u218 \'da\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  primum in augmento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod ubicumque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Luna fuerit in principio egritudinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Platonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui sunt Cretici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 inventi per motum Lune super egritudines acutas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et iste est primus peryodus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et ita per ordinem in aliis 20 diebus alie 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 s\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  7\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 me\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  concluduntur et terminantur in 40 diebus et 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in lx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Kopfsteg) Glossen beginnen: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nota Res, qui conservant sanitatem sunt sex scilicet exercitium moderatum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 balneum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 potus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sompnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 coitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arnoldus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Libro de Coitu c. 3\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Es folgen auf den Blattr\u228 \'e4ndern die Tierkreiszeichen, in Spalten und Gruppen nach ihren Eigenschaften geordnet ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glossen enden: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cura omni die unguatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 locii cum oleo de ramo nutrix abstineat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 secundum viam istam multos meo tempore curavi sine aliquo periculo et timore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Thomas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?). \endash  Medizinische Prognostik mit Glossen.}

