\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Maino de Maineri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber medicinalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt: De vinis artificialibus. (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa secunda tercii tractatus est de vinis artificialibus et continet plura capitula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et est primum capitulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quomodo fuerit vina artificialia et valere possunt in cura multarum egritudinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et licet de humori vinis artificialibus multa alia dici possent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ista tunc ad presens volo sufficere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 finitur tractatus de vino cum dei laude et sue matris gloriose virginis Marie,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quibus sit honor et gloria in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Wohl Auszug aus dem Liber medicinalis; zu Autor und Sekund\u228 \'e4rliteratur s.o. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

