\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Maino de Maineri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber medicinalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpte. (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dicit idem Mayninus capitulo primo libri a quo prescripta sit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  excerpta ea et secuntur hoc modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 licet aer sit humidori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  aqua essencialiter et in actu primo tamen aqua humidior est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  de necessitate aque in mixtorum compositione et aliorum elementorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod sunt res naturales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quatuor elementa ex necessitate concurrunt ad quodlibet mixtum saltem perfectam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...  (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 A 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  capitulo predicte summe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Intentum presenti tercii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 a natura qua in quantum est unum elementorum ingredientum nostri corporis compositionem est res naturalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 unde hoc inter alia est sicut auris inter metalla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alia excerpta a 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  capitule eiusdem summe require in finis huius voluminis ad hoc signum \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 00\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Der Text, auf den am Schlu\u223 \'df verwiesen wird, fehlt in der Handschrift aufgrund von Blattverlusten. }

