\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Maino de Maineri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Regimen sanitatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pars prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De necessitate huius operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quod regimen sanitatis sit necessarium duplici via investigacione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Contingit prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quid materia summitur ex variabilitate corporis humani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text bricht ab: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Santiatis cerebri sub fumigationibus conservatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et precipue \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 gallorum\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cerebrum gallorum veterum sive turturum mirabiliter acuit intellectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amplius subfumigetur caput\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Reklamant: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 super fumum vel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <aque decoctionis camomille: sticados et mentastri ...> (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu: <Puta videndo colorem et substantiam menstruorum diversarum> \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 mulierum in complexione et etate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dicta sunt ex hiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que matricem conservat et confortat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In hoc igitur terminetur regimen sanitatis apropriatum femineo sexui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De regulis regiminis sanitatis ex diversitate rerum non naturalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tertie partis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nos dicemus in hoc capitulo primo de dispositione terre habitabilibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Non enim debet esse terra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cuius habitatione eligit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  de balneo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Post consideratcione exercicii et fricationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text bricht ab: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Debet autem eligi balneum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cuius fabrica est antiqua et cuius aer est amplius et aqua dulcis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et debet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <balneator mensurare ignem secundum naturam illius ...> (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt neu: <Immo etiam adolescentes possunt vivere sani sine usu coitus sicut apparet in multis viris venerabilibus, qui toto eorum tempore> \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vivunt continentis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et sani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed sine dubio saniores essent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De Farmacia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut interdum ventris solutione quibusdam hominibus competit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si autem ventositas sit in causa vel constipatio intestinorum clisteria sunt competens medicina et dissoluentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Reklamant: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ventositatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u9553 \'a6 <Si autem medicina exhibita non operetur et declinet ad superiora et generet morsum cordis ...>. \endash  Text bricht aufgrund von Blattverlusten mehrfach ab und beginnt neu (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 /24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : Pars 2, Capitulum 6 De cerebro/ Pars 2, Capitulum 7: De conservatione matricis; 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 /31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : Pars 3, Capitulum 4, De balneo/ Pars 3, Capitulum 5, De coitu; 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Pars 5, Capitulum 5 De farmacia); der Schlu\u223 \'df fehlt ganz; das Werk wird h\u228 \'e4ufig auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arnoldus de Villa Nova}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zugeschrieben und unter seinem Namen gedruckt; vgl. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, S. 437 \endash  438, Nr. 211es.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre, Sp. 1255}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; zu Autor und Werk s.o. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Marilyn Nicoud, Les R\u233 \'e9gimes de Sant\u233 \'e9 au Moyen \u194 \'c2ge. Naissance et Diffusion d\rquote une \u233 \'e9criture m\u233 \'e9dicale (XIII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  XV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  si\u232 \'e8cle), Rom 2007 (Biblioth\u232 \'e8que des \u233 \'e9coles fran\u231 \'e7aises d\rquote Ath\u232 \'e8nes et de Rome. Fasc. 333), 2 B\u228 \'e4nde, Bd.1, S. 242 \endash  269; Bd. 2, S. 710 \endash  711; Druck (Textabgleich mit): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 VD 16 M221}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW M19890}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bl. a2a; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 M1988910}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 M19892}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 M19893}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 M19898}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 M19897}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Bl. a3b. }

