\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Heinrich Bebel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hecatostichon de insignibus armorum Petri Jacobi Arlunensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad iurisconsultissimum et disertissimum virum Petrum Jacobi Arlunensem de eius insignibus armorum hecatostichon H. Bebelii poet\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  laureati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Adsitis mecum dulces Heliconis alumn\u281 e et mea pieriis ora rigate modis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 Nec te diviti\u281 \'ea tollunt vel gratia regum m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 obilitate vagans: spes tua sola deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Schmidt, Rheinische Handschriften (s. Lit.), 1905, S. 97 \endash  98; Donati, Simbolismo, 1951 (s. Lit.); zu Heinrich Bebel vgl. Mertens, Bebels Einstand, 1994 (s. Lit.); (jeweils mit Teilabdruck). \endash  6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

