\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Versanklage}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Charles, Duc d\rquote Orl\u233 \'e9ans}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  gegen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippe (le Hardi), Duc de Bourgogne}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und dessen Antwort. >\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 Provocatio qu\u281 \'eadam in certamen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 a duce Aurelianensi post necere patris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 ad ducem Burgundi\u281 \'ea missa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Te licet atra palus herebi septemplici muro}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si me fata sinant vitam extendere factis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Responsio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Si cecidisse tuum iusta ratione parentem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Bella deus scelerum penas in pondere pendes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs26 \u932 \'d4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Epigramme in Versform aus dem B\u252 \'fcrgerkrieg der Armagnacs gegen die Bourguignons (1410 \endash  1419); Druck: Loys Gollut, Les memoires historiques de la republique Sequanoise, et des princes de la Franche Comt\u233 \'e9 et de Bourgogne, Dole 1592, S. 637 \endash  638; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 19048}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Fran\u231 \'e7oise Fery-Hue, La tradition manuscrite du Lapidaire du Roi Philippe, in: Scriptorium 54 (2000), S. 191 \endash  102, bes. S. 154, Nr. 9 und 11, Anm. 147 und 149. \endash  100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

