7 Heinrich Bebel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?); 2. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 J.K. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hoc erit usque situm in promptu tibi nobile di}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ctum, quod fecere ipse potes: non expectabis amicos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

