stiftlinien; 2zeilige braune Lombarden. \endash  Predigten, u.a. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De ascensione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nos autem gloriari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... (Gal 5, 14). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Primus notandum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 quod gloriari debemus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Michi autem absit gloriari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (Gal 6, 14) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In verbis istis tria sunt consideranda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ..., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Petit et accipietis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (Io 16, 24). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota circa peticiones quatuor differentias petit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...;}

