n \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et in hoc finis prime particule\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur secunda pars\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sit tabulam eorum qui digestiva\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et primo de simplicibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 secundo de compositis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Simplicia digestiva colere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...  (56*\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic est finis Thamaracii nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sciendum pro administracione simplicium predictorum recursus habeatur ad secundum Avicennam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et pro quorundam preparacione ad librum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Servitoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 alias aliter exhibita forent venenum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et secundum regulas iam in precedentibus assignatas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 si qua tamen nomina simplicium sint\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Avicenne alii Januensis declarabuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et hic summarie sint dicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Nachtrag eines kurzen lat. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rezepts}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , in Deutsch \u252 \'fcberschrieben mit: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rode rosen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

