\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Algeri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Computus chirometralis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum glossa, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. Text beginnt: (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cognicio veritatis de pausis temporum circa motum Solis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et Lune orbium et aliorum planetarum cum sit tenebrosa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sunt autem Sol ocilus mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si tunc tangis membrum signatum sub 8\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 habebis quotus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sit Idus istius mensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scilicet si incipis numerare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \u9553 \'a6 <post octo unum et iterum contrario modo donec perveniris ad membrum signatum ...>. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Iste liber de cuius subiecto visum est, prima fuit distinctione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dividitur in \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 3\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  duos tractatos principales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quorum primo determinat de distinctionibus temporum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primus tractatus habet quatuor partes principales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quorum primo ponit prohemium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si vero ergo fuerit litera Dominicalis tunc Festum Andree cadit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est festum canonisatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod celebrabitur in loco suo proprio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text endet unvermitttelt S. 38, Zeile 26 der Ausgabe von M\u252 \'fctz (s.u.); das Werk wurde fr\u252 \'fcher {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Erfordia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zugeschrieben; Druck: M\u252 \'fctz, Computus Chirometralis, 2003, S. 6 \endash  38; vgl. Zinner, Verzeichnis, 1925, Nr. 2662; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 13927}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Lorenz, Studium, 1989, S. 249 \endash  260, bes. S. 251 und 259; ders., Johannes Algeri, 2003, S. 184 \endash  190, bes. S. 185, Anm. 80; Cordoliani, Les manuscrits d\rquote Utrecht, 1961, S. 76 \endash  85, bes. S. 77; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre, Sp. 231}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 22}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2769}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Schaltzettel: 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  mit Cisioianus-Versen; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Verse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 76}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1415}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1571}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2769}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Schriftreste eines kommentierten Textes, 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. \endash  87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

