\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Albertus de Orlamunda}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philosophia pauperum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum commento, Pars 1. (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 P)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 hilosophia dividitur in tres partes scilicet logicam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ethicam et phisicam seu racionalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 moralem et naturalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de quibus aliis duobus obmissus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quantum autem ad bene agere sicut contemplari et frui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est in eternitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et hec de prima parte dicta sufficiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 Kommentar beginnt; Prolog: (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tu gloria Jerusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tu leticia Israel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tu honorificentia populi nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Jdt 15, 10) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scribitur Judith xv\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quamquam hec verba de Judith sunt dicta et postea de virgina celorum preconisata}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et scientes tradendi sunt Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cui nos dignetur tradi ipse idem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui cum patre et spiritu sancto regnat eternaliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Kapitel 1: \u8218 \'82(P)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hilosophia dividitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Iste liber, cuius subiectum est ens mobile secundum autorem nostrum corpus mobile communis sumptum et qui intitulatur Summa Naturalium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prima sui divisione dividitur in quinque tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod incepit esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de simul esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut patet ex dictis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 708 \endash  715}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Borgnet, Alberti Magni Opera, 1890 \endash  1899, Bd. 5 (1890), S. 445 \endash  463; vgl. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, S. 75, Nr. 6dl.); Little, Roger Bacon\rquote s Works, 1914, S. 419, Nr. 67; Martin Grabmann, Die Philosophia pauperum und ihr Verfasser Albert von Orlam\u252 \'fcnde, M\u252 \'fcnster 1918 (Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte der Philosophie des Mittelalters. Texte und Untersuchungen, Bd. 20, Heft 2); Bernhard Geyer, Die Albert dem Grossen zugeschriebene Summa naturalium (Philosophia naturalium). Texte und Untersuchungen, M\u252 \'fcnster 1938 (Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte der Philosophie und Theologie des Mittelalters. Texte und Untersuchungen Bd. 35, Heft 1); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre, Sp. 1042}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Lohr, Commentaries, 1967 \endash  1974, (1967), S. 345 \endash  348, bes. S. 346, Nr. 1; S. 395 \endash  396 (Conradus Summenhart); (1973), S. 115 \endash  121, bes. S. 121, Nr. 20 (Rogerus Bacon); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, Scriptores, Bd. 1, S. 31 \endash  32, Nr. 112}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, S. 78, Nr. 14dl.); Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, Bd. 1 (2013), S. 32 \endash  35; C.A.L.M.A, Bd. I.2 (2000), S. 133 \endash  134, bes. S. 130, Nr. 1 (Christian Heitzmann). }

