\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa240\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Streax, Katalog, 1589\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Bouxhon, Summa, 1667\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Paquot, Catalogue, 1788, S. 164, Nr. 511\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Roth, Mittellat. Hss., 1891, S. 261\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~M. Wilmotte, Gloses wallonnes du Ms 2640 de Darmstadt, in: \u201 \'c9tudes romanes dedi\u233 \'e9es \u224 \'e0 Gaston Paris le 29 Decembre 1890 (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  anniversaire de son doctorat des lettres) par ses \u233 \'e9l\u232 \'e8ves fran\u231 \'e7ais et ses \u233 \'e9l\u232 \'e8ves \u233 \'e9trangers des pays de langue fran\u231 \'e7aise, Paris 1891, S. 239 \endash  252 (Reprint in: ders., \u201 \'c9tudes de philologie wallone, Paris 1932, S. 151 \endash  165)\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Osternacher, \u220 \'dcberlieferung, 1916, S. 331 \endash  376, bes. S. 360, Nr. 35\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Volk, H\u252 \'fcpsch, 1925, S. 208 und S. 216\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Cordoliani, Les manuscrits d\rquote Utrecht, 1961, S. 83 (nur zu 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Betty Nye Quinn, Ps. Theodolus, in: Paul Oskar Kristeller (Hrsg.), Catalogus Translationum et Commentariorum, Bd. 2, Washington D.S. 1971, S. 383 \endash  408, bes. S. 395\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Franco Munari (Hrsg.), Mathei Vindocinensis Opera, Bd. 1: Catalogo dei Manoscritti, Rom 1977 (Storia e Letteratura. Raccolta di Studi e Testi, Bd. 144), S. 42 \endash  44\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Tony Hunt, The Old French Cato in Ms Darmstadt 2640, in: Vox Romanica 39 (1980), S. 44 \endash  63\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Kristeller, Iter, Bd. 3 (1983), S. 516\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Mortiaux-DeNo\u235 \'ebl, Fonds, 1991, S. 186, Nr. L. 6\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Mortiaux-DeNo\u235 \'ebl/Guillaume, Fonds, 1997, S. 369, Nr. 129\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Falmagne/ Otis, Surviving Manuscripts, 2009, S. 201, Nr. 2575\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Baldzuhn, Schulb\u252 \'fccher, 2009, S. 494 \endash  498\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Harald Anderson, The Manuscripts of Statius, Vol. 1 \endash  3, Revised Edition, Arlington 2009; Bd. 1, S. 75 \endash  76; Bd. 2, S. 137\~\~\u183 \'b7\~\~Xhayet, M\u233 \'e9decine, 2010.}

