\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Disticha Catonis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum Commentario {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Roberti de Euremodio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cum animadverterem, quod plurimos homines errare graviter via morum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si deus est animus nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...< (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hos brevitas sensus fecit coniungere binos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Kommentar}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In principio cuiuslibet actoris plura occurunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum animadverterem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 id est cum in animo meo veterem et considerarem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut ameris amabilis esto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 incipit liber primus Ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tonis bene dictur primis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quia sequitur secundus unde versus incipit hic Cato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fecit coniungere binos versus sufficient ad duos versus et non plures etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Centorius Affrica datur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nuncupatur, quod librum non fecit hunc satis denotatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quo circa prohemium vertitur intencio huius capituli operis patet in prohemio cum videre in plurimos in gradu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 speravi ut pro tempore habens forem auxilio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 exequidit codicibus talis ad ea titulus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic Catonis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Textbestand in der Reihenfolge der Handschrift (nach der Edition von Boas s.u.): Epistula, Breves sententiae 1 \endash  5, 16, 6, 17, 8, 7, 9, 18, 43, 45 \endash  50, 52 \endash  56; Liber 1,1 \endash  40; Liber 2, Praefatio 1 \endash  10, Liber 2,1 \endash  7, 1, 8, 7, 2, 9 \endash  31; Liber 3, Praefatio 1 \endash  2, Liber 3,1, Praefatio 3 \endash  4; Liber 3,2 \endash  24; Praefatio Liber 4, 1 \endash  4, Liber 4,1 \endash  14, 16 \endash  49; Druck (Text): Boas/ Botschuyver, Disticha Catonis, 1952, S. 4 \endash  259; (Kommentar): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 06281 \endash  06297}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 3551}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 23}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2481}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Auswahl); frz. s.u. 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; zur Textredaktion des Kommentars vgl. auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vatikan, BAV, Vat. lat. 1479}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

