\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ecloga Theodoli}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum Commentario {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Alexandri Neckam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?). (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ethioporum terras iam fervida torrui estas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...< Text endet: (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Desine quod restat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ne desperatio ledat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Kommentar}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Incipit liber iste primulus. Est hec utilitas doceatur populariter}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 purgatis viciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sensum sequi sedulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 expresse superius satis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 designatur cui parti sciencie liber sapponatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ethice supponitur liber nam tractatus moribus hiis habitis littera dicatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \u8218 \'82(E)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 thipiorum terras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Eglogarum tres sunt species vel diversitates et consistit in cuneis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et canitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (? statt: cancris) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 reprehensionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar endet: \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 desine illud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod restat\lquote ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 id est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod superest ad dicendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 alicia ne desparatio presenti sicut ledit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 alicia dicere plura s. quod restat id est quod superest nisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  <...> \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 desperacio ledit per presenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Osternacher, Theoduli Eclogam, 1902, S. 30 \endash  54; Casaretto, Teodulo. Ecloga, 1997, S. 2 \endash  24; vgl. Osternacher, \u220 \'dcberlieferung, 1916, S. 360, Nr. 35; Walther, Streitgedicht, 1920/ 1984, S. 93 \endash  99; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 0334}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB, Nr. 8811}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (statt: 8011); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 664}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Schaller/ K\u246 \'f6nsgen, Initia carminum, 1977, Nr. 442}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Supplement-Band (2005) Nr. 442; zum Kommentar und seiner Zuschreibung an Alexander Neckam: vgl. Nye Quinn, Ps. Theodolus, 1971 (s. Lit.), S. 395; Christopher J. McDonough, The Laus Beatissime Virginis and the Canon of Alexander Neckam, S. 99 \endash  128, in: Mediaeval Studies 66 (2004); Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung (mit Kommentar): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vatikan, BAV, Vat. lat. 1479}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2780}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , cclxxxx\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 3162}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Federproben stark abgegriffen und verbla\u223 \'dft).}

