\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Incipiunt parabole philosophie. Doctrinam cerneris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  terre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Da mihi vim deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui doctus sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) ...(58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rabc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum auctor iste plures errare videret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hunc librum composuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ut peccatis omissis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota ergo est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod in hoc libro sunt quinque inquirenda scilicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que materia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que intencio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que uti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u9553 \'a6<litas>, (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que titulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que causa suscipienda operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Materia huius libri sunt parabol\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u9553 \'a6<e> \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 philosophie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glosse endet marginal: \u9553 \'a6 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 queris quia nescis unde vel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <...>\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 is librum doctrine poteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <...>\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scere fine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text endet unvermittelt kurz vor dem Ende des Werks; die letzten zw\u246 \'f6lf Verse fehlen; Anfang und Ende der Glosse durch Beschneiden der Seitenstege gest\u246 \'f6rt; Druck: PL, Bd. 210, Sp. 581 \endash  594; vgl. Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, Nr. 12i.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 71}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Marie Th\u233 \'e9r\u232 \'e8se d\rquote Alverny, Alain de Lille. Textes in\u233 \'e9dits, Paris 1965 (\u201 \'c9tudes de philosophie m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale, Bd. 52), S. 51 \endash  52; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, S. 16, Nr. 16}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, S. 28, Nr. 16; Henkel, \u220 \'dcbersetzungen, 1988, S. 215 \endash  217; C.A.L.M.A. Bd. 1,2 (2000) S. 96 \endash  99, bes. S. 97, Nr. 19 (Alberto Bart\u242 \'f2la); Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 23}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

