X \endash  XXVIII; Dicke/ Grubm\u252 \'fcller, Fabeln, 1987, S. LXVIII L2; Suerbaum, Litterae, 2000 (s. Lit.), 383 \endash  434; VL(2), Bd. 11 (2002), Sp. 195 \endash  204 (M. Baldzuhn); Bisanti, Le favole, 2010; zur Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung vgl. Guaglianone, La tradizione manoscritta, 1957, S. 5 \endash  30; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 23}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2780}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lxxxviii\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

