\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar beginnt: ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 O)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 mnia que a primeva rerum origine processerunt ratione numeri formata sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Kommentar endet: (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et erit novenarius summa huius totus progressionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si scire scito progessionem volueris debes respicere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 impar si fuerit per maius multiplicetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Algorismus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text am Schlu\u223 \'df im Vergleich zum Druck bei Halliwell (s.u.) um sechs Verse erweitert; vgl. Zinner, Verzeichnis, 1925, Nr. 11416; Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, S. 86, Nr. 23f.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 7470}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Nr. 1421}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Mohan, Initia, 1975 \endash  1978, (1976), S. 313; Nadia Ambrosetti, Algorithmic in the 12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Century: The Carmen de Algorismo by Alexander de Villa Dei, in: F. Gadducci/ M. Tavosanis (Hrsg.), History and Philosophy of Computing. International Conference on the History and Philosophy of Computing (IFIP Advances in Information and Communication Technology, Bd. 487), S. 71 \endash  86; Druck: Halliwell, Rara Mathematica, 1841/ 1977, S. 73 \endash  83; Steele, 