\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs26\chcbpat17 Is\u7717 ?\u257 \'e2q Ibn-Sulaim\u257 \'e2n al- Isr\u257 \'e2\u702 ?\u299 \'eel\u299 \'ee}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Isaac Israelita), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De definitionibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Translatio {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardi Cremonensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ). (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Collectis ex dictis philosophorum de differencia inter descriptiones rerum et diffinitiones earum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et quare philosophia fuit descripta modo diffinita de quorum aggregatione et ordinatione Ysaac medicus filius Salomonis solicitus fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unde Ysaac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber Ysaac de difinicionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Plures eorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui antiquorum libros inspexerunt et eorum viderunt diversitates in difinicionibus rerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 post quietem ambulantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Visus vero destificatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 eius contrarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic finiunt collectiones Ysaac Israelite medici in descriptionibus rerum et difinicionibus earum et differencia inter descriptionem et difinitionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod terra habeat tumorem a septemtrione in austrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Der letzte Vers aus der Sphaera des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Sacrobosco}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Druck: Joseph Thomas Muckle (Hrsg.), Isaac Israeli. Liber de definicionibus, in: Archives d\rquote Histoire Doctrinale et Litt\u233 \'e9raire du Moyen Age 12/13 (1937/38), S. 299 \endash  340, bes. S. 300 \endash  328; vgl. Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, Nr. 2472; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 233 und 1054}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Robles, Manuscritos, 1965, S. 427, Nr. 44. }

