\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  XXX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bartholomaeus Salernitanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Practica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De divisione practice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De virtute et operatione medicine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Practica dividitur in duo: in scienciam conservatiam sanitatis et curativam egritudinis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (XXX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De impedimento conceptionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dictum est de suffocatione matricis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Restat ergo ut causas per quas fit impedimentum conceptionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (XXX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ex aqua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in qua cocta sunt malva fenum Grecum et similia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text im Vergleich zum Druck bei De Renzi (s.u.) um ein Kapitel k\u252 \'fcrzer; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre, Sp. 1080}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 2,1 (2008), S. 56 \endash  59, bes. S. 58, Nr. 9 (Marco Toste); Druck: De Renzi, Collectio Salernitana, 1852 \endash  1859, Bd. 4 (1856), S. 321 \endash  405. }

