\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  De flebotomia et de natura temporum et de aliis. 1. (LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rogerus de Parma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De modis mittendi sanguinem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt. (LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In vere quia sanguis habundat in prima ebdomada luncacionis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quarta pars diei et quarta ebdomada lunacionis et quartum tempus anni id est hyemis frigida et humida in hic autem omnis concordantur id est omnis phisici et astronomici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Kurzes Zitat vom Schlu\u223 \'df des Werks; die Textteile im Vergleich zum Druck vertauscht; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 VD 16 A62}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , S. 312; Romuald Czarnecki, Ein Aderla\u223 \'dftraktat angeblich des Roger von Salerno, Diss. med. Leipzig 1919, S. 15; s.a. LXXV\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rogerus de Parma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , De modis mittendi sanguinem (mit weitere Lit.); (LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 2. De arboribus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arborum quedam stiptice sunt, que in laxativam virtutem non facile introducuntur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 purgabit fructus humorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 3. De vitibus.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  Similiter in Marcio cum victis victi inseritur pote}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 loco sectionis pluerem cius vis spei laxative\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 4. Quomodo una colore potest. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Similiter et unam colorare potest apponendo azurum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cum aqua victis confice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 5. Versus Adam degebat. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Adem degebat octo cifos adrifex: Prima litera cuiuslibet sillabe denotat unum mensem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ita ad Guemiarius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (statt: Januarius)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  incipit per a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Februarius incipit per d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 November per d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  December per s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

