\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  LXX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Medizinische {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestionen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Queritur utrum corpus humanum habeat in se principium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (LXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 rei veritatem Galienus et Hali loquuntur secundum manifestacionum et apperenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Queritur utrum parvum caput sit malum signum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et est facilis ire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sic patet de ipso capite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Utrum spiritus ignitivus id est ille spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui emittatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 consemine patris in matricem mulieris sit compositus ex triplici spiritum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (LXX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et sic patet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod sit dicendum ad questionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

