\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 CXI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  CXII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Roger de Baron}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Practica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  minor (Summa minor), tractatus quartus, De aquis clarificantibus visum. Rubrik: (CXI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tractatus de aquis physicalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Humana natura non minus indiget aquis phisicalibus quam aliiis medicinis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  unde quam diversas egritudines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (CXII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De aqua ardenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur de aqua ardenti, que sic fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et in illa decoctione per duos duos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  dies vel tres dimittantur et postea colentur et pariter de albumine ovi addatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Enthalten sind aus Traktat 4, Kapitel 4 \endash  7; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre, Sp. 644}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 11697}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  169\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 93}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Tractatus 4, Kapitel 1). }

