\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Nova Domo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Propositiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  notabiles circa Libros Metaphysicae Aristotelis. (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Circa materiam primi libri Methaphisice, qui editus est a venerabili magistro Johanne de Nova Domo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 temptatore universitatis Parisiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nostre domine etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Queritur primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum physica prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que inter tres theoricas rationales est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Queritur circa textum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum desiderium quomodo omnes homines natura scire desiderant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit undecimus liber Methaphisice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (A)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 d habendum noticiam eorum,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui in undecimo libro Phisice traduntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quo totus est de principiis substantiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur materiam 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ii\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  tractatus undecimi libris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui totus disgressimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est declarans substanciam incorruptibilem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sensibilem et mobilem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (A)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 d cuius inceptionis habendum movetur hec questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum corpus celeste componitur ex materia et forma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text bricht ab: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 esse omnibus corporibus abseque hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod cum eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 coniungatur per modum en\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u9553 \'a6 Reklamant: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 delechie ex istis patet quod habet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic restant 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 tor\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  folia scribenda quo usque finem habeatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text bricht aufgrund von Blattverlusten ab; vgl. den entsprechenden Vermerk 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; bislang der einzige Textzeuge des Werks; vgl. Grabmann, Der Einfluss Alberts des Grossen, 1936 (s. Lit.), Bd. 2, S. 324 \endash  412, bes. S. 385 \endash  388; ders., Heinrich von Br\u252 \'fcssel, 1943 (s. Lit.), S. 6 \endash  94, bes. S. 62; ders., Anteil, 1956 (s. Lit.), S. 228; zu dem ab 1402 an der Universit\u228 \'e4t Paris nachweisbaren Magister {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Nova Do}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 mo (\u8224 \'861418) vgl. Weiler, Un trait\u233 \'e9, 1968 (s. Lit.), S. 108 \endash  154, bes. S. 153 \endash  154; Lohr, Commentaries, 1967 \endash  1974, 27 (1971), S. 264; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 5 (2003), S. 132 \endash  134, bes. S. 133; Wels, Aristotelisches Wissen, 2004 (s. Lit.), S. LXXI \endash  LXXXVIII, bes. S. LXXVII \endash  LXXVIII; Meliad\u242 \'f2, Axiomatic Wisdom, 2013 (s. Lit.), S. 71 \endash  131, bes. S. 81 \endash  82 und S. 97 (zu 22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ); \plain \f2\lang1024\fs26 Ka\u322 \'b3u\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 z\u224 \'e0, Querelles, 1988, S. 87 \endash  120, bes. S. 91, Anm. 18, S. 111 \endash  112; Lohr/ Colomba, Commentaries, 2010 \endash  2013, S. 318; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hamesse/ Szyler, Repertorium, 2007 \endash  2010, Nr. 6901}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

