\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quaestiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  super Aristotelis Libros de Caelo et Mundo. (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt questiones circa Librorum Aristotilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui intitulatur De Celo et Mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Textanfang fehlt, Text beginnt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 sed totum prope additur arcui habenti partes, in quibus positio facit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad primam dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod tempus non est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 infinitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit secundus Liber de Celo et Mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Schriftband: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa secundum Librum de Celo et Mundo movetur questio naturalis talis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa secundum Librum de Celo et Mundo queritur primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum corpus celeste sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ingenerabile et incorruptibile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Queritur consequenter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  utrum necesse sit terram habere firmamentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sphericam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad quartam dictum est in dubio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (C)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 irca quartum Librum de Celo et Mundo movetur talis questio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Utrum ad naturalem philosophum spectat determinare de gravi et levi simpliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arguitur quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nam nichil est grave\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad primam dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 licet unum elementum in sua regione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est naturalis et non est contrarium elemento contento et ut sic se habet ut species et actus respectu elementi contenti actoritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Schreibervers: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Explicit hoc totum, pro pena da michi potum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Utile sit dictum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quamvis non sit bene pictum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Qui reprobat scriptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  caput eius sit maledictum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Der Anfang fehlt aufgrund von Blattverlust; enthalten sind Qu\u228 \'e4stionen zu den B\u252 \'fcchern 1 \endash  2 und 4; zu dem Schreibervers am Schlu\u223 \'df vgl. Thorndike, Final Jingles, 1956, S. 321 \endash  328, bes. S. 325 \endash  326; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Colophons, Nr. 21054 \endash  21055}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

