\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ad inveniendum incensionem Lunae, }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tabula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum expositio. (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula. (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nota, quod precedens tabula docet invenire incensionem Lune}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Unde si quis velit operari cum ista tabula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sciat particulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 aureum numerum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui constat solum ex die etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod habita una coniunctione faciliter reperitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad quadram sunt 7 dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 9 hore et 0 minuta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

