\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Ad inveniendum intervallum, Tabula et expositio. (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Intervallum invenitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Tabelle mit den Versen: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Etheras}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aretra}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 fraudula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 blandens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Eustra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Clementis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 concurrentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 A nati festo mea tabula tendit ad esto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Expositio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nota, quod tabula presens sic practicanda est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nam primo scias aureum numerum et literam Dominicalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 litera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominicalis censenda cum stet pro maiorem partem annis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ebdas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  si queras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  dat ultima litera veras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item nota pro correctione illorum Versium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Etheras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  aretra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que in practicanda intervallum per illos versus videndum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  .... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item sciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod in anno bissextili concurrentes practicande sunt per secundam literam Dominicalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et hoc est facilius et melius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Vers: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Intervallum invenitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 applicat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 astris.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: Namensvers: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Frederich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iohan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gaf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Kese\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Herman\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Schreibervers: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Helff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 got\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Krist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 here\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fredens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 gotliker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Intervalltafel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  f\u252 \'fcr die Zeit von Weihnachten bis Estomihi mit Erl\u228 \'e4uterungen; enthalten sind u.a. die Verse {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 17245}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 659}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Bernhard Bischoff, Ostertagtexte, 1967, S. 192 \endash  227, bes. S. 215; die letzten Verse interlinear mit roten Ordnungszahlen (zur besseren Verst\u228 \'e4ndlichkeit) versehen; zu dem Namensvers s.o. Geschichte. }

