\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quiricus de Augustis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Lumen apothecariorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpte. (243\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad faciendum coriandros solios\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  Coriandri rotundi seu soly fuerit ex zuccer}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad faciendum fructus animalia omnia ex zuccaro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 recipe zuccari quantitatem quam volueris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc fieri potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed superior modus melior est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  \u220 \'dcberwiegend Exzerpte aus dem 13 Abschnitt De artificis zuchari; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 3060}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; zum Autor {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quiricus de Augustis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , eigentlich Domenico Augusti (*um 1460, \u8224 \'86nach 1495) vgl. Hugo Michael Wolf, Das Lumen apothecariorum von Quiricus de Augustis, M\u252 \'fcnchen Diss. 1973. \endash  246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

