\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Sacrobosco}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Algorismus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item Algorismus et diversis scilicet de integris et de minutiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Omnia, que a primeva rerum origine processerint}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ratione numeri vel numerorum formata sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nec cupias uxorem alicuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Progressio est numerorum secundum equales excessus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Verbi gracia: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 et multiplicetur quinarius per ternarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text endet unvermittelt im Kapitel De progressione; als Kapitel\u252 \'fcberschriften werden die Zehn Gebote zitiert (Gebot 2 \endash  8, s.o.); Text z.T. mit interlinearen Wortglossen, z.T. mit marginalen Glossen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen (der Schreiberhand); z.B. 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Vers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item nota versus de numeratione usuali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Unus monos, v quinos, x decimos dupla vigenosis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...<; (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar mit mathematischen Textaufgaben. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hic auctor subiungit secundum speciem huius artis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  algoristice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que dicitur additio et dividitur in tres parte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In prima diffinitur additio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa Addicionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Monentur aliqua enicmata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quorum primum est ad sciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod denarius quis habeat in manu sua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Enicma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ultimum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ponatur casus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod sunt duo vicini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quorum unus dicat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quando coniunguntur in longitudinem tunc ambo agri coniuncti non retineret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nisi quatuor pedes in latitudine ut patet practicandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . ... (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ) Hic ponitur 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  species huius artis algoristice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Queritur quare dicitur a figura maiori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Druck: Saaby Pedersen, Opera Petri Philomenae, 1983, S. 174 \endash  191; vgl. ebenda S. 167 \endash  172; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre, Sp. 991}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, S. 235 \endash  236, Nr. 267d.); VL(2), Bd. 4 (1983), Sp. 731 \endash  736 (Francis B. Br\u233 \'e9vart/ Menso Folkerts), bes. Sp. 735 \endash  736; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 11,5 (2003), S. 157 \endash  160, bes. S. 158; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1227}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2827}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2769}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2661}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

