\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Zacharias Papa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Epistola}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ad {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bonifatium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  archiepiscopum Moguntinae sedis in metropolim erectio. (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Zacharius papa Bonifacio episcopo sancte Moguntine ecclesie perpertuam salutem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Qualiter dominus deus noster sancte ecclesie propiciatus sit }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hiis a nobis diffinitis, per huius nostre confirmationis paginam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in tua ecclesia perpetuis temporibus pro sui confimatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Nachtrag am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 conservandum esse mandamus. Hec mandamus conservari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Data pridie Nonas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 Novembris imperante domno piissimo Augusto Constantino anno tricesimo sec\u367 \'f9ndo imperii eius indictione q\u367 \'f9inta \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (4. November 752). Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Verweis auf den Katalog der Mainzer Bisch\u246 \'f6fe 81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  sowie fol. 82 (heute 84). \endash  Druck: PL, Bd. 89, Sp. 953 \endash  954; Aloysius Tomassetti (Hrsg.), Bullarum diplomatum et privilegiorum sanctorum Romanorum pontificum, Bd. 1, Turin 1857, S. 237, Nr. IV. \endash  56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

