\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in compositione almanach. (288\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Conposicio almanac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In composicione Almanac scribe primo ferias tocius anni et in omnia mensium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in capitibus ipsorum nomina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (289\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De radicibus inveniendis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod radices in tabula subscripta practicate sunt pro anno 1460 completo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui fuit bisextilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (290\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Almanac Solis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Istis prenotatis ad practicam accedamus et primo ad verum motum Solis practicadum per anni circuitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De vera coniuctione et oppositione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota tempore medie coniunctionis aut oppostionis mille est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (292\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Motum Lune ad punctum notatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si motus Lune excedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 deservit ad veram coniunctionem et oppositionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Introitum planetarum in prima puncta signorum videris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 almanac Solis fallit in uno anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 enim pro uno anno videlicet ultimus ad multos etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. C. Philipp E. Nothaft, Ephemerides in High Medieval Europe: The Textual Evidence, in: Journal for the History of Astronomy 52,1 (2021), S. 33 \endash  52; Bischoff, Katalog, 1966 (s. Lit.), S. 136.}

