\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Liber de Alchemia, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Et intencio magistri fuit solvere perfectum continuum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  confugisio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et per istum modum poedebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Fugitur in Mercurio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 preparabit con sale et aceto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod fuit opus sue intencionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Lapis noster vincus orienter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et tunc est lapis perfectus ad rubeum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Solucio fit per modum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prima fit in vase vitrioli per modum decoctionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec est signa vasis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quodlibet vas longiorum alio per et digito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipe de inferiori parti j. et misce cum tribus partibus medii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod duo sunt superiora et poteris accipere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de quo tibi magis placet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Rezeptnachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe gummi boracis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et sic intrabunt folta Solis interius usque ad eius perfundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vermutlich Exzerpte aus einem gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 alchemistischen Werk}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; der Anfang fehlt aufgrund von Blattverlusten; vgl. Smits van Waesberghe, Aribonis De Musica, 1951 (s. Lit.), S. iv; Pesce, Guido d\rquote Arezzo, 1999 (s. Lit.), S. 60. }

