\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Carmen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de Alchemia, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quod calcinatur, siccatur et intumulatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 non dissolvetur nisi septima lux iteretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Carmine secreto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quid sit patri ipse doceto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quid sit vel qualis substancia materialis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 An eciam plures inqueant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 an una sit hec res\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ex quibus aptatur res\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que non esse putatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  .... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dum res censetur sapiens hic stultus habetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . [Spatium \u252 \'fcber 15 Zeilen] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Huius namque rei congestio materie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 res immortalis mortifera mercurialis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut primus primo distillans surgat ab ymmo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic per venas seriatim solvuit arenas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Der Anfang fehlt aufgrund von Blattverlusten; vgl. Smits van Waesberghe, Aribonis De Musica, 1951 (s. Lit.), S. iv; Pesce, Guido d\rquote Arezzo, 1999 (s. Lit.), S. 60. }

