\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arnoldus de Villa Nova}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rosarius Philosophorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Iste namque liber). (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (L)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 iber abbreviatus comprobatus verissimus Thesauris Thesaurorum Rosarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Iste namque liber nominatur Rosarius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Secreto reservans Rosarium ipsorum ut merito merearis dici et esse sapientum antiquorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Rosarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Glorieux, Repertoire, S. 418 \endash  439, S. 423, Nr. 211ai.); Thorndike, History, 1923 \endash  1958, Bd. 3 (1934), S. 654 \endash  676, bes. S. 669 \endash  671 u.\u246 \'f6.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 847}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Initium liber 2); Smits van Waesberghe, Aribonis De Musica, 1951 (s. Lit.), S. iv; Camilli, Il Rosarius, 1995, S. 175 \endash  208; Paniagua, Corpus cientifico, 1995, bes. S. 22, Nr. III.19; Pereira, L\rquote alchimia, 1995, bes. S. 146; vgl. Pesce, Guido d\rquote Arezzo, 1999 (s. Lit.), S. 60; Calvet, Le corpus alchimiques, 2005, bes. S. 454; Calvet, Les \u338 \'8cuvres alchimiques, 2011, S. 125 \endash  166; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 1,3 (2003), S. 442 \endash  459 (Marco Toste/ F.S./ Jos\u233 \'e9 Carlos Santoz Paz); Robles, Manuscritos, 1965), S. 422, Nr. 32; Druck (Textabgleich mit): Mangetus, Bibliotheca, 1702, Bd. 1, S. 663 \endash  667; Calvet, Les \u338 \'8cuvres alchimiques, 2011, S. 268 \endash  302; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2226}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Versio abbreviata) und 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

