\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 bisv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Regimen de Phoenice. (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dico, quod singularis et rosei coloris fenix Arabie avis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  unica istud dico sive ex solo quia solus naturalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod scripsi de fenice fatore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod sive sit lapis noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 bisr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quid sit fenix noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in multi nescitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 bisv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 errore habuit paratam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Alchemistischer Text}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , wohl Exzerpte aus einem gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferen Zusammenhang; Nachtrag des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5060[0].5064/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 14. Jhs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (s.o.); 69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 bisv\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  stark verbla\u223 \'dft und abgegriffen; vgl. Smits van Waesberghe, Aribonis De Musica, 1951 (s. Lit.), S. iv; Pesce, Guido d\rquote Arezzo, 1999 (s. Lit.), S. 61 (\u8222 \'84on the bird Phoenix\ldblquote ). }

