\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Berno Augiensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tonarius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum Prologo. (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik (Nachtrag um 1400): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Orditur prohemium subsequentium tonorum omnis igitur regularius monocordi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Orditur proemium subsequentium tonorum omnis regularis monocordi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 constitutio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs26 secundum pr\u281 \'eaclaram disertis\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 simi viri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Boetis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 instructionem in quindecim cordis consistit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ego vero iam desinam multa loqui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut finis sit prologi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Authenticus protus constat ex prima specie dyapente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... <. (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: ONENOEANE. ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 P)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 rimum querite regnum dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Haec munera quondam Syon animo exultanto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 prout potuimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cuius amore tuis beatissime pater Pyligrine in hoc opere studuimus preceptis obedire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Roth, musikalischer Codex, 1897 (s. Lit.), S. 489; Smits van Waesberghe, Aribonis De Musica, 1951 (s. Lit.), S. v; Michel Huglo, Les tonaires. Inventaire, Analyse, Comparaison, Paris 1971 (Publications de la Soci\u233 \'e9t\u233 \'e9 fran\u231 \'e7aise de Musicologie, 3. Serie, Bd. 2), S. 266 \endash  267, 271, 429 (Sigle D); Huglo/ Meyer, Theory, 1986 (s. Lit.), S. 40; vgl. Pesce, Guido d\rquote Arezzo, 1999 (s. Lit.), S. 62; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 2,3 (2006), S. 374 \endash  376 (Ludovica Radif), bes. S. 375 \endash  376, Nr. 14; McCarthy, Music, 2009 (s. Lit.), S. 203 \endash  205, 210 \endash  211; Alexander Rausch, Die Musiktraktate des Abtes Bern von Reichenau. Edition und Interpretation, Tutzing 1999 (Musica Mediaevalis Europae Occidentalis. Publikationen zur \u228 \'e4lteren Musikgeschichte des Institutes f\u252 \'fcr Musikwissenschaft der Universit\u228 \'e4t Wien und des Institutum Misces Feldkirchense, Bd. 5), vgl. S. 17 \endash  19, 71 \endash  73, (Sigle D) u.\u246 \'f6.; Druck: ebenda, S. 32 \endash  68 und 75 \endash  115, Gerbert, Scriptores (s. 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), Bd. 2, S. 63 \endash  91; PL, Bd. 144, Sp. 1100 \endash  1130. }

