\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Stella clericorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Stella Clericorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Q)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 uasi stella matutina in medio nebule peccatorum. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Sir 50,6).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Proprietates huius stelle matutine possunt referri ad quemlibet doctorem fidei}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Capitulum 23\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  (V)enit filius hominis querere non seducere ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Rubrik:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Capitulum 34\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tria sunt quibus dyabolum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  angelos assistentes offendunt, et de salutari medicina sibi miserabiliter acquirunt eternam dampnacionem. Cavete vobis prelati voraces ut catuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui mortem non attenditis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui favorem venditis. Nummi dantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  procurantur licet pravuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  licet ydiote narranum excommunicati ebriosi lusotes numquam castissime incesti ve vobis et semper ve. Explicit tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cuius Stella Clericorum exstat tytulus etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  Text umfa\u223 \'dft 24 Kapitel: Kapitel 1 \endash  23 und 34; Schlu\u223 \'df im Vergleich zum Druck abweichend; Druck: Eric H. Reiter (Hrsg.), Stella clericorum. Edited from Wavreumont (Stavelot) Monast\u232 \'e8re St-R\u233 \'e9macle, MS. s.n., Toronto 1997 (Toronto Medieval Latin Texts 23), S. 17 \endash  50; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW M43883, M43908 \endash  43910}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 4435}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, Nr. 4435; zur handschriftlichen \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch Antonio Garcia y Garcia, Manuscritos de la \u171 \'abStella clericorum\u187 \'bb, in: Universidad de Navarra. Scripta theologica 16 (1984), S. 395 \endash  404; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 669}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 762}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 353\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 767}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1102}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 5,1, S. 70, 91, 96 und 141; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2488}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 27}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 5,2. Unmittelbar anschlie\u223 \'dfend zwei kurze Notizen zur Liturgik sowie Exempel aus einer Predigt. \endash  77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Federproben, verwischt; sonst leer. }

