\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De duodecim signis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De duodecim signis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et que signa respiciunt quelibet membra corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et quando est bonum vel malum minuere sanguinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et de natura xii signorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nota, quod venenosum est tangere aliquod membrum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quando Luna fuerit in Ariete\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  bonum est minuere et hoc signum est domus et hospicium Martis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pisces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum Luna fuerit in Piscibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  bonum est summe medicinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Piscis habens Lunam noli curare podagram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Goehl/ Mayer/ Staub, Was tun, 2000 (s. Lit.), S. 128; Xhayet, M\u233 \'e9decine, 2010, S. 56, 58, 184. Unmittelbar anschlie\u223 \'dfend komputistische und astronomisch-astrologische Verse: 1. Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quatuor versus de minucione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quando est bona vel mala scilicet xii signa celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Est Aries intuendo bonus libraque sagitta est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et aquarius inminuendo bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 5599}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 2. Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Duo versus designantes quando incidenda est vena vel quibus diebus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Martini, Blasii, Philippi, Walburgis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 10716}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 3. Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tres versus de xii signis celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qua signa sunt mobilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Capra, Libra, Cancer, Aries, mobilia semper}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scorpius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aquarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Taurus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Leo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 stabilia sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Virgo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sagittarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gemini communia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pisces\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

