\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Versus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  contra mortale venenum. Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quinque versus contra mortale venenum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hoc est antidotum contra mortale venenum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nux\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ficus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ruta ieiuno corpore sumpta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 spiramen hominum fugias et bona gaudia queras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 8256}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Vermerk: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Wulle een boelkenscribt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

