\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Paulus Hungarus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Summa de poenitentia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In dei Nomine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Summa domini Benergarii sive Summa regis de Gallico extracta vel Summa confessorum seu confessionum abbreviata vel Summa de viciis et virtutibus vel Tractatus brevis de confessione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Q)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 uoniam circa confessiones pericula et difficultates}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \u8230 \'85 (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Modestia est corpori habitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in omni virtute potest considerari effectus temperancie ubi nichil superfluum vel diminutum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit tractatus de confessione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Nachtrag von der Hand {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod est Summa domini Benergarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sive Summa regis de Gallico extracta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod plus habetur in alio libro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nam hic deficit a capitolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod est de modo conficiendi et de decem generibus hominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui falsant suam sentenciam usque ad finem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text im Vergleich zum Druck k\u252 \'fcrzer; endet mit dem Kapitel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De cardinalibus virtutibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. dazu auch die abschlie\u223 \'dfende Bemerkung {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Druck: Florilegium Casinense, in: Bibliotheca Casinensis, Bd. 4 (1880/ 2004), S. 191 \endash  214; Raimundus Duellius, Miscellanorum, qu\u230 \'e6 ex codicibus manuscriptis collegit, Bd. 1, Augsburg 1723, S. 59 \endash  77; vgl. Schulte, Bd. 2, S. 531, Nr. 25; Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 227f.); Kuttner, Reper\-torium der Kanonistik, 1937, S. 412, Anm. 3; Michaud-Quantin, Sommes, 1962, S. 16, 24 \endash  26 und 51; Robles, Manuscritos, 1965, S. 6; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, Scriptores, Nr. 3184}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Bloomfield, Nr. 804 \endash  806; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 4919}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, Nr. 4919; Murano, Initia, unter: \u8222 \'84Quoniam circa confessiones\rdblquote ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 783}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 339\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , vgl. DA ULB Kat. 5,2; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 328}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 4 , S. 108. }

