\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Albertanus Brixiensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber de doctrina dicendi et tacendi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber magistri Albertani causidici Brixiensis De doctrina dicendi atque tacendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Nachtrag {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sed hic non est totus quia hic non est nisi una pagina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Inicio media et fini mei tractatus assit gracia sancti spiritus amen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quoniam in dicendo mulit errant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Requiras ergo in animo tuo a te ipso \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et ideo tacere debes natus, quia ut ait Seneca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \u9553 \'a6 <Iratus nichil nisi criminis loquitur ...>. \endash  Die Handschrift enth\u228 \'e4lt nur den Anfang des Werks; der Text endet unvermittelt im Kapitel \u8222 \'84secundum punctum est\ldblquote ; vgl. den entsprechenden Vemerk {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, S. 239, Nr. 2757 und S. 420, Nr. 4951}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, S. 277, Nr. 2757; S. 280, Nr. 4951; VL(2), Bd. 1 (1978), Sp. 151 \endash  154 (H. Koppitz); C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 1.2 (2000), S. 107 (L. Lanza); Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 531 \endash  563}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Thor Sundby, Brunetto Latinos Levnet og scrifter, Diss. Kopenhagen 1869, S. XCIV \endash  XCV; ders., Della vita e delle opere di Brunetto Latini, Florenz 1884, S. 477 \endash  481. \endash  101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

