\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De confessione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In nomine domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quomodo facienda est confessio scilicet v. sensus corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 deinde de septem viciis principalibus ... Item de septem sacramentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In conspectu dei omnipotentis et omnia videntis et beate Marie virginis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et omnium angelorum et omnium sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Confiteor me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  miserum et indignum peccatorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia quinque sensus corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quos dominus dedit mihi ad bonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primo id est Visu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Declinando oculos meos ad loca et ad membra illicitia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 unde ordo coniugium fons confirmacione panis unxio postrema confessio sunt sacramenta etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Nachtrag {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod ista confessio habetur eciam in Soliloquio Hugonis de sancto Victore, De Arra anime et melius et perfectius quam hic habeatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Verumptamen hic habetur confessio de septem operibus misericordie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item de septem sacramentis, que ibi non habetur.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Text weist \u228 \'e4hnliches Initium auf wie {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Robert Grosseteste}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Speculum confessionis; vgl. Joseph Goering/ F. A. C. Mantello, The \u8218 \'82Per ambulavit Iudas ...\lquote  \u8218 \'82 (Speculum confessionis) Attributed to Robert Grosseteste, in: Revue B\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 96 (1986), S. 125 \endash  168; im Verlauf jedoch abweichend; die Zuweisung {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippes d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hugo de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ist nicht korrekt. \endash  115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

