lt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Esca datur graciarum mos est vinum et ematis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... . \endash  Zwei Verse. Um 90\u176 \'b0 gedreht: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Qui candela sedes cibus es post pandia sedes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut ferrum magnes sic ad se nos trahit Agnes.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  Vier Verse; Notiz: 1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In constructione perfectam supponiti cum apponito}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quatuor requiruntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod supponitionum significaret rem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  .... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quartum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod modus finitus correspondeat modo idcirco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si vis observare inhelitum infetidum debes sepe mundare dentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 similiter conmixtio limosittis in mendorsum dencium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

