\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de arte grammatica. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) De octo partibus orationis. (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominus que pars\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nomen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quare? Quia significat substantiam cum qualitas propria vel communi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quid est nomine pars Oracionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ? ... (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Non sunt plures sermones in interiectione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quedam sunt laudanter ut aha sic de aliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt regule puerorum bone et utiles scripte per manus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  fratris Gerardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 monachi et professi ordinis sancti Jacobi in insula Leodii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Anno domini m\u176 \'b0 quadringentesimo iii\u176 \'b0 in Profesto Inventionis sancti Stephani \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (2. August 1403)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  circa horam undecimam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Laus sit deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Trotz \u228 \'e4hnlich lautendem Initium nicht identisch mit dem Text in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2642}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Exempla grammaticalia. (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Homo albus est bonum Latinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Est quare? Quia adiectivum et subiectum vollunt conformari in genere}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in numero et in casu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Doctore legente est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 bonum Latinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item notandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod ista quatuor nomina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 domus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 humus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 milicia et reus ponuntur absolute\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quando in ablativo construuntur cum verbo signante motum de loco ut venio, domo ... et sic de aliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Initium identisch mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Boxham (Oxfordshire, GB), All Saint\rquote s School, Ms 1}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) De adverbia interrogativa locorum. (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quot sunt adverbia interrogativa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 locorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ? {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quatuor}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 : }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 que}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 quo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 qua}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 ,}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  ubi et unde}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Que sunt maiorum locorum nomina regionum ut Hollandia Francia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) De constructionibus grammaticalibus. (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quid est contructio gramaticalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ?< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Est constructibilium reddentium oracionem unio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut literas abe sunt vocales alie consonantes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Interrogativum et suum responsium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In quibus voluunt convenire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in casu si hoc interrogatum fit per tres casuales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quot sunt primi in scolis et respondetur octo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Relativum est suum antecedens in qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  bonus voluunt convenire in genere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in numero et quandoque in casu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sortes et Plato est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 bonum Latinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Est quare quia ista coniunctio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic est hic ergo est bonum Latinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Iungit diversa coniunctio significata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa360\itap0 Die Texte werden im Inhaltsverzeichnis des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippe d\rquote Oth\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  auf dem Vorsatz vorne verso zu einem Werk zusammengefa\u223 \'dft und wie folgt bezeichnet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Regule puerorum et sunt ad informandum juvenes in congruitate;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  die Initien (des ersten Abschnitts) bei Bursill-Hall,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Census, 1981, S. 312 zu kurz um eine Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung eindeutig zu identifizieren; (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) anschlie\u223 \'dfend, wohl zum vorausgehenden Werk geh\u246 \'f6rend, um 90\u176 \'b0 gedreht und f\u252 \'fcnf Spalten umfassendes F\u228 \'e4cherschema: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De constructione sententiae cum transitiva et intransitiva verba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Federproben, geschw\u228 \'e4rzter Vermerk s.o.}

