sen; Druck: Habel, Cornutus, 1908 \endash  1909, Bd.1; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 2311}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Bursill-Hall, Johannes de Garlandia, 1976, S. 163 \endash  165, Nr. 10; Henkel, \u220 \'dcbersetzungen, 1988 (s. 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 267 \endash  268; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2225}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2327}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

