\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Komputistische Notizen und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Verse}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Item nota circa predictam, quod lustrum est spatium quinque annorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  a Romanis consideratum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item indictio est spatium quindecim annorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item evum vel etas est spacium milla annorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Verse: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Annus erat nonus Solis Luneque secundus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 1262}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Concurrentes anni sunt dies a Nativitate Domini usque ad Circumcisionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (174\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 lii septimane sunt in anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Notizen zur Zeitrechnung, vorwiegend zu Umfang und Abstand bestimmter Perioden. }

