\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Algeri}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Computus chirometralis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum glossa, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: Rubrik: Computs cyrometralis. Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cognicio veritatis de pausis temporum circa motum Solis et Lune}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et aliorum planetarum cum sit tenebrosa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Est autem sol mundi oculus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Presta bis senis que minat miliaribus vinum. Sol si surgit ab erf si cedicit idem mihi absit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glossen beginnen marginal: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In nomine domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Clerus in ecclesia domini sciat ista scienda}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Glossen enden marginal: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Embolismatis annis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  que habet unam Lunam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est xx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  pars unius hore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Das Werk wurde fr\u252 \'fcher {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Erfordia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zugeschrieben; Text endet S. 66, Vers 11 der Ausgabe von M\u252 \'fctz; Druck: M\u252 \'fctz, Computus Chirometralis, 2003, S. 6 \endash  66; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 13927}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Lorenz, Studium, 1989, S. 249 \endash  260, bes. S. 251 und 259; ders., Johannes Algeri, 2003, S. 184 \endash  190, bes. S. 185, Anm. 80; Cordoliani, Les manuscrits d\rquote Utrecht, 1961, S. 76 \endash  85, bes. S. 77; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre, Sp. 231}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 22}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1941}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

