\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Sacrobosco}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Algorismus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Schreibervers: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Assit ad inceptum sancta Maria meum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Algorismus in prosa, sed deest quasi unum folium et sic non est completus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Omnia, que a primeva rerum origine processerint}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ratione numerorum formata sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet unvermittelt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Radicem numeri quadrati extrahere est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 deinde ductus in se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <deleat totum suprapositum respectu sui, vel in quantum vicinius potest>. \endash  Text unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig, endet mit Vers 158 der Ausgabe von Saaby Pedersen (s.u.); Druck: Saaby Pedersen, Opera Petri Philomenae, 1983, S. 174 \endash  196; vgl. ebenda, S. 167 \endash  172; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre, Sp. 991}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Glorieux, Facult\u233 \'e9, S. 235 \endash  236, Nr. 267d.); VL(2), Bd. 4 (1983), Sp. 731 \endash  736 (Francis B. Br\u233 \'e9vart/ Menso Folkerts), bes. Sp. 735 \endash  736; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 11,5 (2003), S. 157 \endash  160, bes. S. 158; zum Schreibervers am Anfang vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Colophons, Nr. 19983}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1227}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 1415}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2827}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2661}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Zahlenfoge in arabischen Ziffern und geschw\u228 \'e4rzter Vemerk, sonst leer. }

