\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Robertus de Sorbona}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Confessio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (\u8218 \'82Qui vult fere confiteri\lquote ). (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus de septem peccatis seu viciis mortalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 De vii pecctatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 seu viciis mortalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Qui vult peccata sua vere confiteri ad salutem anime sue}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  debet dolere de omnibus peccatis suis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De Luxuria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Luxuria nascitur ex gulositate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quando homo bene bibit et bene comedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sextus ramus luxurie est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quando homo habet uxorem et mulier habet virum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Peccator autem si in istis deliquit humiliter debet dicere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Domine peccavi in istis peccatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alia autem de quibus non est culpabilis subticere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nemo enim debet confiteri peccata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que non fecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit confessio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Die vorliegende Version weicht vor allem am Schlu\u223 \'df stark von der bei Diekstra (s.u.) nach einer Kopenhagener Handschrift abgedruckten Redaktion ab; vgl. Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 341f.); Bloomfield, S. 341, Nr. 763; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 4659}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloomfield, 2008, S. 269, Nr. 4659; F. N. M. Diekstra, Robert de Sorbon\rquote s \u8222 \'84Qui vult vere confiteri\ldblquote  (ca 1260 \endash  74) and Its French Versions, in: Recherches de th\u233 \'e9ologie ancienne et m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale 60 (1993), S. 215 \endash  272, Druck: ebenda, S. 238 \endash  258. \endash  204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

