\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Auctor ad Herennium, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ad Herennium Libri 4}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik (Nachtrag) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ars L\u252 \'fclle memori\u230 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Memoria utrum habeat aliquid artificii}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  an omnis a natura proficitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod maxime necesse est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 exercitatione confirma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit textus artis memorie Tullii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Enthalten sind aus Buch 3, Kapitel 16, \u167 \'a728 bis Kapitel 24; Druck: Calboli, Cornifici Rhetorica ad C. Herennium, 1969, S. 150 \endash  155; Marx, Ad C. Herennium libri IV, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1894, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1923 (Reprint 1993), S. 95 \endash  105; Munk Olsen, \u201 \'c9tude, 1982 \endash  1989, Bd. 1 (1982), S. 111, 130, Nr. #460; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 2283}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

