\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Ars rhetorica seu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Commentum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  in Ciceronis Rhetorica (id est in Auctore ad Herennium). (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 A)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 d }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 intrandum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 narrandum puta partem rethorice scilicet memorie}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quam Tulius vocat Thesaurum Inventorum eo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui in ipsa reducuntur omnia argumenta ymmo quicumque per alias auctoritates artis rhetorice sunt reperta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Supponendum est igitur cum Tullio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod ad formacionem et bonitatem memorie naturalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et in qualibet earum aliquam ymaginem collorare et sic possumus faciliter de omnibus recordari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Heimann-Seelbach, Ars und Scientia, 2000 (s.o. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 105, Nr. 4.4.; Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Greifswald, Geistliches Ministerium, Cod. 23. C. VI.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

