\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Exzerpte, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Notizen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Verse und Zeichnungen zu den Themen De sensu, de sensato, de intellectu et de anima. (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Resolutio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 alique\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de spiritu universali \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?). Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 1.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Est sensus quia sitit intellectus, quando intellegit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cui sensum est particularitas coniuncta intellectum autem utilitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Casus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Talis est modus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Aperte oculo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 occurit ipsi potencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 14. Utrum forma sit inchoata anime \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sensatio est res permanens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \u8218 \'82\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota sensationes et intellectiones formantur illo modo etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .\lquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primo dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 obiectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod multiplicat de se speculo orbiculariter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item intellectus noster humanus intellegit per species argentas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Orizon est circulus orbiens totum mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Loica non est sciencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  sed modus sciendi alias sciencias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  primo docet diffinire tunc ad noticiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ignoti ideo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  [Spatium] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dividere contra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Federzeichnung (s.o.) mit Beschriftungen der Sinne; daneben Aenigma: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Enigma 1231\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ave stella maris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 clavis celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 via vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; anschlie\u223 \'dfend z.T. durchgestrichenes Verzeichnis von \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Introductiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (bis 31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ); (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) u.a. Schema zum Lichteinfall ins Auge ... (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) u.a Verse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Susceptum semen sex primisque duobus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \endash  Vier Verse, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 18933}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; anschlie\u223 \'dfend Notizen zu unterschiedlichen Themen, u.a. zur Medizin. }

