\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Gadesden}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rosa anglica practica medicinae a capite ad pedes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis, unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum primum de febre terciane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de eius diffinicione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de cura ulteracione sanie et aqua aurium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic incipit tractatus de Rosa medicina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que magis tractat de cura quam de signis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et de pronosticacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et liber ex quo tractavi vocatur Rosa medicine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Galienus primo de ingenio sanitatis: Non visites}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Capitulum primum de febre terciana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Febris nichil aliud est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quam calor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quintus liber erit de modo preparandi et administrani quasdam medicinas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ultimum capitulum de febre ex crapula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: (F)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ebris ex crapula curatur cum abstinencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et tunc cum toto conamine agit in fumo calefaciendo et expellendo et respectu sua passibilitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alia possent hic dici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed non vacat michi modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic finitur Rosa medicine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Rosa medicine anno domini m\u176 \'b0 quadringentesimo novagesimo 3\u176 \'b0 die sexta Februari \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (6. Februar 1493)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  post obitum magistri mei cuius anima requescat in pace\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 577, 552}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW M13622}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 VD16: J554}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

