\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardus de Solo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Supra primam Fen quarti canonis Avicennae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt recepte magistri Gerardi de Solo supra Primam Fen Quarti Canonis Avicenne de febribus lecte in Montepesselano cum quibusdam notabilibus et primo de effymera causate ex angustia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cura effimere ex angustia: Nota, quod virtus humani corporis confortatur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ex tribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa secundum tractatum de de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 febribus putridarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod in Febre putridis continuis materia est infra vasa magna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa capitulum quartane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In speciali curam curam eius dum est ex sanguine quia Avicenna ponit ibi receptam suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et fiant pillule ad modum cicerum et administrentur in introitu lecti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur de ethica senectutis et febre pestilenciali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sed dicta hic sufficiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text mit keinem der unter dem Namen des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardus de Solo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  gedruckten Werke in Einklang zu bringen; zum Initium vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 739}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 4 (2014), S. 298 \endash  299 (V. Recio Mu\u241 \'f1oz); Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Erfurt/ Gotha, UFB, Dep. Erf. CA. 4\u176 \'b0 225}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

