\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Antonius Guaynerius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de peste. (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tractatus de peste Anthony Guaynerii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Persepe animadvertens hoc mortale hominum genus innumeris casibus aditum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum aliquem pestis rumpit eum taliter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et hic est finis cure morbillorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  per quam huius tractatus prime principali parti finis imponitur ad laudem et gloriam Jesu crucifixi eius genituris alme teciusque celestis curie triumphantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Nachtrag von der gleichen Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Morbilli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rodelen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Variole\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pocken\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 1036, 280}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 11581}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; zum Autor und seinen Werken s.o. 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

