\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Petrus de Abano}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De venenis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Reverendissimo in Christo patri et domino domino divina favente gracia summo pontifici Petrus de Ebano minimus medicorum cum devocione presens scriptum tam vestre peticioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quam pro debito solucioni afferre iuxta posse obedire propono ad sanctitati vestre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quia venenum est contrarium cibo nostri corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Argentum vivum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Ille, qui argentum vivum sumpserit, dolorem patietur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Bezaar antonomasice dicitur de quodam lapide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in fine descripcionis ne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sit amplius necesse recapitulare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Est autem questio utrum tyriaca magna sit bezaar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et ideo magister omnium medicinarum est tyriaca a medicis appellata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Papst {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Honorius IV.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  gewidmet; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 1357, 1234}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 2521 \endash  2523}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Alberico Benedicenti (Hrsg.), Pietro d\rquote Abano, Il trattato \u8222 \'84De venenis\ldblquote , Florenz 1949 (Biblioteca della Rivista di storia delle scienze e naturali, Bd. 2), S. 15 \endash  88 (Teiledition); zum Autor vgl. ebenda S. 7 \endash  13; Weijers, Travail, 1994ff., Bd. 15, 7 (2007), S. 77 \endash  79.}

