\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Nicolaus Bertrucius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Collectorium artis medicae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpte. (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ab accione lesa virtus animalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Signa prognostica febrium putridarum in communi sumpta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ab accione lesa sunt tria in genere bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ab accione lesa virtutis vitalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si autem signa trahantur ab actione lesa virtutis vitalis sic fiunt quattuor modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hec igitur de febre putridarum in generali sufficiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Que necesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  est, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut omnia vel plurima in illius mente residerant assidue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  qui ipsas curare methodo vel in ipsis prognosticare racionabiliter attemptat etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Exzerpte aus Liber secundus, Tractatus primus, Capitulum quintum; Druck (Textabgleich mit): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 VD16 B2201}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , fol. CCXIX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  CCXXI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  u.\u246 \'f6.; der gleiche Text jedoch k\u252 \'fcrzer auch auf 209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (s.u.). }

