\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Extracta ex quodam commento Prima Fen Quarti Canonis Avicennae. (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Febris est calor extraneus accensus in corde}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Queritur utrum febrium quedam sit morbus et quedam accidens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dicunt aliqui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Notando, quod febris egritudinalis est illa inter quam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Queritur utrum tamen tria sunt genera febrium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Respondit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Avicenna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod sic probat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quia tamen tria genera sunt in corpore nostro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Queritur qualis humor est putrescilibis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 videmus probatur quia ibi colera regitur a natura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Respondetur ut patet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa cottidianam laxativum competens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 potest dari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cum brodio caulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Extracta ex quodam commento Prime Fen Quarti Canone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Exzerpte und Quaestionen aus einem nicht n\u228 \'e4her genannten {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Kommentar}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Avicenna}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Canon medicinae; vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 551}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; am Schlu\u223 \'df kurzes Rezept. }

