\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\fs26\chcbpat17 Mu\u7717 ?ammad Ibn-Zakar\u299 \'eey\u257 \'e2 R\u257 \'e2z\u299 \'ee}}\plain \f2\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber nonus Almansoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  cum commentario {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardi de Solo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipiunt rubrice huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  De cephalea et emigranea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 95\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  De dolore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  que fit in extrinsecis membris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text beginnt: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De Cephalea capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quando rubedo et censio et gravendo in facie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 oculis cum istis affuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et si non suffecerint ex ungentis quinto de paralisi inunguentur donec sanetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar beginnt: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rubrica generalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 huius noni Almansoris est talis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Incipit pars nona Almansoris de egritudinibus contra gentibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  a capite usque ad pedes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sunt notanda duo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod iste liber vocatur Almansor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Circa rubricam de dolore capitis est sciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod vi sunt nomina dolori capitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ista est nona pars huius libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in qua determinant egritudines a capite ad pedes et primo de dolore capitis provenientis ex sanguine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Kommentar endet: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et si hoc non sufficit recurramus ad dicta in capitulo de paralisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et sic est finis huius lecture abbreviate anno seculo cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 mo\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  xix\u176 \'b0.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Geraldus de Solo supra Nonum Almansorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend nachgetragenes Rezept. \endash  Auf den Blattr\u228 \'e4ndern und Schaltzetteln h\u228 \'e4ufig Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge, meist Rezepte; die Datierung am Schlu\u223 \'df wohl aus der Vorlage \u252 \'fcbernommen (s.o. Geschichte); vgl. Carmody, Arabic Sciences, 1956, S. 135 \endash  136, bes. S. 135, Nr. 3.c.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 220, 1366, 1170}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Robles, Manuscritos, 1965, S. 413 \endash  414, Nr. 5; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 4 (2014), Sp. 298 (V. Recio Mu\u241 \'f1oz); Druck: Geraldus de Solo, Practica \u8230 \'85 super nono Almansoris\u8230 \'85 Lyon 1504. }

