\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Tabulae computisticae (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tabula Garlandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cyclus concurrenciorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 litere dominicales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 litere bisextilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cyclus solaris secundum Dionisium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; f\u252 \'fcr die Jahre 1044, 1072, 1100, 1128, 1154, 1184, 1212, 1240, 1268, 1296, 1324, 1352, 1360, 1409, 1436, 1464, 1492, 1520, 1544; (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tabelle}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zur Bestimmung beweglicher Feste f\u252 \'fcr die Zeitabschnitt Septuagesimae, Quadragesimae, Paschae, Rogationum; Pentecostem. 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Tabelle \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 eclypsis Lunae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  f\u252 \'fcr die Jahre 1280 \endash  1309 (Nachtrag). Zum Computus des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerlandus Computista}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  vgl. Alfred Lohr (Hrsg), Der Computus Gerlandi: Edition, \u220 \'dcbersetzung und Erl\u228 \'e4uterungen, Stuttgart 2013; (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula terminorum cum expositio. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hec prima tabula tabula terminorum dicitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quoniam in illa termini quandoque festorum mobilium per ordinem inveniuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quandoque per clavem prius celebrari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quam deberet septem diebus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula principalis Garlandi cum expositio. (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula. (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Expositio. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De secunda tabula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec secunda tabula principalis tabula Garlandi dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  cuius longitudo per 58 distinctiones protenditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et modo formatur quoniam per tot annos s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <...>\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et una linea in deorsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Contra tabula cum expositio. (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula. (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Expositio. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De tercia Tabula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hiis itaque determinatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  si quinque festa mobilia invenire volueris ad tabulam in oppositio huic respondentem transeas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 omnia predictam per ordinem inveniuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad inveniendum literam tabularem artificaliter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad artificialem littere tabularis inventionem presciantur duo litterarum tabularum abecedaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et semper littera tabularis erit circa quam litera dominicalis occurrit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula ad inveniendum, in quo signo sit Luna quolibet anni. Expositio. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec tabulua docet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in quo signo sit Luna secundum naturalem Lunem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in quo Luna est in Ianuario et sic de ceteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. zu (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 607}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; die Tafeln ab 201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  durchg\u228 \'e4ngig mit Erl\u228 \'e4uterungen ihrer Anwendung; \u228 \'e4hnlich auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Br\u252 \'fcgge, Stb, Cod. 521}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Mainz, Stb, Hs I 613}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Oxford, Bodleian Library, Ms. Ashmole 342}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 152-3; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Toledo, Biblioteca de la Santa Iglesia Catedral, 98-28}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[4].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tournai, Biblioth\u232 \'e8que de la Ville, Cod. 87}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  bis auf Federprobe (Rechenbeispiel, \u228 \'e4hnlich auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[5].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 780}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) leer. }

