\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gregorius VIII. Papa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Forma dictandi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (207\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit tractatus domini Alberti sancte Romane ecclesie cancellarii promodus Gregori pape viii de stilo Romani dictaminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cursus dictaminis Romane curie taliter observandus est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si incipias versum a dictione dissillaba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 bene currit dactulis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et tota serie litterarum sepimus repetatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit tressillaba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Tore Janson, Prose Rhythm in Medieval Latin From the 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  to the 13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Century, Stockholm 1975 (Acta Universitatis Stockholmiensi, Studia Latina Stockholmiensia, Bd. 20), S. 118 \endash  119; vgl. ebenda, S. 92 \endash  98; A. Dalzell, (Hrsg.), The "Formula dictandi" Attributed to Albert of Morro, in: Mediaeval Studies, 39 (1977), S. 440 \endash  465; vgl. Polak, Letter Treatises, 1993 \endash  2015, Bd. 3 (2015), S. 371; vgl. Hamesse/ Szyler, Repertorium, 2007 \endash  2010, Bd. 1, S. 658, Nr. 10967.}

