151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

