\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Segen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und Beschw\u246 \'f6rungen, \u252 \'fcberwiegend lat. (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 1. Gegen Feinde. (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sanctus Augustinus fecit hanc oracionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in si quis eam supra se portaverit vel cottidie dixerit nullus hostis ei nocebit nec mala morte morietur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Deus propicius esto mihi peccatori et sis custos mei omnibus diebus vite mee}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et mitte michi sanctum Michaelem archangelum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui defendat me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 salvator mundi salvum me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 fac famulum tuum Johannem N. per crucem et sanguinem tuum redemisti mundum auxiliare mihi deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Crux Christi protege me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 2. Segen gegen Waffen. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hude mois mich got behoiden vur allen wapen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...; (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 3. Um Gottesfrieden. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hude up stain ich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in godes vreden gain ich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 4. Um Gottes Schutz. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Here\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ich bevele mich hude in dinen heilgen sagene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 5. Gegen Waffen. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dextera domini fecit virtutem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dextera domini exaltavit me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 vulneribus quinis protegat me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Adiuro vos gladios et omne genus armorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut nec ego nec mei fautores per vos gladios tornamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 6. Um Gottes Schutz. (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Dominus conservet me et unificet me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in presencia corporis et sanguinis tui domine Jesu Christi commedo tibi me famulum tuum Johannem etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut per virtutem sancte cruces et per misterium sancte incarnacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nativitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 passionis, resurrecionis et ad celos affeccionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...; 7. (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Dito. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Per nomine sanctum tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per sanctam trinitatem tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per dilectam genitricem tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per novem ordines angelorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 custodi me dormientem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 protege me vigilantem et libera me ab omnibus periculis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) 8. Inspiratio Innocentii Papae. (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec est inspiracio Innocencii pape a deo super omnes legentes vel portantes literam de subscriptam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quam regi Karolo misit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quo deus verbum formavit et de virgine gloriosissima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui deum in utero portavit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 concede pro nobis propicius impetrat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 a quot anime sint utilia et deo grata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . 9. (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Epistola Leonis papa transmisit Karolo regi. (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Jesus autem transiens per mediorum et illorem ibat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec est epistola salvatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quam Leo papa transmisit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Karalo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 regi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quicumque eam secum portaverit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Crux Christi sit mecum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hoc crux Christi ewangelium sit michi pax\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 salus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sanitas et adiutorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nunc dimittis servuum tuum domine secundum verbum tuum in pace\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia viderit oculi mei salutare tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quod parasti ante faciem omnium populorum lumine ad revelacionem gencium et gloriam plebis tue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Israel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gloria filii etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rex Jaspar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 rex Melchior\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 rex Balthasar rogo ter vos per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 singula nomina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 reges Arabum et Saba dona adducent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oremus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deus illuminator omnium gencium da populis tuis perpetua pace\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 gaude et illud lumine splendidum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 infunde cordibus nostris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod trium magorum mentibus aspirasti dominum nostrum Jesum Christum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Mehrfach (z.B. 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) wird ein \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 famulus tuus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Johannes N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . als Segensempf\u228 \'e4nger genannt; weitere Beschw\u246 \'f6rungen und Segen auf  69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 217\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

