\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Aristoteles}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Secretum secretorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Prologus sive Epistula ad Alexandrum, lat. (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Domine Ghertrudi Hispaniarum regine Johannes salutem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum de utilitate corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 olim tractaremus et a me ac si essem medicus vestra nobilitas quereret brevem libellum de observacione dietarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hoc opus exiguum regi princeps medicorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Scripsit Allexandro servat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia non opus est homicidum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Contra febris scribe in plumbum has dictiones \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et est experimentum verissimum deus omnipotens libera nos ab omni mala\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Vgl. Lacombe, Aristoteles Latinus, 1955 \endash  1957, Bd. 1, S. 93, 196, Nr. 597; Pars Posterior Nr. 1502, 1755; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 291}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Schmitt/ Knox, Pseudo-Aristoteles Latinus, 1985, S. 54 \endash  75. }

