6 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe Saturnum calcinatum et dissolve eum in aqua ferri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de illo fac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut inferius dicetur processus ulterior\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gotha, FB, Chart. B 1156}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

