\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  minoris Astronomie, lat. (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus minoris Astronomie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quamvis in Alchimia in mensa sit profunditas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ad intelligendum ipsam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia philosophi propter magnam avariciam scire huius occultaverunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  scilicet quia amice carissime promisi tibi et tu compendium queris breviter tibi de sublimationibus et preparacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 scias amice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod ego ipsum non probavi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26   ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Extrahi tibi hoc compendium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 multos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 labores tollent et expressis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tractatus 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  de preparcione corporum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Post tractatum quatuor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 spiritus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 preparacione corporum sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Est igitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sciendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod preparacio corporum currit secundum quatuor modos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quorum primus est calcinacio ipsorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et non dixit tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quem corporum calcinare cum quibus speciebus miscere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 debeant ad faciendum elixir\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia de illis mixturis et pondere mixturam inveniens omnis libros plenos scilicet non invenies modos preparacionis corporum sic aperte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Finis huius parve philosophie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Aus dem Text geht nicht hervor, wer Autor und Empf\u228 \'e4nger des Werkes sind; zum Initium vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 1164}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

