\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Contemplatio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  super Librum Luminum, lat. (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item contemplare Librum Luminum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in principio et ibi invenies de spiritu Iovis et eius preparacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota hic declaracionem supra scriptorum versuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Iupiter est levissimum corporum et debet calcinari}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (178\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De preparacione et calcinatione Iovis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Accipe quantum vis et dissolve\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 infunde et extinge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Preparacio Attinkar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs26 \u218 \'da\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (denarius ?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 salis nitri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  salis communis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota de melle distillato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Mel distillatum auffert ardorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De albacio sulfuris. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe sulfur tritum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Oleum Saturni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cerusa si ponatur in aceto distillato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Illud vocatur oleum plumbi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Wohl Exzerpte aus einem gr\u246 \'f6\u223 \'dferen Zusammenhang.}

