\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Sammlung \u252 \'fcberwiegend alchemistischer Texte und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rezepte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lat (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig). Enthalten u.a.: (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tinckar decani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Calcinacio Iovis secundum Rosarium; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rezepte unter Verwendung von \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Bufo viridis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Magister Eustachius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tinctura per aquam fortem:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 datus est mihi Leonardo Rome\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quem ibidem cum magistro Eustachio laboram et iuveni vir esse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tordonis de Prisilia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Augmentum Solis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ... probatum per me Leonardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rudgerus de Campo Floris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Augmentum Solis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Magister Rudolf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Rubificatio Solis perpetua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De Lapide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; anschlie\u223 \'dfend Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge einer sp\u228 \'e4teren Hand. \endash  Anfang und Schlu\u223 \'df fehlen. }

