100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Paulo Goltslager}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in Lien\u223 \'df sibi data pie memorie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ambo suo mortius longe tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (318\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Boczlingen Bertoldus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  <...> \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Berelt Kerle}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pferner zcu Boeczlingen est magister in arte alkhimica;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Contra pestilenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 anno xciiii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (1494); (319\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Contra pestilenciam optimum de Colonia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (319\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) drei deutsche Praktiken zum Fischfang; (320\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) alchemistische Rezepte, lat. }

