\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 336\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De reductione corporum in eorum primam materiam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , lat., unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig. (336\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item omnia scripta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que secuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 potestis intelligere de reductione corporum perfectorum in eorum primam materiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Item legitur in Turba Philosophorum, quod}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quidquid \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 constat veritatis in arte alchimica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 est magne humidum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sicco et sic homo ab omnibus philosophis concedatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 per humidum potestis intelligere spiritum id est Mercurii ab omni suedicie et prosicco intelligatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (336\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Coagulare est spiritum in naturam corporis convertem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (342\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod est vapor humidus et vuctuosus id est Mercurii philosophorum et es sapientium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (343\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic compleantur plurima dicta philosophorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Gravum corporis perfecti prostervitur in mortem et totaliter mortificatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et eius corpus retinet spiritum et spritus corpus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic corpus imperfectum habet liquefieri in suam primam materiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Purgacio Mercuris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe calcem unam quantum vis et dissolve ipsum in aqua calida et hanc aquam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <...>. \endash  Text endet unvermittelt; Schlu\u223 \'df fehlt aufgrund des Verlustes von drei Bl.; (336\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) nachgetragenes Kurzrezept: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dedit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Albrecht Janwer}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  pictor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

