\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Conradus de Hildensee}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Versus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de secreta alchemiae. >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Cogitur exire spiritus de corpore Jovis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tunc ora pro me feci nam talia pro te. Recepta Gerardi in carmine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 230}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 4225}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; anschlie\u223 \'dfend (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) nachgetragene Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Rezepte, z.T. von einer Hand des sp\u228 \'e4ten 16. Jhs. }

