\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Raimundus Lullus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De multiplicatione et de liquefactione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De multiplicatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Si autem vis, ut dicti lapides augmentetur in potestate et virtute}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 capies lapides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tuos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Modus liquefactionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Facta calcinacione cuius vis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 corporis volueris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Recipe predictum sal cuius vis cuius vis corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et invenies perfectorum sine fallo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sic enim completa est et perfecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deo gracias \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 sic dictum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quia dicitur oleum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  oleum combustibile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expliciunt declaracionis sive Apertoria Raymundi super testamentum Codocillum et Vade mecum de numero philosophorum cum aliis libris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  pluribus eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

