\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Raimundus Lullus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Liber Mercuriorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpte. (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Composicio aquis potabilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sit de sangwine fixato a natura ad confortandum humorem radicalem humanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Recipe aquam, quam supra diximus, que habet potestatem dissolvendum auris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De mutatione unius regionis ad aliam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quando volueris mutare de uno loco ad alium vel terram et velis portare dictum medicinam tecum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et quando de ea volueris administrare leproso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 da ei cum aqua frigida communi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et intoxicato cum vino albo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Enthalten sind die Kapitel 18 \endash  26; Text auch auf 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; (s.u.) vgl. Thorndike, History, 1923 \endash  1958, Bd. 4 (1934/ Reprint 1966), S. 619 \endash  652, S. 643 \endash  644; Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 335kv.); Mohan, Initia, 1975 \endash  1978, (1976), S. 151*; Pereira, Alchemical Corpus, 1989 (s.o. 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 83 \endash  84, Nr. I.61d und S. 87, Nr. II.8; Druck (Textabgleich mit): Raimundus Lullus, Mercuriorum Liber, K\u246 \'f6ln (Johannes Brinckmann) 1567, S. 33 \endash  40, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 VD16: R 154}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

