\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Raimundus Lullus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 De quaestionibus in figurae abstractae ab arborem philosophali}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Tractatus de questionibus figure abstracte ab arborem philosophali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 I)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 n ista parte intendimus solvere questiones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que possunt fieri in arte ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et dabimus doctrinam, quomodo artista huius artis solvere poterit eas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) (D)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 iximus de questionibus figure quadrangularis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Alique quidem sunt branche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  que in quatuor vel sex mensibus fiunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quas poterit invenire artista per operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 latitudinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ut notatur in practica sermocinali etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Auszug aus De secretis naturae (De quinta essentia), Tertia distinctio; vgl. Thorndike, History, 1923 \endash  1958, Bd. 4 (1934/ Reprint 1966), S. 619 \endash  652, S. 649 \endash  651; Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 335lc.); Druck: Raymundi Lulli ... De secretis naturae seu de Quinta essentia liber unus in tres distinctiones divisus, omnibus iam partibus absolutus ... K\u246 \'f6ln (Johannes Birckmann) 1567, S. 316 \endash  355 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 VD16: R 160}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ); Text auch auf 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (s.u.). \endash  108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

