Raymundum Luylli etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Thorndike, History, 1923 \endash  1958, Bd. 4 (1934/ Reprint 1966), S. 619 \endash  652, S. 629; Glorieux, R\u233 \'e9pertoire, Nr. 335lv.); Mohan, Initia, 1975 \endash  1978, (1978), S. 387*; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Thorndike/ Kibre 1963, Sp. 1358}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Pereira, Alchemical Corpus, 1989 (s.o. 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ), S. 65, Nr. I.4. }

