\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Pseudo-){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Raimundus Lullus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  septem rotarum quarum sex sunt volubiles. (230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit Questionarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Prothinus ut ars et scientia tractans transmutatoria}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod in precedenti volumine diximus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (231\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 De figura individuorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et iam lata figura habet rotas septem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 valde utilis est iste tractatus cuicumque de transmutatione mineralium et lapidum disputare volenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nam plura secreta hic explicamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que implicita erant in principiis huius artis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ad laudem dei et utilitatem Christianorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text auch auf 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  zu Sekund\u228 \'e4rliteratur und Drucken (s.o.).}

