\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 \endash  202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Guido de Columnis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Historia Troiana}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prologus super hystoria destructionis Troye composita per Gwidonem iudicem de Columpna Messanensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Et licet Cottidie vetera recentibus obruantur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit liber primus de Peleo rege Thessalie et de aureo vellere et de prodicione conceptu pro iudicem contra Iasonem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In regno Thessalie predicte scilicet pertinenciis Romanie}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Factum est autem presens opus anno dominice incarnacionis millesimo ducentesimo octuagesimo septimo eiusdem prime indictionis feliciter terminavi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 de quo fine deus gloriosus sit benedictus cum gloriosa suo matre et tota curia celest\plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 ius\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (verbessert zu:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  celesta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in seculorum secula amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Et sic est finis presentis hystoria \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Troyana \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  per me Iohannem Tremonie collectum in Enbeck a reverendissimo baculario Bertoldo de Paderborne sub anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  lx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  in Die Martis ante Reminiscere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (4. M\u228 \'e4rz 1460)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  infra horam primam et secundam post prandium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Druck: Nathaniel Edward Griffin (Hrsg.), Guido de Columnis. Historia Destructionis Troiae, Cambridge/ Mass. 1936, (The Mediaeval Academy of America, Publication No. 26), S. 3 \endash  276; zur Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung vgl. ebenda S. xii und xiv; VL(2), Bd. 1 (1978), Sp. 1101 \endash  1104 (Karin Schneider); C.A.L.M.A, Bd. 4 (2014), S. 528 \endash  530 (A. Bisanti). \endash  202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Besitzvermerk (s.o. Geschichte)}

