\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippus de Bergamo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Speculum Regiminis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  sive Cato moralisatus, unvoll\-st\u228 \'e4ndig. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Prolog zu den Tabula. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Omne quodcumque facitis in Verbo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (Col 3, 17). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Doctor egregius >Augustinus< volens divini auxilij necessitatem in humanis actibus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  declarare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 in eodem prato querit bos herbam, canis leporem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ciconia lacertam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Tabula. Alphabetisch geordnetes Verzeichnis der Lemmata. (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Prologus in Speculum Regiminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Illustris industrie ac gran-\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dis benivolencie speculo Francisco novello genito excelsi et magnifici domini mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Pars prohemialis. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Distinctio libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Cum animadverterem quam plurimos homines graviter extrahere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quia presens opus Speculum Regiminis quo advertusque hominis reformationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 >Incipit pars prosaicalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primum autoris preceptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Itaque deo supplica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Expeditis quatuor partibus prohemialibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 nunc circa tractatum est attendendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit magna additio secunde partis libri regiminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si deus est animus nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ut carmina dicunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 hic tibi precipue sit pura mente colendus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit prima [pars] metricalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Si deus est animus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut nobis carmina dicunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...<. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Deum esse et perfectum esse fides catholica attestatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit magna addicio tercie partis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Telluris si forte velis cognoscere cultus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...< (283\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Uxorem fuge ne ducas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ...<. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Presens autoris preceptum reduci potest ad quintum deca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 - (284\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 logi preceptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (285\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text bricht ab: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quo ad secundum dicendum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod repudium fiebat ex indebita causa sed divorcium ex debita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u9553 \'a6 <repudium fuit permissum hoc autem concessum ...>. \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Disticha Catonis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  mit dem Kommentar des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippus de Bergamo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und Ausz\u252 \'fcgen aus dem Kommentar des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Robertus de Euremodio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Text bricht aufgrund von Blattverlust in \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 preceptum xiiii. tertiae partis metricalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ab; Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 06278 \endash  06280}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Textabgleich mit GW 06279); Boas/ Botschuyver, Disticha Catonis, 1952 (ohne Kommentar); zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Philippus de Bergamo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (\u8224 \'861380) vgl. Welter, L'exemplum, 1927, S. 194 \endash  196; Zumkeller, Manuskripte, 1966, S. 211, Nr. 435; au\u223 \'dferdem: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/ Guyot, Incipits, Nr. 1048, 2222, 3615, 5528}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; Newhauser/ Bejczy, Bloom\-field, 2008, Nr. 1048, 2222, 3615, 5528; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 3551, 12204, 17703}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Schaller/ K\u246 \'f6nsgen, Initia carminum, 1977}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  und Supplement (2005), jeweils{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17  Nr. 15020}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer. }

