\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Alexander de Nevo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Consilia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  contra Judeos foenerantes. (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primum consilium domini Alexandri de Nevo Vincentini iuris utriusque doctoris contra Iudeos fenerantes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 In nomine domini nostri Jesu Christi eiusque gloriosissime matris virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  gloriosi doctoris Hieronymi ceterorum doctorum ecclesie totiusque celestis curie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 In casu, in quo requisitus fui, ut consilium edam sola dubia designabo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 peccant et offendunt ius naturale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  divinum et canonicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Laus deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ex litteris reverendissimi domini Francisci cardinalis Venetiarum sancte Romane ecclesie vicecancelarii et episcopi Veroniensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Sed quoad materiam Iudeorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pro quibus conducendis licentiam petitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Verum auctoritatem absolvendi communitatem super ea re de preterito vicario nostro transmittimus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW 00894}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (N\u252 \'fcrnberg, Friedrich Creussner, 1479); zu dem Paduaner Kanonisten {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Alexander de Nevo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (\u8224 \'861484) vgl. Schulte, Bd. 2, S. 330 \endash  331, Nr. 1; C.A.L.M.A., Bd, 1,2 (2000), S. 173, bes. Nr. 2 (Simona Polidori); Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Leiden, BU, D\rquote Ablaing 33}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Rom, BN, Vitt. Em. 296}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 196\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . }

