\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes de Lutrea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Tractatus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  sive collatio synodalis de statutis ecclesiarum, Exzerpt. (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequuntur quedam extracta de quodam sermone synodali habito Moguntie per quendam licentiatum dictum \plain \f1\i\strike\lang1033\fs26 de Lutria\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  Joannem de Lutria anno 1471\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quidam distinguunt duplicia symoniaca, dicentes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  quod quendam sunt symoniaca quia prohibita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 alia prohibita quia symoniaca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 non amplius de institii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  et c. periculosa de sta. regula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 [rum]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  libro vi\u176 \'b0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 GW M14303}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. Joachim Vennebusch, Zeitkritische Schriften des Mainzer Dompredigers Johannes de Lutrea (gest. 1479) in einem Kodex aus seinem Besitz, in: Archiv f\u252 \'fcr mittelrheinische Kirchengeschichte 52 (2000), S. 55 \endash  97; VL(2), Bd. 11, (2004), Sp. 784 \endash  788, bes. Sp. 786, Nr. 3a (Joachim Ott); Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 K\u246 \'f6ln, HistASt, Best. 7004 (Handschriften (GB quart)), 81}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 .}

