\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  Determinatio de non dandis et exigendis pactionibus et cautionibus pro missis vel anniversariis perpetuis, lat.-dt. (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec sunt scripta et determinata per venerabiles dominos doctores sacre theologie ac utriusque iuris nominatim infra expressos super non dandis et exigendis cautionibus pactionariis pro missis vel anniversariis perpetuis seu quibuscunque huiusmodi servitiis spiritualibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 occasione cuiusdam casus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui sequitur et est talis. Casus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Item}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 testamentator in ultima sua voluntate voluit et fide commisit suis executoribus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ut missam perpetuam in domo cruciferorum pro salute anime sue et suorum celebrandam disponere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tenor clausule testamenti sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 wolde der selve N. ind hay\u776 ?t bevalen ind bescheyden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 dat syn truwehender ey\u776 ?n erffmisse y\u776 ?n dem gaitshuy\u776 ?sse tzo dem Cruy\u776 ?tzbroederen bestellen ind berenten sullen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Pro decisionibus questionis et sue materie ponantur primo aliqua argumento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 secundo essent considerationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 tertio correlarium responsium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Arguitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod cruciferi non possunt huiusmodi redditus annos pro missa perpetuo celebrantur acceptare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Que voluntas testamentatorum presumpta magna expectanda est in fide comisso predicto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 l. heredes mei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 \u167 \'a7 tum ita ff ad trebel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 l. cum virum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 c. de fide co\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Es folgen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gutachten}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  von zahlreichen Professoren der theologischen und juristischen Fakult\u228 \'e4t der Universit\u228 \'e4t K\u246 \'f6ln. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ex predictis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 clare insertur correlarium responsium questionis supradicte videlicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod cruciferi non tenentur nec possunt supradictam cautionem bona consciencia executoribus prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et hoc sufficere debet executoribus nec ulteriorem cautionem vel promissionem possunt a cruciferis exigere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec premissa prima determinatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 seu decisio questionis preposite facta est per venerabilem ac religiosum patrem magistrum Henricum de Piro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ordinis Carthusiensis legum doctorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 < ... (172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ut supra deductum et allegatum est videtur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 cum talis cautionis prestatio in casu presenti sit a iure reprobatum ut clarissime deductum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Per venerabilem magistrum Ludolphum de Hoy\u776 ?rn in decretis licentiatium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Testamentsklausel (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , s.o.) zur Stiftung einer Messe bei den Kreuzherren mit anschlie\u223 \'dfendem Gutachten von Professoren, Doktoren und Lizentiaten der theologischen und juristischen Fakult\u228 \'e4t der Universit\u228 \'e4t K\u246 \'f6ln, ob dies zul\u228 \'e4ssig sei; an Personen werden genannt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Henricus de Piro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Heinrich von dem Birnbaum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \u8224 \'861473); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes episcopus Venecomponensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Johannes Schlechter, episcopus Venecopolis/ Venecompis, \u8224 \'861457); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bartholomeus ordinis Carthusiensis prior in Ruremunda}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 (Bethlehem Mariae in Roermond/ NL); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Henricus de Xanctis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Henricus de Bomel d. \u196 \'c4., \u8224 \'861454); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arnoldus de Spina}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (van Doorn, \u8224 \'861445); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Andreas de Werdena}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 pastor ecclesie s. Lupi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[6].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Arnoldus de Clotingen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (\u8224 \'861461); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[7].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Gerardus de Monte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 canonicus ecclesie s. Andree\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[8].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Tinctoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (\u8224 \'861469); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[9].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Paulus de Gerisheim}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 canonicus ecclesie s. Marie ad Gradus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[10].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Wynandus Spoer}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ordinis Augustinensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[11].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Johannes Rotiken}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Ordinis Fratrum Minorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[12].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Petrus de Nova ecclesia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[13].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Bernardus de Galen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 canonicus s. Marie ad Gradus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[14].4100/?u"}{\fl