\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dionysius Cartusianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Contra simoniam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  liber primus. (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rab\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 An ab ingredientibus religionem aliquid possit rumpi aut exigi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Auctore Dionisio Chartusiano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Text: (G)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 ratis accepistis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 gratis date\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (Mt 10, 8). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Filius dei dominus et salvator, cuius tanta est charitas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  tanta liberalitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui cum patre eterno et spiritu sancto unus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  deus ac dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  unus creator omnipotens iustusque iudex et super omnia sublimis et benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Druck: Dionysius Cartusianus, Opera omnia, Bd. 39, Tournai 1910, S. 285 \endash  305; vgl. Emery, Dionysius Cartusianus, 1991, S. 242 \endash  243, Nr. 117; VL(2), Bd. 2 (1980), Sp. 166 \endash  178 (M. A. Schmitt); C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 3,1 (2009), S. 88 \endash  94, bes. S. 89, Nr. 9 (E. Chiti); Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 79}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , vgl. DA ULB Kat. 5,2; zur Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung vgl. Emery (s.o.); au\u223 \'dferdem {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Wien, \u214 \'d6NB, Cod. 4931}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1a. }

