\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Dionysius Cartusianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Contra pluralitatem beneficiorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , Exzerpt aus Articulus 10. (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Nota aliqua contra pluralitate beneficiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Vitium avaritie est eterne saluti contrarium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Multipliciter ostendi potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Primo sit ad eum tria distinguantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  operationum nostrarum principia scilicet natura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 gracia et vitium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (213\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Item ridiculum est matrimonium contrahere spe ponendi vicarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Et qui hoc facit videtur incidisse in illam male\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 -\u9553 \'a6 \endash  Text endet unvermittelt; Exzerpt aus Artikel 10; Druck: Dionysius Cartusianus, Opera omnia, Bd. 39, Tournai 1910, S. 265 \endash  266; vgl. Emery, Dionysius Cartusianus, 1991, S. 242, Nr. 116; weitere Lit. s.o. 190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

