\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Michael Francisci de Insulis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quodlibet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  de veritate fraternitatis rosarii. (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quodlibet de veritate fraternitatis Rosarii seu Psalterii beate Marie virginis conventus Coloniensis Ordinis Predicatorum pronunciatum Colonie in scolis arcium tempore quolibetorum anno m. cccc lxxvi per fratrem Michaelem de Insulis sacre theologie professorem eiusdem ordinis renovatumque postea per eundem anno lxxix sequenti propter certas causas in prologo contentas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Incipit feeliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (!). Rubrik Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Q)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 uia determinatio illa, quam de nostra Rosarii beatissime virginis fraternitate}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26  ad ipsius virginis laudem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) Rubrik: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Sequitur questionis titulus pretacti quodlibeti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . Text: (C)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 um David dicat:\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Particeps ego sum omnium timencium te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (Ps 118, 63). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Quid necesse fuit de beate Marie Rosario fraternitatem instituere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \u8230 \'85(229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Tertium est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quod multi contra hanc fraternitatem peccant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et sic tandem meritis eiusdem virginis ad gloriam pervenire valeamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hec sunt dulcissima et melliflua virgo Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 que sentio de tua salutatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et fraternitate pretacta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 et pro quibus omnibus dictis et scriptis peto mihi et omnibus de tua fraternitate succurrere digneris in extrema vite hora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \endash  Text mit Prolog, aber ohne Quodlibetum secundum et tertium sowie Annex; Druck: Heribert Christian Scheeben, Michael Francisci ab Insulis O. P., Quodlibet de veritate fraternitatis rosarii, in: Archiv der deutschen Dominikaner 4 (1951), S. 137 \endash  162, bes. S. 137 \endash  159; vgl. Scheeben, ebenda; Axters, Bibliotheca Dominicana Neerlandica, 1970, S. 71 \endash  74, bes. S. 72; Mohan, Initia, 1975 \endash  1978, (1975), S. 74*; Text auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 982}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; vgl. DA LuHB Kat. 1, S. 72 \endash  74; und in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Hs 79}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , 71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , vgl. DA ULB Kat. 5,2. \endash  229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  leer.}

