\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb600\sa360\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 cc\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  \endash  ccxx\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Heinrich von Settimello}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Elegia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . (cc\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Quomodo sola sedet probitas? Flet et ingemit pro aleph}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  ... (ccxx\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Viventis melior\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 quam morientis amor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Hic liber est scriptus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 qui scripsit sit benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit Hainrici liber hic, qui Samariens patriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 miseram huic fuit arte sequens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs26 Explicit pauper Hainricus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 <. \endash  Mit in der Regel interlinearen, lateinischen und deutschen Wortglossen; Druck: PL, Bd. 204, Sp. 843 \endash  868; Aristides Marigo, Henrici Septimellensis Elegia sive De miseria, Padua 1926, S. 29 \endash  60; Zumkeller, Manuskripte, 1966, Nr. 304; Giovanni Cremaschi, Enrico da Settimello, Elegia, Bergamo 1949 (Orbis Christianus. Collana di testi medioevali e umanistici, Bd. 1), S. 26 \endash  94; vgl. ders., Contributo allo studio della tradizione manoscritta di Enrico da Settimello, in: Aevum 23, Fasc. 1/2, (1949), S. 177 \endash  184; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs26\chcbpat17 Walther, Versanf\u228 \'e4nge, Nr. 16339}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 ; C.A.L.M.A., Bd. 5 (2017), Sp. 508 \endash  509 (R. Angelini); Orb\u225 \'e1n, Novus Phisiologus, 1989 (s. Lit.), S. 11; Kohush\u246 \'f6lter, Gregorius, 2012 (s. Lit.), S. 57; Rubel, S\u252 \'fcnder, \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2009 /\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs26 2019 (s. Lit.), S. 41. }

